ean, minimalist design that lets you focus on the puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e- Relaxing, no-pressure gameplay – no timers, just your brain\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hint system to help when you\\u0026#39;re stuck\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you have a few minutes or want a longer challenge, Arrows – Puzzle Escape is the perfect blend of strategy and calm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you clear the grid without losing a single heart?\"],\"Lessmore GmbH\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PM-Y0D8BU6Nx_cjjtw7QnLTilRfGPBoGKJs0BMhEITgJM-v-mXrkcLxf6bfAXrMwjSnG5Lyb7Hn8bBUDZNJBXg\"],null,[254,254,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ecffri.arrows\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ecffri.arrows\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.49 - $40.00 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],