5PPO7260mOh1HfQCQ\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/61fDEUtRpHZrKZUVx8jVwfotTeCq32krpZY7_QTIrlXRebKFQDgTdYme0MCntiRFOfvGMlNqrpeNqwfh0iIg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hM5FHw21KjBc1NaUmhwKlcKkRXYLhAD5bbi1DBfUViMSfVCrJwHMq0b3dpjMdq7XytwbqMnduoH31y67kNZ-\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S69tJHuxnXxDSesz-cjVWfBDhxOgQ4w2d9xVPOwOVzBTe4SI3XzflknWIswkx73PvAo1fZ2fX7xJBFdKndrkIw\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3TPXEir1fszwXmqwA1FNETC2SyQdYbDv-O3xedCSSqRB30ooBy4lKP-kAH1mfn5LMlHB_hCT9mZoIIg3Wv5Urw\"]]],\"Amaze GO!\",[\"4.6\",4.5772276],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\"]],[\"qgJcGloIAkoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLgoYChJjb20ub2FrZXZlci5hcnJvd3MQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Amaze GO! - Puzzle Games. A clean arrows puzzle game built to calm a busy mind. Your goal is simple: guide each arrow out without a collision. The minimalist design cuts visual noise, reduces chaos, and helps you organize thoughts as you play. Plan the order, open paths, and enjoy a quiet flow. No timer. No pressure. Offline anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat makes Amaze GO! - Puzzle Games great\\u003cbr\\u003e- Minimalist arrows puzzle escape that declutters the screen and the mind\\u003cbr\\u003e- Works offline with quick loading and a clean interface that keeps attention on arrows\\u003cbr\\u003e- Calm play loop for smart brains: think clearly, move each arrow with intent\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smooth tap controls, clear path feedback, and satisfying arrow out moments\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hints support focus when the grid feels tight\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to play\\u003cbr\\u003e- Find the arrow with a free path to the edge\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap to pull that arrow out and open space for the next arrows\\u003cbr\\u003e- Plan the order to secure a safe route and a clean arrow out\\u003cbr\\u003e- Avoid blocked taps; a wrong arrow costs a heart for the level\\u003cbr\\u003e- Use hints to highlight a safe arrow when your path is unclear\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clear all arrows to finish the level and aim for a perfect arrow out\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy love this arrow puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple rules, deep strategy, and a mindful arrows puzzle escape\\u003cbr\\u003e- Short breaks or longer sessions that ease stress and sharpen focus\\u003cbr\\u003e- The last arrow out delivers a clear board and a mental reset\\u003cbr\\u003e- Brain training for logic, planning, and spatial thinking\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clean visuals and soft audio that reduce chaos and keep puzzles readable\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAmaze GO! - Puzzle Games is a quiet arrows puzzle escape made for sharp minds and calm moments. Learn fast, then master timing and order. Let each arrow out, clear the grid, and feel disorder turn into clarity. Download now, plan smart paths, keep hearts safe, and enjoy pure focus anytime, anywhere.\"],\"Oakever Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wD29uFjv1CKZqtnCDOALEvoT7IFk9qzN19cGh7eMh1kVT4T5AwcengpEktlbZEid-0tva9Tnd9u3VmODuKmgog\"],null,[250,250,250,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false