,null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zowmaH7hc5Q/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"ROBLOX – GREAT GAMES ACROSS EVERY GENRE. PLAY FREE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe range of games on Roblox is unmatched. Relax with cooking, building and simulator games, or jump into racing, shooter battles, and intense survival games. Explore epic RPG adventures, build empires in tycoon games, compete in sports games, or dive into horror, anime, and multiplayer games with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNew games launch on Roblox every day from a global community of developers, including studios, indie teams, and solo creators building ambitious games across every genre. There is always something new to discover.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart playing some of the most popular games on Roblox today, including Forge, Pixel Quest, World Zero, Scary Shawarma, NFL Universe Football, Gunfight Arena, and K-Pop Demon Hunters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHAT YOU CAN DO ON ROBLOX\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDISCOVER ONLINE MULTIPLAYER GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dive into adventures, role-playing games, simulators, obstacle courses, and more\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore trending experiences and fun, new games daily\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete in multiplayer battles, run your own business, or embark on epic quests\\u003cbr\\u003e- Games may contain lootboxes\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE YOUR OWN AVATAR\\u003cbr\\u003e- Customize your avatar with your favorite clothing, accessories, and hairstyles\\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover thousands of user-created avatar items in the Marketplace\\u003cbr\\u003e- Express yourself with unique animations and emotes\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE TOGETHER—ANYTIME, ANYWHERE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play on mobile, tablet, PC, console, and VR headsets\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hang out and play with friends in multiplayer games across any device\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCHAT AND PLAY WITH PEOPLE YOU KNOW\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join a Party and jump into experiences together\\u003cbr\\u003e- Age verified users can also chat via voice or text\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE, BUILD, AND SHARE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Design games and virtual spaces using Roblox Studio on Windows or Mac\\u003cbr\\u003e- Publish and share your experiences with millions of players\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eINDUSTRY-LEADING SAFETY AND CIVILITY\\u003cbr\\u003e- Advanced content filtering and moderation\\u003cbr\\u003e- Set boundaries with custom parental controls\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clear community guidelines promoting respectful interactions\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dedicated trust \\u0026amp; safety teams working around the clock\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY AND CREATE ON ROBLOX\\u003cbr\\u003e- Immersive 3D multiplayer games and experiences\\u003cbr\\u003e- Safe, inclusive environments for everyone\\u003cbr\\u003e- A platform empowering anyone to become a creator\\u003cbr\\u003e- New content added daily by a global community\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE YOUR OWN EXPERIENCES: https://www.roblox.com/develop\\u003cbr\\u003eSUPPORT: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us\\u003cbr\\u003eCONTACT: https://corp.roblox.com/contact/\\u003cbr\\u003ePRIVACY POLICY: https://www.roblox.com/info/privacy\\u003cbr\\u003ePARENT’S GUIDE: https://corp.roblox.com/parents/\\u003cbr\\u003eTERMS OF USE: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004647846\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLEASE NOTE: A network connection is required. Roblox works best over Wi-Fi.\"],\"Roblox Corporation\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D__1dw4a7Li_h6peAbJyrrkFcAmbHzfJXzm91G6d15tWVPCkpLaPpQHjp8p1sJcvSGI\"],null,[5,4,5,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Diverse Content: Discretion Advised\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Gam