leWZwWUaDGnbVYLRr5yI\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XGLPlcQ44C0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"The Simpsons are here! Hit GO! Roll the dice with the Simpsons family and many other beloved Springfielders! Earn MONOPOLY money, interact with your friends, family members and fellow Tycoons from around the world as you explore the expanding universe of MONOPOLY GO - now featuring Springfield\\u0026#39;s finest, including the Simpson family (Homer, Marge, Bart, Lisa, and Maggie), Mr. Burns, Krusty, and many more! It’s the new way to play - board flipping cleanup not required!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover Springfield! Unlock new maps! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEscape, enjoy, dream, scheme and stay in touch with this newly reimagined Simpsons twist on MONOPOLY! Let everyone\\u0026#39;s favorite zillionaire, Mr. MONOPOLY, be your guide as you enjoy your favorite Simpsons moments as you visit your favorite places in Springfield from Krustyland to the Power Plant. Feel like you\\u0026#39;re part of the story as you play!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSo MONOPOLY GO!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience classic fun and visuals with gameplay fit for your phone! Collect Properties, build Houses and Hotels, pull Chance Cards, and of course, earn that MONOPOLY Money! Play with your favorite game Tokens such as the Racecar, Top Hat, Battleship, and more. Earn more tokens as you go - your favorite Simpsons character might be one! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSee MONOPOLY icons like Mr. M, Scottie and Ms. MONOPOLY come to life, and brand new characters too!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour Family Table!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHelp or hinder! - You and friends can earn easy money with Community Chest and co-op events! Or heist their banks to help yourself get to the top. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Springfield Monorail has arrived!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect and trade story-filled stickers with friends and family and in our MONOPOLY GO! Facebook Trading Groups! Complete the Simpsons-themed album for huge rewards! Win sticker sets that celebrate some of your favorite stories from the Simpsons. Own your own little piece of Springfield. Collect stickers of your favorite Springfield characters and places. Each sticker set tells a funny little story.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUY \\u0026amp; BUILD YOUR WAY TO THE TOP\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect Property Tile Sets to build Houses and upgrade your Houses to Hotels to get even more rent from friends! All you have to do is hit GO! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eENJOY THAT CLASSIC MONOPOLY ATMOSPHERE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRoll the dice to enjoy the classic MONOPOLY board you know and love. Featuring familiar faces such as MR. MONOPOLY, and familiar spaces such as jail (womp womp!), Railroads, Properties, Tokens and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY WITH FRIENDS AND FAMILY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet social! Play with friends to take full advantage of new Simpsons-themed mini-games such as Community Chest – where you and friends take a break from mischief and work together! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNEW OPPORTUNITIES EVERY DAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Tournaments, the Prize Drop plinko mini-game, the Cash Grab mini-game and follow our Events for big rewards. With The Simpsons entering the world of MONOPOLY GO! mini-games take you on adventures into such places as Krustylu Studios, or Itchy and Scratchy\\u0026#39;s world.  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMONOPOLY GO! is free to play, though some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. Internet connection is required to play the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe MONOPOLY name and logo, the distinctive design of the game board, the four corner squares, the MR. MONOPOLY name and character, as well as each of the distinctive elements of board and playing pieces are trademarks of Hasbro, Inc. for its property trading game and game equipment. © 1935, 2023 Hasbro.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://scopely.com/privacy/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: http://scopely.com/tos/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAdditional Information, Rights, and Choices Available to California Players: https:scopely.com/privacy/#additionalinfo-california\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy installing this game you agree to the terms of the license agreements.\"],\"Scopely\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-dbfN8cWmtTinOs0VBvDkydmht5vTa54433UbRrG1gvuzoX9DRTVN3HETTAZ7jbtE-2vtsWJOPjyDT0Vxcfe5Q\"],null,[232,140,159,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.scopely.monopolygo\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.scopely.monopolygo\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $199.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Board\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"City\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.colorrful.sunny.sodda.sort\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UlGZSUVBdF7xAdaMaJtYpMt-OXyrttxW6__fSf6XZdMmQ-ySWl6VBHeSjEEtw4WByPlPtagzJNanC3F_EDFR\"],null,[22,44,141,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J9Jklg4EGcAvUdClkSbJHWBPpghZmoKdxY1QCaWFR17vgQl8P0isF7UFTQfO_zmm8kKWXcFWk_h45wQF4ZOvQxI\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Oo1uM7nQyTIaRjb7TnkXr26RJjHg7wO8o6fTfdQy2ZaVI4sW0W_Nge-9R8UG6eAUPQ_jkC3LiaRcDx6EtTab\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CuMNV3SasAp-Q6zyr-L13pw9B3QfLRqohPa3K7ReNJP1B28STJa-CtRpotAhi_MaRnk1RmQW8d6Brg2YOrnxtBk\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IjXsQirzuWTo0ZsdDrHoBGhxocp9jUrmGG3eOSmsTLdLrJSktP0lbBpI0NfOD0JEfuRzFMDKmblGR01NWkr0-zw\"]]],\"Colorful Soda Sort\",[\"4.2\",4.2440352],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.colorrful.sunny.sodda.sort\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.colorrful.sunny.sodda.sort\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.colorrful.sunny.sodda.sort\"]],[\"qgJoGmYICkoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgokCh5jb20uY29sb3JyZnVsLnN1bm55LnNvZGRhLnNvcnQQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Why Choose Colorful Soda Sort?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBrain Training\\u003cbr\\u003eSort sodas and solve puzzles at the same time. Train your logic and observation skills while having fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStress Relief\\u003cbr\\u003eTap the bottles and watch colorful sodas flow smoothly. Release pressure and relax instantly in a calm, satisfying way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisual \\u0026amp; Audio Pleasure\\u003cbr\\u003eVibrant soda colors + realistic bottle clinking sounds + immersive background music \\u003d full sensory enjoyment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Game Highlights\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eConstantly updated soda-sort levels and limited-time events bring you fresh challenges and never get boring.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eProgressive Difficulty\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom easy beginner stages to tricky hidden-bottle challenges, difficulty rises gradually — friendly for new players, exciting for experts.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHighly Immersive\\u003cbr\\u003eRealistic soda flow effects and crisp, satisfying sound effects make every move fun and addictive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Play \\u0026amp; Strategy\\u003cbr\\u003eOne-Tap Easy Control\\u003cbr\\u003eSimply tap to pour sodas. Intuitive and simple to play anytime, anywhere for instant relaxation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse Empty Bottles Smartly\\u003cbr\\u003ePlan your moves with empty bottles to unlock new strategies and beat hard levels easily.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠 Useful Boosters\\u003cbr\\u003eRemove\\u003cbr\\u003eLower difficulty instantly and break through tough levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUndo\\u003cbr\\u003eMade a mistake? Go back one step safely and keep playing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExtra Empty Bottle\\u003cbr\\u003eA game-changer in critical moments — helps you clear stages smoothly.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Download Colorful Soda Sort Now ✨\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax in a world of colorful sodas. Use logic and wisdom to unlock endless levels!\"],\"Space Kraft Media\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TPp_cvZf_4R_Wo9fAWXnGAeLFyxsQ7l6M_50OlF9xXnigtI7PA1s3yq_14ssibVRpZEvwHv0AjijfEwEKuiN\"],null,[45,163,218,255]]