d\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIEEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPgooCiJjb20ucHV6emxlZ2FtZXMucHV6emxlYnJpY2tzbGVnZW5kEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"A fresh twist on the classic block puzzle game you already love. Relax, train your brain, and enjoy hours of addictive gameplay anytime, anywhere. Whether you have 2 minutes or 2 hours, Color Block: Combo Blast is the perfect companion.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDrag \\u0026amp; Drop the blocks into the board.\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch full lines vertically or horizontally to clear them.\\u003cbr\\u003eKeep the board clean to score higher.\\u003cbr\\u003eBlocks cannot be rotated – so think carefully!\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay without time limits at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Choose Color Block: Combo Blast?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple but Addictive Gameplay – easy to learn, hard to put down.\\u003cbr\\u003eBeautiful Themed Design – clean, relaxing, and modern style.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Anywhere – no WiFi or internet needed.\\u003cbr\\u003eFor Everyone – suitable for all ages, from casual players to puzzle masters.\\u003cbr\\u003eCompletely Free – endless fun without cost.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures You’ll Love!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Smooth controls and elegant animations\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Endless puzzle challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Relaxing background music\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Offline play supported\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Lightweight and battery-friendly\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Regular updates with new events and challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy It’s Perfect for You?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eColor Block: Combo Blast is more than just a game – it’s your daily mental workout. Drop the blocks, clear the lines, and keep your brain sharp while having fun. It’s perfect for quick breaks, long commutes, or winding down before bed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to challenge your mind?\\u003cbr\\u003eDow