P_mhqoJ08UDVCDhGXuliviKepEQBNzCM-1w1kV_VJQN8yzp8atMLeFBk3iem8kgf95s\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PsY_M2bZZOU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Disney Solitaire, the ultimate solitaire card game that transforms classic tripeaks solitaire into an exciting experience filled with Disney magic! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay through beautifully designed levels inspired by iconic Disney and Pixar scenes while solving fun and challenging puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the enchanting realm of Disney Solitaire, where every postcard recreates an iconic scene from the worlds of Disney and Pixar! \\u003cbr\\u003eFrom the moment you start playing, you’ll find yourself immersed in colorful scenes featuring some of your favorite characters like Buzz Lightyear, Aladdin, Elsa, and Moana.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn’t just another solitaire game; it’s a vibrant experience packed with excitement, strategy, and whimsical charm.\\u003cbr\\u003eDisney Solitaire redefines the solitaire card games experience with innovative gameplay features. Collect unique power-ups and special cards that can change your strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Disney Solitaire now and step into a world where every game leads to magic, and every victory brings you closer to unlocking an enchanting scene. With stunning visuals, engaging gameplay, and heartwarming moments, Disney Solitaire is your ticket to a magical escape.\\u003cbr\\u003eDon’t miss out – your adventure awaits!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Why Disney Solitaire is Perfect for You 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you’re a fan of solitaire card games with a twist, or love exploring the worlds of Disney and Pixar, this game is designed just for you. Solve fun tripeaks solitaire challenges while unlocking Disney-inspired scenes that bring some of your favorite stories to life.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level combines the strategy of solitaire games with magical Disney elements to keep you entertained and engaged. Whether you\\u0026#39;re looking for a relaxing pastime or a chance to test your skills, Disney Solitaire delivers endless fun and excitement.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 Key Features of Disney Solitaire 🎉\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Innovative Solitaire Gameplay: Play Tripeaks solitaire with exciting power-ups and challenges!\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Beloved Disney Characters: Recreate scenes with fan-favorites like Elsa, Moana, and Simba!\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Collect and Decorate: Unlock beautiful Disney and Pixar- inspired puzzles and postcards.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Daily Challenges and Events: Don’t miss special events with exclusive rewards to enhance your experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Easy to Play, Hard to Master: Perfect for beginners and experienced players of solitaire games alike.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Join the Magic of Disney Solitaire ✨\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbark on a journey filled with whimsy and wonder. Whether you’re revisiting nostalgic Disney classics or discovering something new, Disney Solitaire offers an exciting twist on the solitaire card game you know and love.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now to explore iconic Disney and Pixar locations, solve charming Disney puzzles, and enjoy a fresh take on tripeaks solitaire. Let the magic begin!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Designed for Disney Fans of All Ages 💖\\u003cbr\\u003eWith its enchanting visuals and simple yet captivating gameplay, Disney Solitaire is perfect for fans of solitaire games, Disney lovers, and puzzle enthusiasts. Take a break from your day and unwind in a world of endless magic!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eStart Your Magical Journey Today!\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat are you waiting for? \\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Disney Solitaire now and experience the charm of Disney and Pixar like never before. Take on delightful solitaire card games, recreate nostalgic Disney scenes and immerse yourself in the wonder of Disney puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDisney Solitaire is intended for those 18 and older. Disney Solitaire does not require payment to download and play, but it also allows you to purchase virtual items with real money inside the game, including random items. You can disable in-app purchases in your device\\u0026#39;s settings. Disney Solitaire may also contain advertising.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou may require an internet connection to play Disney Solitaire and access its social features. You can also find more information about the functionality,\\u003cbr\\u003ecompatibility and interoperability of Disney Solitaire in the above description and additional app store information.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game may contain flashing effects that could trigger seizures in sensitive individuals.\"],\"SuperPlay.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JMMmD3gTHzSWzfjOgsbOmtlodbMsjbvlceKmuRxMz7BQm7FM6tc7aUlCP6PIVSgcyk6FOV-iws1nXi2Agn6oyXU\"],null,[19,23,160,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.superplaystudios.disneysolitairedreams\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.superplaystudios.disneysolitairedreams\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\