3xaTJfMOeCqILXHtU2mWV5HRSPJryGGs9saJhqK9ntstqRMgF2W8\"]]],\"Castle Busters\",[\"4.3\",4.29634],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.epicoro.castleclashers\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.epicoro.castleclashers\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.epicoro.castleclashers\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIGUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgogChpjb20uZXBpY29yby5jYXN0bGVjbGFzaGVycxABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"_iM8W_lByaA\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:_iM8W_lByaA?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:_iM8W_lByaA\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznv352Qdm9TVaiLeOnIozLkZG0I873kshZBbxPYrhame_LgBSzDDfl_brtUN5s1S5Hhp8vou1x98CuSEBqc7a2Ev1iLnLxnPcaXwqH7TBM6_NrkWE65bSDq-vMD2ojudPyPLMyGadQ546e_BqIEnSF2xeJhBNrRf7O3hwHHZN79r-JPapGh7GhfG1KYnUD9TTbv9fOFfkhDPSJET3vuxjTVbsDlQ8sVs5Poj0bmdILOGyF1br6TAC_Kddk9BsEg2NOTeH4DDx5vAflpgMcwxicYVjcyFMD-ej34376AODVUgWqxwAGRSAB6Shw7IT0\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_iM8W_lByaA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"BREAK EVERY WALL. RULE EVERY ARENA.\\u003cbr\\u003eCastle Busters is a fast, real-time 1v1 PvP strategy brawler where every brick breaks and every shot counts. Draft 8 units, load your keep, and turn your rival\\u0026#39;s castle into a pile of rubble before they do it to you first. No bot waves. No 20-minute matches. Just online multiplayer PvP battles where one good angle wins the war.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSMASH THE WALLS, NOT THE CLOCK\\u003cbr\\u003eMatches are quick. Decisions are not. Pick your shot, read the enemy line, and fire. Every wall, tower, and turret in your castle is destructible, so the battlefield is never the same twice. Collapse a floor under an archer. Carve your own path through the siege, literally.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDRAFT YOUR SQUAD\\u003cbr\\u003eKnights, archers, mages, bombers, siege engines, sharpshooters, wrecking monsters. Pick any 8 units. Each one changes how you play, what angles you attack, and how you defend your castle. Some PvP builds are patient. Some are pure chaos. None of them are wrong if they win the battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFORTIFY THE KEEP\\u003cbr\\u003eYour castle is your army\\u0026#39;s home, shield, and weapon. Reinforce the walls that matter. Leave decoys. Bait your rival into breaking through somewhere they shouldn\\u0026#39;t. Defense isn\\u0026#39;t passive in this strategy game, it\\u0026#39;s a trap.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTHE FORGE\\u003cbr\\u003eUpgrade your units. Strengthen your castle. Unlock new arenas with new hazards, new obstacles, new ways to break things. The deeper you go, the meaner the PvP meta gets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCLIMB THE LADDER\\u003cbr\\u003eBronze to Legend. Arena by arena. Seasonal leaderboards. Ranked multiplayer matches against real players who want your crown as badly as you want theirs. Only one castle stays standing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY PLAYERS LOVE CASTLE BUSTERS\\u003cbr\\u003e- Real-time 1v1 PvP, fast matches, deep strategy\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fully destructible castles, physics-driven combat\\u003cbr\\u003e- Draft 8 units from dozens of warriors\\u003cbr\\u003e- Ranked arenas and seasonal leaderboards\\u003cbr\\u003e- Free to play, easy to learn, hard to master\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSharpen your aim. Stack your squad. Crack their keep.The arena is open. Go break something.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCastle Busters is free to download and play. Some in-game items are available for purchase with real money. A network connection is required. Suitable for players 13 and older.\"],\"VOODOO\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"