1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZmsdjmR90zTzOa_EiqkhtFEzpWeakV6g5TNPaydnInSiCvsYb_4V0bkMn5W4UHbmMJVF6oh9wDX6VUI_7ZrTgw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oSfXT5hig7tzaHMP24sf_7IeIc0S7E9RNyHWVo5ZtUJRDGC_WkG6G5Nlc82Yr0wN1V5zgT-ZWGGfT9j7VTtgag\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1dWxBV6mBX0H34rCoeTORouDqFqGap2uCaiT9PqI4pMm3iVGl56Glp7BrxXMDxpGcSlojjodsv8Ms8XV4d_-\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OCJ4qZxj315ECVaYlYxC177DUFMZO-O94AJJ2CGjhWuMWzLbOULAKnHV8DZRhUgPQWNvEKl5jjHdkMRqAC1KO9E\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fJwb_u5NAyJDc87Z3g9GcwUBvp1HN8shqZ4UrmDPcK7McV2bsO76le8j5ncJILHwhuG4MYdvkO9f_KcSG_5XAQ\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/p0t7xER8I_CAiLrEkIO9eCJNiuI4abzTGAlJ7kWfTFPN4gzXodiL5z6u4nOGZnGvwu9UQN_-ZZKqhF-gUWZ-IZ8\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bE7LHVUUwMXAAZqdkBtmuYJ0yos4WwhJ1AoFDtx-E5f3ETa8pZdxgl2uLS1T2ri5zF8PD18-fZEDwuPHUpYlDfk\"]]],\"Mahjong Blast\",[\"4.9\",4.9147286],\"Board\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.mahjongtile\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.nebula.mahjongtile\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.mahjongtile\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIIEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCKz058CmhM6IQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIyChwKFmNvbS5uZWJ1bGEubWFoam9uZ3RpbGUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"☕️ Mahjong Blast: Classic Mahjong Solitaire \\u0026amp; Matching Games\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a classic mahjong solitaire game built around calm tile matching, clear boards, and relaxing puzzle play. Match identical mahjong tiles, clear each layout step by step, and enjoy a smooth mahjong match experience designed for everyday play. Whether you love matching games, classic solitaire puzzles, or relaxing offline games, Mahjong Blast gives you a simple and satisfying way to play at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🀄 Classic Mahjong Solitaire with Clear Tile Matching\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience authentic mahjong solitaire gameplay with clean board layouts and easy-to-read tiles. Match two free mahjong tiles, remove pairs one by one, and clear the board at a relaxed pace. Every layout is built around traditional mahjong solitaire rules, giving players a familiar puzzle flow with smooth progression and calm focus.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a readable, comfortable mahjong solitaire puzzle experience for players who enjoy classic tile layouts, steady thinking, and satisfying board clearing without pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Matching Games with Mahjong Match and Tile Pairing\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy relaxing matching games, Mahjong Blast gives you a clear and satisfying way to match tiles, clear boards, and solve each layout step by step. The gameplay combines simple tile pairing with classic mahjong match rules, making it easy to learn while still offering enough depth for daily play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFor players who like matching puzzle games, tile matching games, or calm board-style puzzles, each level delivers a smooth and focused matching experience built around observation, planning, and steady progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Mahjong Match 3D \\u0026amp; Triple Match Challenges\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a smooth mahjong match 3d experience built around clear tiles and satisfying puzzle progression. Each level uses polished 3D-style tiles, giving players a clean tiles mahjong match 3d feel without complicated controls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFor players searching for mahjong triple match 3d puzzles or a dedicated triple match mahjong 3d game, this classic mahjong solitaire offers a calmer tile-matching alternative. Instead of fast pressure, every board rewards focus and observation, helping you become a true mahjong master one layout at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🇺🇸 American Mahjong Style \\u0026amp; Pattern Practice\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore boards inspired by american mahjong style, with familiar tile patterns and flexible matching choices. This is a relaxed mahjong solitaire experience that gives american mahjong fans a simple way to enjoy pattern-based play. Regular american mahjong practice helps you build recognition over time without pressure, making it a favorite for american mahjong enthusiasts.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👴 Senior-Friendly Play with Large Tiles\\u003cbr\\u003eDesigned for comfort, this mahjong experience features large tiles and clear layouts. It is a perfect choice for those seeking mahjong for seniors with simple controls and easy-to-follow mechanics. As a comfortable mahjong for seniors free option, it keeps the core tile-matching fun accessible and relaxing for daily play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿 Why Choose Mahjong Blast?\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Mahjong Solitaire Free: Play all boards without cost, anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ No Ads: No intrusive ads to interrupt your gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Offline Play: No WiFi needed—enjoy your favorite matching games anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Daily Mahjong Match: Fresh layouts every day to keep your mind sharp.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Mahjong Master Boards: Progress through levels to prove your skills as a mahjong master.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy classic mahjong solitaire, smooth mahjong match gameplay, and the best matching games, Mahjong Blast is built for you. From offline mahjong solitaire free boards to American mahjong style patterns and polished mahjong match 3d levels, every layout is designed for comfort and focus.\"],\"Nebula  Studio\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,10