,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6obPnwWF5yU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Pizza Ready, the ultimate pizza restaurant simulation game! 🍕🍽\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into an addictive restaurant game where cooking, management, and simulation come together in one delicious experience. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love games about food, chefs, and running a busy kitchen, Pizza Ready is the perfect choice!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍕 Run and Manage Your Own Pizza Restaurant! 🍕\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the role of a professional chef and pizza restaurant manager. Cook tasty dishes, follow recipes, design your menu, and serve customers efficiently.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom serving food to cleaning the kitchen, every part of restaurant management is in your hands. Manage your store wisely, upgrade your skills, and grow through exciting levels and events!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 Two Sales Windows: Counter \\u0026amp; Drive-Thru Serving! 🍽\\u003cbr\\u003eTake orders from both the counter and Drive-Thru to serve more customers faster. Smart serving and smooth customer management are key to success. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe more satisfied your customers, the faster your restaurant business grows!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💪 Hire Chefs, Manage Staff, and Build Friends at Work! 💼\\u003cbr\\u003eRecruit talented chefs, hire helpful staff, and manage your team like a true HR expert. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUpgrade employee skills, improve serving speed, and create a friendly workplace where friends work together to run the best restaurant in town.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Restaurant Design, Decor \\u0026amp; Decoration! 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your restaurant with stylish decor, unique decoration, and smart design choices. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA beautiful restaurant attracts more customers and boosts your food business to the next level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Unlimited Expansion \\u0026amp; Chain Restaurants Across States! 🔥\\u003cbr\\u003eExpand your restaurant empire without limits. Open new locations, manage multiple restaurants, and become a nationwide food tycoon. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStrategic management and smart simulation gameplay will help you dominate the restaurant industry.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😄 Endless Fun Cooking Game – Completely Free! 😄\\u003cbr\\u003ePizza Ready is a free-to-play cooking simulation game packed with fun events, progression levels, and satisfying restaurant gameplay. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you enjoy food games, restaurant management, or relaxing simulation games, Pizza Ready delivers nonstop fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Pizza Ready now and experience the joy of cooking, managing, and serving delicious food!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love restaurant games, cooking, management, and building a food empire, this game is made for you. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eServe happy customers, master your menu, and become the ultimate pizza restaurant legend—one slice at a time! 🍕✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSupport: help.pizza@supercent.io\"],\"Supercent, Inc.\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TQ5I0vMHZS0VveSXSaeOUf3ELXc_tszzZimstVckNGirwzBeJpV1txkm5kSMUOVtdA\"],null,[240,37,3,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googlep