0],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dcP0_QiYU3kqzxqecrs91x3INgTe_PILGBe6waxpR4g3Y9p9KhrwZzBilzeX-KY0rp86y_cEnd6QjDIaJKt2\"]],[null,2,[562,1000],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m6P7nSLxyeETecqlNVY3eCk_7m7ypLPV04SvHG93Y157lwy9NvwwwDK9T6iYh3y2SYmc6RyudRylJpWfgMwOPwc\"]]],\"Solitaire - Classic Card Games\",[\"4.8\",4.8268843],\"Card\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsolitaire.patience.card.games.klondike.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dsolitaire.patience.card.games.klondike.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsolitaire.patience.card.games.klondike.free\"]],[\"qgJ1GnMIJEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRwoxCitzb2xpdGFpcmUucGF0aWVuY2UuY2FyZC5nYW1lcy5rbG9uZGlrZS5mcmVlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eThe Most Relaxing \\u0026amp; Addictive FREE Classic Solitaire Card Games, original Solitaire or Patience\\u003c/b\\u003e, is just for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eEnjoy the best free and popular original Solitaire card games in the world for free at any time and place!\\u003c/b\\u003e It\\u0026#39;s time to train your brain, challenge yourself and be a Solitaire or Patience master, try this original, classic and free Patience Solitaire card game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSolitaire games, also known as Patience in Europe (such as the United Kingdom, French, etc.), are Solitaire card games, and can be played by a single player. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is not a social casino game. You can enjoy original Solitaire anytime and anywhere, without money in and money out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHow to play this free original solitaire card games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo solve this FREE Solitaire card puzzle, you should move all solitaire cards of 4 suits - hearts, diamonds, spades and crosses to the Solitaire Foundations. There is one deck - 52 solitaire cards in the classic Solitaire game. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou need to stack solitaire cards by suit, from Aces to King (A, 2, 3 and more). You can also move solitaire cards between columns, and stack solitaire cards in descending order and differentiate between red and black suits. For example, a black 10 could only be followed by a red 9. Only a King could be placed in the Free Column. You can move the stack of solitaire cards by dragging the whole stack to another column.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSolitaire game or Patience game is an addictive solitaire card game from the Classic Solitaire collection, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri Peaks, Pyramind, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon. Classic never fades. Solitaire, or Patience is the best way for you to relax and pass the time, play it anytime, anywhere with patience and insistence. You would absolutely love playing this free Solitaire card game. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eKey Features of Solitaire Card Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Original and Classic solitaire gameplay, super fun and addictive\\u003cbr\\u003e- Left-hand mode, more convenient for you\\u003cbr\\u003e- Solitaire 3 Draw Mode, more challenging to play games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Statistics section, keep improving and challenging yourself during solitaire games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily Challenge, start every day with fun and relaxing Solitaire games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlimited hints and undo. Playing solitaire could be easier. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Play Joker. Get stuck? No worries, the Joker card is here for you to play solitaire card games smoothly\\u003cbr\\u003e- Various backgrounds - the classic green one, those with beautiful scenery, and cute animals, etc. Select the one you like, customize your solitaire game, and enjoy!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Kinds of card faces and card backs. Playing solitaire is more than a relax, snowman, dogs and cats are here for you to choose from.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dynamic background animation. It brings more fun while playing. You\\u0026#39;ll love it!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSome solitaire games are unsolvable, according to the classic solitaire rules. If you get stuck, you can try a new solitaire deal or try some boosters in the solitaire game for help. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe are always keeping improving to make this free solitaire game better and better. Try this solitaire game, you will find it\\u0026#39;s really fun and relaxing! Enjoy yourself with the popular and classic solitaire card games for free! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://solitaire.gurugame.ai/policy.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://solitaire.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html\"],\"Guru Puzzle Game\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2ZHkdPBQOB5exBDVlRLWl7xyypLs_XiAuDAM90vhaFPO78q5fcEI9qQLu_7TVCB2W7NDQ0aSFcMdblhZfuKZtg\"],null,[8,143,18,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsolitaire.patience.card.games.klondike.free