lNwYUp22sZy_Pa2d14ZCnykDZAI1tBj9cj960Hx4EaDY0-Vk7P6j0aID_KvgqzVtY2mcHIrhiVTDO2zzWZ9z7FtKvmZ4HiVKaSlAQeUVEYjWUVQlFHmFaBiPu3W0fwamJ9Sqocmp6BkiYr9hj92AnBrFh4XjVbN7Od3kXnbqkLRRGFZy1r-oO3u3ZpUJJzAjT6oSTDxMCn1PzyIKncpWPhJWaTDnX9NcxnE596251Mn6z5ntuqGv9-9hoUvwzFDOluuYHm745X8MjOBdbD5r2eTwAwPDHaobNRFDRazw4hWtk-BBQTNEcsy-xnDEw\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fu17MhCyBvI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Dive into the ultimate winter adventure with Sled Surfers! Become a true snow rider as you slide through icy slopes, dodge obstacles, and race across a magical frost world filled with action. Glide on your sledge, surf the snow, and enjoy fast-paced challenges inspired by the fun, simple unpredictability.\\u003cbr\\u003eRace through snowy trails, master tight turns, and unlock cool winter gear as you explore frozen forests, icy cliffs, and slippery downhill tracks. Whether you\\u0026#39;re chasing the thrill of a snow race or simply enjoying a relaxing winter glide, every run is packed with excitement.\\u003cbr\\u003eAnd if you love the summer chaos of aqua park or waterpark slide games, you’ll enjoy the same smooth, addictive flow—just with a frosty twist!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e❄️ Key features\\u003cbr\\u003e🏂 Become the ultimate snow rider\\u003cbr\\u003e Surf the snow, control your sledge, and glide through slippery winter tracks\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Fast \\u0026amp; fun snow race gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e Dash through frozen paths and dodge obstacles as the speed ramps up\\u003cbr\\u003e🌨️ Explore a magical frost world\\u003cbr\\u003e Discover frozen forests, icy caves, and breathtaking winter landscapes\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Unlock sleds, characters \\u0026amp; gear\\u003cbr\\u003e Collect coins to upgrade your ride and customize your snowy adventure\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡Power-Ups for a faster slide\\u003cbr\\u003e Boost your speed with backflips and front flips in the air\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Smooth controls\\u003cbr\\u003e Easy to play, endlessly fun, and packed with surprising challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛷 Ready to surf the snow?\\u003cbr\\u003eGrab your sledge, hit the snowy slopes, and start your winter adventure today! Whether you\\u0026#39;re here for the thrill, the challenge, or the cozy vibe of the frost world, Sled Surfers delivers endless snowy fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app\"],\"CrazyLabs LTD\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NBWT4FQ3IeW3_MIKEchhKzsGXFBw0zhLcgusb6Wp3F_fbZTtT5TZy0g9zirc9xTKrm5P-V9Tggg-RCccW9InZg\"],null,[233,244,247,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sled.surfers.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sled.surfers.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $49.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Arcade\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,