ycZM5_LUxjcnk3u6_pykwA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hQ7JkTff93bM71Iq8UGmQ2Tml7H5naL4ut7fURESo9tWbeB9S4ZldTnF4WeBopO9y-VRO1LfD0E8qI9CTFIU\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wL-mzwGWjgXYPgxHmuJYsfQlu3xbdjOnOLsqk2aMHDjUriziUhBOnxbk29D6rUqarNBr2b9tQJ1PDJqEZwpW6A\"]]],\"Match Factory!\",[\"4.7\",4.6664376],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dnet.peakgames.match\\u0026rdid\\u003dnet.peakgames.match\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dnet.peakgames.match\"]],[\"qgJlGmMILEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCK/Yk6eG/tiJQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIvChkKE25ldC5wZWFrZ2FtZXMubWF0Y2gQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"KPIzHsStC0Y\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:KPIzHsStC0Y?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:KPIzHsStC0Y\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezls3D82xmqId4QSu-4zRNaCNZg7TFtFcN-pZoZxzLYLcMUmUxvbV0_JUyGf_-QX1bOrBc0ri2CjWxEsZAMukpeM03JlTmPtjyyWbHrHaJq_DDBHFjX3Y4t8OYw5Gx7WApATecWCRrZXqJI0EIO602xCzAF8e44mm22wXzCE-Jtwq8u9i7eXeMX5JF0A9j9Qolu8wQFDz4WgorZaHUQzjVGCZvtjyLHE-ftK6AWfX1HgZpP6FkZllfDjL1c1IgiEBLWwkHlujaRXhZu9GmipD2abcvibDN4539oMqIAEmzs12AEDDhI9iBoU4MIi1JQ\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KPIzHsStC0Y/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Dive into the fascinating world of Match Factory, the brand new puzzle game from the creators of Toon Blast \\u0026amp; Toy Blast. Once you play, you will come for Match Factory every day!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect identical items, sort tiles, and clear the board in this mesmerizing match 3D game. Challenge your puzzle-solving skills as you keep sorting and matching objects until every item is cleared from the screen. It’s not just a puzzle; it’s a test of your wit and strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax and Have Fun! Leave your worries behind and enjoy quality relaxation and fun. Immerse yourself in the soothing game atmosphere , enjoy your brain time and increase your zen!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Anytime, Anywhere without WI-FI! Enjoy the game online or offline, and never worry about Wi-Fi. Whether you’re on a grand adventure or simply taking a break, Match Factory will always be there to entertain you. In-app purchases do require an active internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome the Master of 3D Puzzles! Time is of the essence in this match 3d game! With each level equipped with a timer, you’ll need to think fast and act even faster to triumph!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBoosters to the Rescue! Stuck on a level? Fear not! Match Factory offers a range of powerful boosters to help you overcome tricky situations. Utilize these remarkable tools to advance through the game and unlock exciting items like fruits, candy, cake objects and much more!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImmerse yourself in the world of Match Factory, where thrilling 3D puzzles and hidden objects awaits your keen eye and sharp mind! Download Match Factory now and prove your matching skills to the world! Can you conquer every level and emerge as the ultimate puzzle master?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Factory Gates Are Open - Start Matching Now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch Factory is free to download and includes optional in-game purchases. If you wish to disable in-game purchases, please turn off the in-app purchases in your phone or tablet’s Settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou must be at least 13 years of age, or such higher age as required in your country, to play or download Match Factory.\"],\"Peak\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G