BTGMMJTzRtNuqft_BmGy3okD0Incr31faksj9G_i_R0XjaKpA3Tnm7xCEL1M-v_h4beuJugxzA\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k0RvaRKeYEBFBfHFzecQYMibfVYw9SwGIBkUmKkI0re00HQSxsckINL65LxR0Fe9k_r3XFvT7bHbcR6meRfTJAo\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/deqmUN6QjYdCZws5PR-SCl4G5b2py1BmxNudhlGpD9UCXGasik22205W7BUXZ6gkdM1OFTtTVkuI1bKOHOKrHg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZcsNmEQ_okUwOVKTT2yc3OfgQ52UIl_YI-hk_992Vg_qB5Nu59UJ-EaY-04C2-1Mdh3RTmLL3416cPRje5BX-TQ\"]]],\"Pocket Sort: Coin Merge Puzzle\",[\"4.5\",4.4673643],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\"]],[\"qgJyGnAIMEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCOHKzNH+vs+LQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI8CiYKIGNvbS5wb2NrZXQuc29ydC5jb2luLnB1enpsZS5nYW1lEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"7xa_KmZCfA4\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:7xa_KmZCfA4?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:7xa_KmZCfA4\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkGjK6tAO4eOaqcF2yRDpXre11VC1-GLSBJFc-XI2IAeDJN5F1GODY2yNEkhxis0bTX-lGrollaDZUsRkQMMhhfm-bGleLivhdKkQYi6-c9d56rcO9MCLnBWkf-LqERh1asxTh1bzrNxI5_mPBl8XJm7xiJdE93RBpuzvoK5QeJpTvSj1jnvSTn4R6K0i8tYsa-UW3llk2iYHR0wQSZoHljYgQR-MD3Xh6Lu4SeqewyrZxIa1TkHiq4gblh1xNboaEeBg5EvrP_BDiD-upqF-1ySy_wOkdEV55Fo3_uV1ONRCY43s-_QdBqLllPvG8\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7xa_KmZCfA4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eSORT YOUR WAY TO HAPPINESS 😃\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster mergers, ready those fingers and get to matching in 3…2…1! This fun sorting puzzle features colorful coins that need to be matched up in their slots and then merged together to clear the playing field, making way for more. Bright colors, simple graphics, and lots of boosters ensure that your brain can focus on what it does best: noticing patterns and finding unique ways to shuffle everything around in order to win.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMASTER THE MATCH 🧩\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple in theory yet difficult in practice, players young and old will enjoy racking their brains for the best possible way to merge the different color coins and keep progressing. With no timer or pressure to trip you up, you’ll be able to sort, match, and merge the coins while also relaxing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFun features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🤑 Tons of coin types\\u003c/b\\u003e – In addition to your standard rainbow of coins to match, as you progress there will be all manner or fun new coins to keep things fresh. Hidden coins, linked coins, ice coins, and more await, so keep your eyes peeled!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🤔 Easy on the eye\\u003c/b\\u003e – As colorful as this sorting puzzle is, the whole point is to help you chill so we’ve done away with any crazy graphics or flashing lights. This also means the game is great to play wherever you find yourself, solo or perhaps with a little helper.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e💆\\u200d♂️ Relaxing to play\\u003c/b\\u003e – No countdown clock here! Take as much time on each puzzle as you need, and move the coins around as much as you want without being penalized. We believe in having fun, not getting stressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🧠 Train your brain\\u003c/b\\u003e – Sorting and matching puzzles are a great way to train your brain to recognize patterns and colors, and to work on your logic and thinking skills as you test out different ways to group coins. And it doesn’t stop there, the skills you hone in the game can be applied to other stuff in real life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📈 Keep growing\\u003c/b\\u003e – As you progress through the puzzle levels, more colors and coin types will be added, and things will get steadily more difficult. But no fear, even as you’re pushed to get better we’ve added plenty of fun boosters to keep it chill.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGO ON A COLORFUL ADVENTURE ⛰️\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to start your merge adventure? This relaxing game keeps your mind sharp while also providing a fun escape as you enjoy sorting and matching, so hop on in to become the master sorter and put all this stuff where it needs to be!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eDownload Pocket Sort: Coin Puzzle today to see how good you are at locating different colored coins and slotting them in together.\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OXD-3tIqUp6a2ijmUkRqJmxB3GjyIkaix6U1ygnIRuNekI1FkcgJcxw1kEiys22IcXaDVH57Jh768azczbPz\"],null,[135,53,16,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Sort\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"block.color.game.jam.blocks.sort.puzzle.games.slide.free\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fJ_pK4YX0tLme8wE7uBkRIiLtwKQTFaSQaqgNezutmVwOMrbv06lvPiHoGsAP6ApOw\"],null,[237,43,23,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/frTx9Vh7SgyVYjJUzysBT-_y_iq8PwHgqIYGeiDesjn9k19JSRtvlZBeL7rvMo8nNA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2zHSsNKKQVDZO2vhwQIsn32MmlvN67gJe1Jsy6g_KH5S583JcxBBntOBukiLna9A5Q\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0wqtc2dOBMWy4x9qVTCqmRj-0zUDDVB_DAAVLX1_88_3y5sQz-_aFwtkl2idqbXjH6Y\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/v4zKO-1rmeeTPd66pe8jDWWt15OKsfO5hnUaCblw2HA-nQxlvYj5DWKSw9I34FvM9so\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lPTi6Degm28OmbT5G0LYluhnQLPKnPIHQoDLczxGFA0A5x7TaRK7090BPPYbDQHeCg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2h9epxE1aBszm4wA2EHGBsDIThoZl-BJdS27PweobBn614MXCBGlqmEQV761Cn_F-IA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GIM1liU9pwFds2AZ5DZ_6FCEqnkdFpzM-GaVNEcNNgm49aJuATq1pNQ7tek9luNYZCM\"]]],\"Block Color Mania, Puzzle Game\",[\"4.9\",4.881475],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dblock.color.game.jam.blocks.sort.puzzle.games.slide.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dblock.color.game.jam.blocks.sort.puzzle.games.slide.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dblock.color.game.jam.blocks.sort.puzzle.games.slide.free\"]],[\"qgKDARqAAQgxShMIyufr5qf9lAMVowmzBh0iywaL+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugJUCj4KOGJsb2NrLmNvbG9yLmdhbWUuamFtLmJsb2Nrcy5zb3J0LnB1enpsZS5nYW1lcy5zbGlkZS5mcmVlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"💥 \\u003cb\\u003eMatch colors, smash blocks, and clear the wood board in NO TIMER Block Color Mania!\\u003c/b\\u003e✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach vibrant block has its own shape and matching color gate. Your goal? Drag every piece to its color-coded exit. No filling rows - this is a challenging, precision-driven twist on the classic wood block puzzle, with no time limits and zero pressure. Relax and enjoy the challenge at your own pace!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith silky-smooth controls, bold visuals, and that oh-so-satisfying smash when a block hits its target, this game delivers a tactile, brain-tingling experience from the very first move.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 \\u003cb\\u003eHow to Play\\u003c/b\\u003e 🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Drag \\u0026amp; Move the Color Blocks\\u003cbr\\u003eSlide each uniquely shaped, colorful block across the board and guide it to the matching colored exit gate. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Match Colors to Smash\\u003cbr\\u003eOnce a block reaches the gate with the same color, BOOM - it\\u0026#39;s smashed! Each correct match clears space.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔷 Avoid Gridlock\\u003cbr\\u003eDon\\u0026#39;t let the board get too crowded. Misplaced blocks can block paths for others, so plan your order carefully to prevent a full-blown block jam.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Discover New Patterns \\u0026amp; Obstacles\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, new twists emerge: trickier block shapes, tighter grids, and unpredictable color layouts. Each level offers a fresh puzzle that pushes your reflexes and strategy to the next level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 \\u003cb\\u003eGame Features\\u003c/b\\u003e 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e🪵 Wood Puzzle Feel, Fresh Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eClassic wood block charm meets smooth movement and color logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⏰ No Time Limits, Just Relax \\u0026amp; Play\\u003cbr\\u003eThere\\u0026#39;s no timer, so you can take your time and enjoy solving each puzzle without any pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Color Match \\u0026amp; Smash\\u003cbr\\u003eGuide each block to its matching gate and smash it!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Tough but Fair\\u003cbr\\u003eLevels get trickier with tighter grids and unique shapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Offline \\u0026amp; Free\\u003cbr\\u003eNo Wi-Fi needed. Pure puzzle fun anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤩 \\u003cb\\u003eWhat Makes It Different?\\u003c/b\\u003e 🤩\\u003cbr\\u003e🧘 No Timer, No Stress\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a completely stress-free experience - without a timer, you can focus on the puzzle and make each move at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Slick, Responsive Controls\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel every drag and release. With ultra-smooth mechanics, your decisions translate into instant, satisfying action.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Polished Wood Aesthetic Meets Bold Colors\\u003cbr\\u003eThe perfect mix of calming wood textures and eye-catching color design keeps you visually engaged.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Satisfying Clean-the-Board Goals\\u003cbr\\u003eDeliver every block to its destination and leave no pieces behind. That full-clear moment? Unbeatable.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to test your reflexes, logic, and color sense? 🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBlock Color Mania is the fresh, relaxing twist on wood block jam puzzles you\\u0026#39;ve been waiting for. Start playing now and smash your way to mastery!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://blockcolor.gurugame.ai/policy.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://blockcolor.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html\"],\"Brainteaser Puzzle Game Studio\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ixeA3atPd0tTVWBOQClEnI5iDwVtqf9ghlsF9FuxHZfG2kCRCGK_lLetA4tGNeSCUA\"],null,[134,58,31,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dblock.color.game.jam.blocks.sort.puzzle.games.slide.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dblock.color.game.jam.blocks.sort.puzzle.games.slide.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $79.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,nul