X7o17tZcJ5Gvho0greN2ESeW2HbTEkWcJt3QekV-qw\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/A_8sjCgzqhAyGPL9i_7bEbylZtyc7yHw_i9LA5qXAB0C0in9eY_mvHL28t2691luDYckn5XhGjHQa3C0yltS\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bRrXKR1ahg5kwWYTbO-N1tJnisH0qqAYkzMuaptcE6ajk7lv4oqrcWb2NRo7OWWEebFCTnn5c7Ty6eOZUUYhJw\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zkFAu-yh07P3hb7EZ1AA7f_aKEQ7LpVzYe62mOkwcPF6wW5FW7I0VtS6mBwfXNnn7EpaWtMklby_i-JHr7dVag\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6LeC0HLPciEJz9JpQmYg4f8UTlXRrTd1UtwKw30R70SLRuaS2tJD1ikxAvIwMNjGokNTwCEJ1aPjFRDVO5RLxg\"]]],\"Toca Boca World\",[\"4.3\",4.319243],\"Educational\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\"]],[\"qgJuGmwIM0oTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAIgCAroCNgogChpjb20udG9jYWJvY2EudG9jYWxpZmV3b3JsZBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBMoCBAgCEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"zjdUU4c5Fzs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:zjdUU4c5Fzs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:zjdUU4c5Fzs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkFA55o69FteRV8-L3R8SqDu5sBGu0m1iwjOCPp8d1eZakcOSmEjzyb-vAJ86vi3N3N-c4fmNwsb8smiVTJmYPTeTpnWp53bDZbDFn3XoIiXLvSW21BgtOSuw7RrFfFe8GVJP1--4uBR1bbeHr0lBpyEHcJaIC2Fy4pG6f7W4RruiQRlk_P1jWPtYAzi8a5cva4A-orXVzkFJU6OwrXGGUYioFZHrm8n1UauhoB2yRVAuJiTbioOV1fnpvZioO1DtVWqembAR4qk9qeAMTENH2M1d1Dh5LHrIePnotrgr87KuepAO-X9LcREPJTFmo\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zjdUU4c5Fzs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Toca Boca World, the ultimate universe for kids to play, design, and explore their endless imagination! This isn\\u0026#39;t just a game; it\\u0026#39;s a safe space where every story is yours to create, and the fun never stops.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eToca Boca World is where your creativity takes center stage:\\u003cbr\\u003e🛝 Unleash your inner storyteller: Roleplay in a universe you\\u0026#39;ve created, where you can tell your own stories. Become a teacher, a vet, or even an influencer.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 Design your dream world: Bring your best friends to life with Character Creator. Customize hair, faces, accessories to make up your own style! Use the intuitive Home Designer tool, and you\\u0026#39;re the architect! Decorate your own house, supermarket, camping van, or any of our constantly updated locations with the furniture and colors you love.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨Explore and discover a game of secrets and surprises: Explore hundreds of hidden gems in the game! From finding jewels and crumpets to unlocking secret rooms, there’s always something new and exciting to uncover.\\u003cbr\\u003e🤩Fresh content, always: Toca Boca World is an endless universe that keeps growing! Discover new locations and content updated every month, ensuring there\\u0026#39;s always more to explore.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Friday is gift day! Pop into the Post Office to collect the gifts we’ve sent you on the conveyor belt, including decorations, furniture, and even pets! Keep an eye out for gift bonanzas where we give away a LOT of items from previous years.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMore than 60 million girls and boys play on Toca Boca World, the very first game of its kind – that\\u0026#39;s a LOT of kid-testers making sure the fun never ends!\\u003cbr\\u003e🤸 Press play! Download Toca Boca World now and dive into an endlessly fun universe. Furnish your first apartment in Bop City, buy housewarming items for your Free Family House and don’t forget to get your hair done before the party with characters you’ve created!\\u003cbr\\u003e🌎 Expand your world: You can build a bigger Toca Boca World with all the stuff available in the in-app shop! Play your influencer life in Megastar Mansion, take care of pets in the pet hospital, or just relax in Bubble Bop Spa with your friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e👊 A safe and secure play environment: At Toca Boca, we believe in the power of play above all else. Toca Boca World is a single-player kids’ game, COPPA compliant, and designed as a secure platform where you can explore, create, and play freely without interruptions. That’s our promise to you!\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆Award-winning fun: Recognized as App of the Year 2021 and an Editor\\u0026#39;s Choice, Toca Boca World is praised for its quality and dedication to kids’ safety, and continues to evolve to be better and better!\\u003cbr\\u003e👏 No ads, ever: Toca Boca World will never show third-party ads. We’ll never interrupt your game with adverts. Play always comes first!\\u003cbr\\u003e👀 About us: Our fun, award-winning kids’ game can be downloaded on phones, tablets and computers for free. We also offer in-app purchases for our most dedicated fans, which allows us to build a game with a focus on quality that is completely ad-free and 100% safe. We take privacy very seriously, learn more at https://tocaboca.com/privacy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📎 Stay connected! Discover our latest updates and collaborations by following us on social media:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/tocaboca/\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/@tocaboca\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.tiktok.com/@tocaboca?lang\\u003den-GB\"],\"Toca Boca\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"Ages 6-12\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6O0MIKi-3jljHyPUlYWFuLtH4ccoAWSYX9a-14nDbOxOclDE5Vk8WIM4Z58_1ONT6xc5fCAvHgRITZXa6ZffdQ\"],null,[132,209,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $199.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Educational\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Life\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.bravestars.savethedog.drawgame\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BwBhWrYqA6hxumsnVSWzX2upPpfGk_WQdu9-qk3uFiThchDKPXY7nrX5cA-e4h1_FRuY7dEg1s82jcrXIrgGLA\"],null,[252,252,252,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k0sU1NHhB_MKXhZw49usTCMCd_z0Ph7FUGTyihJEa5k7X2Wc2DgiZhCrn7cpc3Ri8DGtqgFV-1FZeLKsQtl6qt4\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QpmE5UIHMnsiPOGEJPRAOZ-J7jcuq3zGqd4Y_duhGUhAtZlXN6-y2RKl-CM7roXLsgE9pnWDWTOuQdDIj37nan8\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NoS1KwBTLQm7VEc9fpS7KXeYVdE9a3O1JFgcoFup5_HrwJ_KRMjPZPiieVjm7gb3hZvTLEt38juaMa3Tmv--\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"h