couNBOiZcYfbRuQ92zoDDeTVHClCVuxjYs6xurc6y4TeVvM6iQ60JQuBX\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1YrlAmj8lhjc-wMVjRuhyqmv1igPLi_re12O8ATsgEcCDzwBRRroER42BOopWN-_YpwwSyFiUfuTaXe86NG5qw\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vg2rH4hIu_x8YDf0XHbdHru4yJM1cMIYhVl2Kb-_2KHeHmfA3S4cmSVwXQfa-AeS_NoJ7H1naOXnakC4mcyn\"]]],\"Save The Pets\",[\"4.2\",4.1826086],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bravestars.savethedog.drawgame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bravestars.savethedog.drawgame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bravestars.savethedog.drawgame\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIINEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCPXWr6qU3v2KQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI+CigKImNvbS5icmF2ZXN0YXJzLnNhdmV0aGVkb2cuZHJhd2dhbWUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🐶 Save the Dog \\u0026amp; Save the Pets! 🐾\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOh no! The cute dog 🐕 and adorable pets 🐾 are in danger! Evil bees 🐝 are trying to sting them, and it’s your mission to save the dog and save the pets. Draw lines to block the bees and keep every animal safe in this fun and challenging brain game! 🧠✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBut beware, the dog and pets must also avoid lava 🌋, water 💧, spikes ⚡, and bombs 💣. Can you master this exciting brain teaser game and become the ultimate hero of dog rescue?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Touch and drag to draw protective lines ✏️\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Keep the dog and pets safe for at least 10 seconds ⏱️\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Shorter lines earn more stars ⭐\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Rescue the dog and save the pet in every level!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Cute and funny dogs and pets to brighten your day 🐶💖\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Endless, dynamic brain games with challenging puzzles 🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Relaxing yet addictive brain teaser games to test your skills\\u003cbr\\u003e◼️ Play unlimited levels anytime ⏳\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Join the ultimate dog rescue adventure and save the dog and save the pets! Download now and jump into the adventure! 🚀 Your mission: save the dog, save the pets, save the pet, and emerge victorious in the thrilling dog rescue challenge! 🐾💥\"],\"Bravestars Games\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ez0WHsWASsneqhWHrJ1qGQXa5g33zlNJDyQ-dM-RsFjguOJNZJY5xG_C8z1uT8pEDY0kswhN-sBrh77ag93EBA\"],null,[251,252,252,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bravestars.savethedog.drawgame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bravestars.savethedog.drawgame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $1.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Brain teaser\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.microdose.balljam\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dl_mdgr6DeSXCTQuTsBNP4eR-ga3cwvPtvzZOrCtOkLtfPueOJ7uSFH7ST_mcLUBksaf\"],null,[242,198,13,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ENZ2Z00l-C5GcKHdFHdK4ShaJAbcxB3lSHw5nsMKOPi0OzlbgGTCG1jkTjKgK6-g9c2c\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GW54q4qeR8VpOUq-3vnBGmQsPz9f2EwO4w-ybmtAwsvcU20cLYBF2oO0bSKRDVFbly3k\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B7L6v6pY4gx0qZHeXf7rqsZF82Ulnbh72iXxxBtROFbG8uaB-X_hcTd8s8MIBdPGtw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4NdHd-gqFUK2KGg7leQXVRHvHfCTcp2YqqEVtbtrFqHWThX3j3yXjr014u7IuTRDQbU\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wVl73JU-f0VNkHo2-49XRISsZZLiYXFhk9XSrDEBR5HY4mJq_IlSChGXHvN8JVypLDg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bzyu1Qfc6AG_KXvOMYyn9w-15Pk00PGb0AraI-2bCCGwYoO7s1rCpj-fHjKAmgE6pXKs\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dygorWjR-3bo9MYDYMYqNfkufCgTJbTIMHNrX9dEdJF9zMEMzkcx3CT_PPkSAbDrBQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SBMdH6C7hZgPio0VYRSrXBbDf-IRmROgtezk1F5Gm-RKBJWe2fGRSjShwSe4G378Eg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8RHBtQds79arqnZq-lp6g4FHKujy194rOfx-wKZaZZPVR7r9acD5FXTlNZtDIZ8M5A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HtqU9qjP0Ysvxs7rlHtA2B6DRXk4eppG5Q3o9lXzllIipg7ovWH0Vq04vte8Pg1GxQc\"]]],\"Marble Sort! - Color Puzzle\",[\"4.7\",4.698238],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.microdose.balljam\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.microdose.balljam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.microdose.balljam\"]],[\"qgJnGmUINUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCPjQhdegsaKNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIxChsKFWNvbS5taWNyb2Rvc2UuYmFsbGphbRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dA89uBHcYbeM\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A89uBHcYbeM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Get ready for the most satisfying color sorting puzzle! 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Marble Sort, a vibrant, 3D brain teaser where physics meets fast-paced puzzle logic! Your mission is simple but challenging: sort every colorful marble from the top trays into their matching boxes at the bottom.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e🔴 Tap to Drop: Release marbles from the top trays and watch them tumble with realistic physics!\\u003cbr\\u003e🟡 Ride the Conveyor: Marbles land on the ever-moving circular conveyor belt. Plan your moves carefully!\\u003cbr\\u003e🟢 Match \\u0026amp; Pack: Guide the marbles into bottom boxes with 3 slots of the same color.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔵 Don\\u0026#39;t Run Out of Space: If the conveyor is full of marbles and there are no matching boxes available, you lose! Think ahead and drop wisely.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Brain-Teasing Levels: Test your logic and strategy as the the puzzles get trickier.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 Relaxing ASMR Vibes: The clinking sounds of rolling marbles and smooth physics make for a perfect stress-relief experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e🕹️ Easy to Learn, Hard to Master: One-tap controls make it easy to play anywhere, anytime!\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Offline: Perfect for your commute. Enjoy the full game without WiFi or data.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you beat the conveyor and sort them all? Download Marble Sort now and put your puzzle-solving skills to the test!\"],\"VOODOO\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WuJRf1DBmGVHOfGQk2eO09zwC6oTe3PWPsf5j9D3csta5n6bUV0gURzKOpsPKB_wPaFEBsgiC3GrwBV9sKvxQw\"],null,[203,229,250,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.microdose.balljam\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.microdose.balljam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.run.tower.defense\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cs59HOM5uSmSzgnmMyFpqYw9sMtQkYxMUTRZ1TSCZK6t6T-cjluQW_9krAcgeEozBYQWKl2DmUTeETdYtKhq\"],null,[153,237,247,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2SjEnPLGNRsB4MEmbk_AzwcNFcDUywBimj8ja8ytBcKg15UJ4ejezvdtN-1efhpSJ5k1iC9L2seE-0pSE2w8r-I\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4e30WB8pGF379_UAjOwaQjmG_wkj-spdkx1IMVK86Z054JXAr6luYfsTsoRKg8LrHp3Z_fpo75echZLdqcgB\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3VwKipSZdJ_Q9tXbeLGUFf5u3KOLYMYb73SkmxTsnDXxcfc-UBNzeUMpQBEQh_bd3Gss8AxtBjNiseXUMUZfzTk\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/slQx8sAeMBsq1Mu-_6Tg7bGjapNyeJfbSm40uiK1YmjsjkhLoygw9F5WcWKq9NhAzR_6NZ31gejhEBkDSWT0XLU\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qrJ11rGyKZFjFPy0KHUcTNovMH5YpM7v_Jo8zXRcGi75iatsQUz8n48Mtv7BZeLxMzHiaCM8veFZrXIdG6xnhw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2SjEnPLGNRsB4MEmbk_AzwcNFcDUywBimj8ja8ytBcKg15UJ4ejezvdtN-1efhpSJ5k1iC9L2seE-0pSE2w8r-I\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4e30WB8pGF379_UAjOwaQjmG_wkj-spdkx1IMVK86Z054JXAr6luYfsTsoRKg8LrHp3Z_fpo75echZLdqcgB\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3VwKipSZdJ_Q9tXbeLGUFf5u3KOLYMYb73SkmxTsnDXxcfc-UBNzeUMpQBEQh_bd3Gss8AxtBjNiseXUMUZfzTk\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/slQx8sAeMBsq1Mu-_6Tg7bGjapNyeJfbSm40uiK1YmjsjkhLoygw9F5WcWKq9NhAzR_6NZ31gejhEBkDSWT0XLU\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qrJ11rGyKZFjFPy0KHUcTNovMH5YpM7v_Jo8zXRcGi75iatsQUz8n48Mtv7BZeLxMzHiaCM8veFZrXIdG6xnhw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2SjEnPLGNRsB4MEmbk_AzwcNFcDUywBimj8ja8ytBcKg15UJ4ejezvdtN-1efhpSJ5k1iC9L2seE-0pSE2w8r-I\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4e30WB8pGF379_UAjOwaQjmG_wkj-spdkx1IMVK86Z054JXAr6luYfsTsoRKg8LrHp3Z_fpo75echZLdqcgB\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3VwKipSZdJ_Q9tXbeLGUFf5u3KOLYMYb73SkmxTsnDXxcfc-UBNzeUMpQBEQh_bd3Gss8AxtBjNiseXUMUZfzTk\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/slQx8sAeMBsq1Mu-_6Tg7bGjapNyeJfbSm40uiK1YmjsjkhLoygw9F5WcWKq9NhAzR_6NZ31gejhEBkDSWT0XLU\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qrJ11rGyKZFjFPy0KHUcTNovMH5YpM7v_Jo8zXRcGi75iatsQUz8n48Mtv7BZeLxMzHiaCM8veFZrXIdG6xnhw\"]]],\"Kingshot\",[\"4.3\",4.3224425],\"Strategy\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.run.tower.defense\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.run.tower.defense\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.run.tower.defense\"]],[\"qgJfGl0INkoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMQobChVjb20ucnVuLnRvd2VyLmRlZmVuc2UQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Kingshot is an innovative idle medieval survival game that combines strategic gameplay with rich details waiting to be explored.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen a sudden rebellion overturns the fate of an entire dynasty and ignites a devastating war, countless people lose their homes. In a world riddled with societal collapse, rebel invasions, rampant disease, and mobs desperate for resources, survival is the ultimate challenge. As a governor in these turbulent times, it\\u0026#39;s up to you to lead your people through these adversities, devising internal and diplomatic strategies to rekindle the spark of civilization.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Core Features]\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDefend Against Invasions\\u003cbr\\u003eStay vigilant and ready to repel invasions at any moment. Your town, the last bastion of hope, depends on it. Gather resources, upgrade your defenses, and prepare for battle to ensure survival in these tough times.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eManage Human Resources\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a unique gameplay mechanic involving the allocation of survivor roles such as workers, hunters, and chefs. Monitor their health and happiness to ensure they remain productive. Respond quickly to illness to make sure everyone receives timely treatment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEstablish Laws\\u003cbr\\u003eCodes of law are vital for sustaining civilization and are crucial for the growth and strength of your town.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Strategic Gameplay]\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eResource Struggle\\u003cbr\\u003eAmidst the sudden state collapse, the continent is flooded with untapped resources. Refugees, rebels, and power-hungry governors are all eyeing these precious materials. Ready yourself for battle and use every strategy at your disposal to secure these resources!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBattle for Power\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete against other players for the ultimate honor of becoming the strongest governor in this grand strategy game. Claim the throne and reign supreme!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eForge Alliances\\u003cbr\\u003eEase the burden of survival in this chaotic world by forming or joining alliances. Collaborate with allies to rebuild civilization!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRecruit Heroes\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game features a roster of unique heroes, each waiting to be recruited. Bringing together heroes with various talents and skills is essential for taking the initiative and ensuring safety in these desperate times.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete with Other Governors\\u003cbr\\u003eHone your heroes\\u0026#39; skills, assemble your squads, and challenge other governors. Victory not only earns you valuable points, but also grants access to rare items. Lead your town to the top of the rankings and showcase the rise of a great civilization.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAdvance Technology\\u003cbr\\u003eWith the rebellion obliterating almost all technological advancements, it\\u0026#39;s crucial to start rebuilding and reclaiming the fragments of lost tech. The race to master cutting-edge technology could determine the dominator of this new world order!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Stay Connected]\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/5cYPN24ftf\"],\"Century Games PTE. LTD.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DnGRN1DORz-ufSd8yvQv2i9aNFsVrzTEA4XgJZDmteorjBEYXsYb3jFyxWsqX_Rv_ITizboFPRmo_UlJuOdL\"],null,[105,176,120,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence, Alcohol Reference\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.run.tower.defense\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.run.tower.defense\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Strategy\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Tower defense\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Medieval fantasy\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],