bOE3gTPzLoR0xWSfLoyvQHTR4BEqKCORwJB1AhI2fXyDf-GF1HUeCxBxYu9h_DqiYtHF-bfzhcmCvlY\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tTzGLpjyIyYIfMaosqtqNj90r6CHC55zQ_zYop0VRP2kC7stQc2jRVXB9vcbPGarevC3qKqaoqQ9LpX7pH7jdcE\"]]],\"Category Sort\",[\"4.5\",4.45098],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.meemeegames.categorysort\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.meemeegames.categorysort\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.meemeegames.categorysort\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIOUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAoiChxjb20ubWVlbWVlZ2FtZXMuY2F0ZWdvcnlzb3J0EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Game Description\\u003cbr\\u003eCategory Sort is a fun and relaxing Solitaire-style emoji puzzle game where you match memojis based on their categories. Carefully observe each memoji and place it in the correct group to create perfect matches.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, levels become more challenging with new categories, limited space, and tricky arrangements that test your logic and decision-making skills. The gameplay is simple to learn but offers increasing depth, making it enjoyable for both casual players and puzzle lovers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith colorful memojis, smooth interactions, and satisfying matches, Category Sort delivers a rewarding and brain-teasing experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch memojis according to their categories\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy-to-learn, intuitive sorting mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIncreasing difficulty with smarter puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eColorful visuals and smooth gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing yet challenging puzzle experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSort smart, match right, and clear every level!\"],\"Lion Studios Plus\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vmOFABuIZ80-a_i5KAA60UvsWvJPjcYphIdUZDXhjBTvhcdGeZMhdYkZ1Ch6SAyNhFwWrT4uE7K6fO8vUcO8\"],null,[80,43,22,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.meemeegames.categorysort\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.meemeegames.categorysort\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.kiloo.subwaysurf\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rIMQN2JTiHSCj7IezGHkhE39-F66y3Epqlt-iyvveGzT5n0CPOrYDpSePQ7rZBvMJRY\"],null,[246,177,105,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.c