games.blockcraft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIPEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCL2E/uvzmeKNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIzCh0KF2NvbS5mdW5nYW1lcy5ibG9ja2NyYWZ0EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eReady? Block? Go! \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCraft and grow your own village or build freely in an unlimited open world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eFeatures:\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eFun building game:\\u003c/b\\u003e Lots of different constructions. Build a house, a castle, a mine or even a spaceship and the Eiffel Tower!\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eSimulate the best life\\u003c/b\\u003e it\\u0026#39;s a fun simulator game! \\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eLots of pixels:\\u003c/b\\u003e enjoy the special pixel graphics.\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eChoose your character!\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eAnimals\\u003c/b\\u003e adopt and play with animals! It\\u0026#39;s fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eHighlights:\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAmazing buildings in 3D\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay now one of the best construction games!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLots of Pets and free exploration\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with pets! Adopt a dog, a cat or even an elephant! Unlike other block games, there are no monsters in Block Craft 3D: you can focus on constructing the best buildings or exploring the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMultiplayer game: visit your friends\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart the exploration! You can visit the city built by your friends (or foes) and help them finish their construction. Multiplayer is so much fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCreate and sell\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Block Craft, no need for mods, launchers, or PE. You can create custom blocks, craft special furniture, or complete a blueprint of a building! And even better: sell those and receive lots of gems!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNot so creative?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Block Craft 3D, no need for maps, just visit the village of your friends to get new ideas and follow the blueprints and guides to easily build fantastic constructions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTry this simulator now and have fun building your city!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBlock Craft 3D: Free Building is brought to you by Fun Games for Free, creator of the 100+ Million downloads games Flight Pilot Simulator, Sniper 3D, and Sniper Shooter.\\u003c/b\\u003e\"],\"Wildlife Studios\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7AWLgvfuYSLy4xHpC_kmolnek9psOVAn-TDefmHQIFP8uvP6UI7sYEFtCW4XoI43XM3GNpAedTgg_BdRGxdf\"],null,[160,235,254,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, Shares Location, Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $119.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Arcade\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Sandbox\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.arrowout.puzzle.amzejam\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SFD4BqR_ewMPaU2fTz4IUVwvGW9sOZHRR1v9NeENYDegKu0Ue0f8g4UPzNJE2C58-lYXOSBa4mTLzjKQVYq1emA\"],null,[254,254,253,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8AGQOVE1pZX8Zgwhz3zBGxR_Y0DyZEpambiw_dIep3kh7DYT7_VqwWsy8jCHdvpj9ZEUXpdBdDFy5564quon\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4PIJcGGCS-ZfKa0Vc57hLdz2sQ0v0TSvrR5-dFYim31nBP4tuGvr9lFl0J_HSURr683aD2nIG62pl_GCxZqlgds\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pH5Ciu8C4HF8Cdwbl6pYR5pFN0YrghMXd3qv04vYdv4hnwQuAL4H4WgaqdKT6H_NP6iHFRvNdpEQ_Etz4VDOjoE\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EPUV5klsK1u6sC53w0kfmBAkB8wNqH-31jFKcJSUPPmRIKwYRfyEbbQ6eUucYfmLAzXEsw_rv0IOCjoXzvyd\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RaBelAwSQK5TZw9pHtbcykM-IaCL_vCo8TnY5q6zHG-MXZZ4zh0qnqhvxPtkOHQIv7HtGphSlrW8-Tu5SYIJ\"]]],\"Arrows Puzzle Relax\",[\"4.5\",4.4611397],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowout.puzzle.amzejam\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.arrowout.puzzle.amzejam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowout.puzzle.amzejam\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIPUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tR0IQALoCPQohChtjb20uYXJyb3dvdXQucHV6emxlLmFtemVqYW0QARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgFEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🌟 Why choose \\u0026quot;Arrows Puzzle Relax\\u0026quot;?\\u003cbr\\u003eMind Awakening: Challenge logic, planning and spatial perception in the interlacing of arrows - keep your brain active with clever arrow-pulling puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImmersive decompression: no time limit, no countdown pressure. Develop strategies calmly and enjoy pure thinking in a quiet atmosphere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinimalism: The screen design eliminates redundancy and minimizes visual interference, allowing you to fully immerse yourself in the art of puzzle solving.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake Control: Whether it\\u0026#39;s a quick 5-minute break or a long commute, it fits your pace perfectly.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Game highlights: intellectual game, tranquility of mind\\u003cbr\\u003eCraftsmanship levels: Thousands of hand-polished levels, say goodbye to boring random generation - each level is a unique puzzle-solving experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth curve: difficulty gradually increases. From easy to get started to deep brain-burning, it accurately matches your thinking growth, making it challenging but not frustrating.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePure aesthetics: Simple yet high-end design returns the visual focus to the puzzle itself - focusing on solving the puzzle rather than tedious operations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eZero-pressure experience: You can think over and over again and try multiple times. There is no step penalty, only the exploration of the optimal path.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTurn on at any time: supports offline play, no matter where you are, your private mental gym is always online.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Core gameplay: minimalist control, in-depth strategy\\u003cbr\\u003eCore task: Reasonably plan the order of arrow shooting. Make sure every arrow leaves the field smoothly without any collision.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIntuitive operation: Tap the screen to pull the arrow. The operation is extremely simple, but the depth of the strategy behind it is fascinating.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMultidimensional thinking: Who moves first? Who is the queen? How to get around obstacles? Every simple click is a test of forward planning.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect pass: complete the level with zero collisions and zero mistakes, and attack the logic peak of higher difficulty.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Intimate function: your puzzle solving companion\\u003cbr\\u003eSmart Tips: Encountering a bottleneck? Use elimination props to eliminate them directly, which is a shortcut to your victory.\"],\"olfa\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JpDN_rdOHMm40PgzM5lBDQzFvxkaHXkeMtRTvtiSi9iNmuCUAMNMpS0FkxCIau57u7wJduk1b0xbN5HTT6W94A\"],null,[195,233,237,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Cash Rewards\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowout.puzzle.amzejam\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.arrowout.puzzle.amzejam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"