Drc5fuDW\"]]],\"Color Slide - Hexa Puzzle\",[\"4.6\",4.5518003],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.awesome.puzzlehexasort\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.awesome.puzzlehexasort\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.awesome.puzzlehexasort\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIPkoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgogChpjb20uYXdlc29tZS5wdXp6bGVoZXhhc29ydBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"VvOGgqukWKw\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:VvOGgqukWKw?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:VvOGgqukWKw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlfpfMW-XAy8aLV4LIxhEMB2zkFcl3fQ4ZAzROQ6snaBGPA2-xCdoNzvgJ0keXfg2y9lP1zbd8Vke5RYN3CD1blXotO81sxcSSjv9ObJiz5Ibsp5hSicpIPnv-h9BDIZ7IHC0a-ftULdjSsn4gC32VDeFJqA5gRWlwksW5khCUZF12Ex0JGEDkt8kEGpfBAZqrk94TeelaSwL-4fWY1yNjgZD2AAcuXfDrsr1MTxQbgnewcNa-nEPPqLrTflXEIQl2r4LhkQg8ZSZDBPApahFcogCcZcoRHRFNe5bo2Ww7cFmFLj1_AfkDKmLkHHSI\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VvOGgqukWKw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003e🧩 Fun hex-traordinaire🔶🔷\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for a simple yet difficult puzzle game that will both help you relax AND train your brain? Color Slide - Hexa Puzzle is your one stop shop for all of that and more! As one of the most satisfying hexa games, it lets you enjoy relaxing sorting as you sort, slide and color match hexagons across the playing field, merging colors and making room for more pieces to appear. Just slide the pieces into place and enjoy this addictive color match puzzle as your stress slips away!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🔝 Hex-cellent Work 🏆\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat might seem simple at first gets progressively more difficult and challenging as you progress and more colors of hexagons appear, and the playing field changes shape to make maneuvers trickier. Like the best hexa puzzle games, this puzzle rewards logic, patience, and smart moves. You’ll need to carefully slide each hexagon into position, master every color match strategy, and sharpen your color sorting skills to clear the board. So get ready to slide, think, and enjoy satisfying color match fun as you dive right into this delightful sorting mindgame!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🧩 Hex-ational Features\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔️ Progressive difficulty – With each level this color match puzzle game becomes more and more difficult. Multi colored blocks, new colors, funky shaped playing fields, and more will force you to slow down, slide color pieces strategically, and focus on precise color sorting in order to properly organize all the hexagons by color and win the round. Fans of relaxing hexa puzzle games will love the increasing challenge. As soon as you master one skill you’ll be presented with a new one to keep things exciting!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔️ Ageless entertainment – Whether you’re 5 or 95, you’ll be able to happily play this brain game. Like many popular hexa games, there’s no timer and no penalties, so you can try levels over and over again until you get them right if need be, or put the game down for a bit and come back later to keep trying. Every successful color match move and smart sorting decision brings you closer to clearing the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔️ Chill graphics – No bouncy shapes, excessive vibrations, or explosions of color – we created this game to help you relax and that means simple but enjoyable graphics so that your eyes and brain aren’t distracted. This also makes the game great for kids since they won’t get overstimulated by all the crazy images common in other hexa puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔️ Relaxing gameplay – In keeping with the graphics, the game in general is built around the goal of helping you let go of stress. Stop and start at any moment, and don’t fret about points or goals. Just kick back, slide at your own pace, and relax as you focus on each satisfying color match in one of the most calming hexa puzzle games available.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e 🧠 Hexagon-a be Great \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCasual players and puzzle aficionados alike will adore this relaxing logic hexa puzzle game. With no countdown clock or penalties, you can take your time carefully matching up the colored tiles to clear the board as you also clear your mind. Before you know it you’ll be a color master, whizzing through levels with ease even as they get progressively more challenging – download Color Slide - Hexa Puzzle today to get matching and relaxing!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy  \\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/z33VmL-yn-FEEg9HE137DMZ0lP7i4G9UvsskT4v7VXrVWYVSCwaLiB0mHtI4bPQYIA\"],null,[79,160,224,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,n