ttps://i.ytimg.com/vi/0W2ZPF_etkc/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"DMZ: Recon introduces a new tactical extraction experience in Call of Duty: Mobile, launching with Serpent Island, a brand-new map, and Building 21, a returning favorite from the original DMZ on PC and console. Players will complete contracts, outsmart hostiles and enemy squads, and extract their loot to grow stronger with each run. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCALL OF DUTY® like never before, bringing fast-paced FPS action to your fingertips.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJump into intense Multiplayer battles with classic modes like Team Deathmatch, Domination, and Kill Confirmed on legendary maps such as Shipment, Raid, and Standoff. Prefer Battle Royale? Squad up and conquer with dynamic modes like Tank Isolated and Training Ground, set in an iconic battlefield.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBattle Royale chaos awaits! Explore all 5 POIs, fight to survive, and claim victory. Or, team up with friends for action-packed Multiplayer matches on fan-favorite maps like Nuketown.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin millions of players and dominate the battlefield in CALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE—the ultimate free-to-play FPS experience. Whether it’s fast 5v5 team deathmatches, epic Zombies mode, or all-out Battle Royale warfare, the action never stops.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLock and load—your next mission starts now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDOWNLOAD FOR FREE TODAY\\u003cbr\\u003eCALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE boasts console quality HD gaming on your phone with customizable and intuitive controls, voice and text chat with your friends, and thrilling 3D graphics and sound. Enjoy controller games? We got you! Experience this iconic FPS franchise, on the go. Play this FPS gun game anywhere. Every mission feels like a high-stakes delta operation, pushing your shooting skills to the limit.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNEW SEASONAL CONTENT UPDATED MONTHLY\\u003cbr\\u003eCALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE has a variety of FPS game modes, maps, themed events, and rewards so it never gets old. Every season expands upon the story in the CALL OF DUTY® universe and brings new \\u0026amp; unique unlockable content. Jump into battle royale today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCUSTOMIZE YOUR UNIQUE LOADOUT\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock and earn dozens of iconic operators, weapons, outfits, score streaks, and new pieces of gear, allowing you to play CALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE your way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCOMPETITIVE AND SOCIAL PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003eFan of war multiplayer games? Gather your friends and test your mettle in competitive ranked mode or sharpen your aim in social play. Join a clan for a sense of community and earn unique rewards for participating in Clan Wars. With every encounter, experience the sheer force of this legendary FPS shooter game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDOWNLOAD OPTIONS TO REDUCE APP SIZE\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload and play CALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE without the barrier of storage space. As part of an effort to make CALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE more accessible, the initial app download size has been reduced and additional options allow players to choose what is downloaded to experience the full game, such as HD resources, maps, weapons, and operators.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave what it takes to compete with the best? Download CALL OF DUTY®: MOBILE now!\\u003cbr\\u003e_________________________________________________________\\u003cbr\\u003eNOTE: We welcome any feedback during your experience to improve the game. To give feedback, in-game go to \\u0026gt; Settings \\u0026gt; Feedback \\u0026gt; Contact Us.\\u003cbr\\u003eSubscribe for Updates! ---\\u0026gt; profile.callofduty.com/cod/registerMobileGame\\u003cbr\\u003e_________________________________________________________\\u003cbr\\u003eNote: An internet connection is required to play this game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease note this app contains social features that allow you to connect and play with friends and push notifications to inform you when exciting events or new content are taking place in the game. You can choose whether or not to utilize these features.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e©/TM/® 2026 Activision Publishing, Inc.\"],\"Activision Publishing, Inc.\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Uyg6Q5ZmvIUbtXN5VnQnY44Ho5KANrNGoY-eOQv-1Uw2HCz_8URkNeQRrMB93m9MkvnUHc-algqQaIFfZU-V\"],null,[191,191,192,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Strong Language\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.activision.callofduty.shooter\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.activision.callofduty.shooter\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Tactical shooter\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Multiplayer\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Competitive\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.moonactive.holestars\",7],[null,2,[5