FpPOHHHwo\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xeIfg2JKqVKb3SeZkrR2r4OE7P3CHRt8FnGUBVbzytMQg_RXCbXbfs-ISgYR6HrourOp\"]]],\"Duck Survival\",[\"4.9\",4.858357],\"Strategy\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mrtgd2us.google\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mrtgd2us.google\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mrtgd2us.google\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIS0oTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLwoZChNjb20ubXJ0Z2QydXMuZ29vZ2xlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003e【Pre-Registration Rewards】Pre-register now to claim 777 Free Draws, a Limited Duck Soldier Skin, an Epic Gatling Gun, and 100K Banknotes at launch!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDucks vs. Zombies — fight your way through the apocalypse! \\u003cbr\\u003eAn easy-to-play Roguelike shooter combined with thrilling tower defense survival gameplay!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Build by Day, Defend by Night!\\u003cbr\\u003eDaytime: Use your resources to upgrade your base, recruit soldiers, and deploy powerful defenses like Machine Gun Towers and EMP Towers to prepare for battle!  \\u003cbr\\u003eNighttime: Nearly a hundred mutated zombies and giant bosses storm in—defend your fortress until dawn!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Quirky Ducks, Doomsday Survival!\\u003cbr\\u003eForget human survivors—this time, you’ll play as a brave duck, unlocking a wide variety of stylish and unique duck skins!  \\u003cbr\\u003eEvery night you survive fuels your base\\u0026#39;s evolution. Fail? The zombies will quack their way through your defenses!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Assemble Heroes, Build the Ultimate Team!\\u003cbr\\u003eSkilled agents, machine-gun-wielding baby dragons, and many more super-powered heroes are waiting to join you!  \\u003cbr\\u003eFreely combine elements like Burning, Lightning, Frost, Energy, and Physical to activate exclusive team synergies and build your invincible duck army! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Random Skills, Fresh Experience Every Run!\\u003cbr\\u003eA huge variety of skills can drop during battle—will you choose Meteor Strike, Frost Shield, or Focused Laser?  \\u003cbr\\u003eAdapt to the ever-changing battlefield, adjust your strategy on the fly, and experience the endless possibilities of Roguelike combat!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Diverse Builds, Strategy Meets Progression!\\u003cbr\\u003eHeroes, skills, and tower defense mechanics work together to create a wide range of combat builds.  \\u003cbr\\u003eWith gear, gems, and other progression systems outside of battle, you can keep growing stronger and crush endless zombie hordes!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rich Gameplay, Escalating Challenges!\\u003cbr\\u003eBeyond intense base defense battles, you can also dive into dungeon exploration, Guild Boss fights, and Arena PvP.  \\u003cbr\\u003eIn the face of endless zombie hordes, prove that you are the ultimate survivor!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you quack your way to the very end of the apocalypse?  \\u003cbr\\u003eJoin Duck Survival now—rally your duck squad and dive into fast-paced horde shooting and strategic tower defense battles!\"],\"Joy Nice Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2lPy_rEjeiVJhsDcCMagUw2JLbQ6BsVpu1jPUPu6qJ1HjMJf1-OUOIb3fHkYBO6PFRXljoJ8RoOC91Tun_ab\"],null,[115,20,193,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.goog