-stress relaxing game offers a delightful collection of mini-games. Engage in a variety of calming activities, each carefully crafted to provide a sense of peace and joy. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave a break!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax your mind, relieve your stress and enjoy challenging yet relaxing puzzles. The gameplay is designed to be non-competitive and stress-free, with no pressure to achieve perfection. Instead, the focus is on providing a peaceful environment where players can engage in repetitive, satisfying tasks that naturally encourage relaxation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThera are more than 15 mini games available for you to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003eSome core mini games of Mini Games and Relaxing Toys:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1.\\tKinfe hit –Destroy objects using a knife.\\u003cbr\\u003e2.\\tBubble up– Pop the bubbles.\\u003cbr\\u003e3.\\tFidget spinner– Spin the virtual fidgets to release your stress.\\u003cbr\\u003e4.\\tGlass crack– Crack the glass of mobile phone as you wish.\\u003cbr\\u003e5.\\tLighting bulb– Turn on and off the lighting bulb.\\u003cbr\\u003e6.\\tPendulum– Enjoy the pendulum by using newton’s cradle.\\u003cbr\\u003e7.\\tPop it game– Pop the different shapes to relax.\\u003cbr\\u003e8.\\tSpeaker– Plug-in the wires and enjoy music.\\u003cbr\\u003e9.\\tSticker peel– Peel the stickers to get relaxing feel.\\u003cbr\\u003e10.\\tTap tap shots– Dunk the ball into the basket.\\u003cbr\\u003e11.\\tTile puzzle block– Solve the tile puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e12.\\tTic tac toe– Clear the tik tac toe puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e13.\\tStamp it– Stamp applications.\\u003cbr\\u003e14.\\tShape pop it– Pop different shapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e15.\\tSnooker– Pot the balls and enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e16.\\tGyroballs– Keep the ball spinning for as long as possible.\\u003cbr\\u003e17.\\tFlip card– Collect the most matching pairs to win the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e18.\\tBlackboard– Write whatever you want on blackboard.\\u003cbr\\u003e19.\\tPong ball– Throw ball into the cups.\\u003cbr\\u003e20.\\tInsect Swat– Tap the screen to swat insects.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOverall, an anti-stress relaxing game provides a peaceful escape from the pressures of daily life with perfect blend of simplicity, beauty, and calmness.\"],\"The Fashion Valley\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BCktRUxuuwylTTR-v97W2cymn3Bxs-m6I9KNYN6FKwUyzQDiwzck_ptGUKe3d2EuJr2f\"],null,[91,42,22,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tvf.anti.stress.relaxing.mini.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tvf.anti.stress.relaxing.mini.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$4.99 - $9.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Minigames\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.oakever.jigsawcard\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fU6WokYn-tj78D0Wy4mdvb