-lh.googleusercontent.com/eULTW_FaWQfWuy-mRNDYGLzGm-qWvB1IUTVs4VNPxr0cndqAk-EDiEr3eycRKR689RU\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SCVUkSXBGb7e8J9LBb59QAjBd2wj8sgeK0FLlBklNzSEeF4a_L2ZrKybkiqsHzNfwjqR\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oubypsq9DY2jO4GCeDnTjh2BzSfX1LSDYpfml-yxs4paAjqyjNuLyio6WfGvQB8rkaA\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lHOPALIy8o84SmcbHwtpKzbd9arCs1sid5X_nHwr9uo3aYvMZzN_Zr8YTU21KZPUKA\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X6jMuVsTHMIKvSkffXYPkZQalh0wdutdWrU_VOGWs42vzzghzRONGBmXx35bAYu2f7w\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MZhGdJkydaG7K2kGdbgs2PLtakkRnkRMCQDTjlGdUjV-XfXaSwxeJXTKrXcmvHylyQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DQitIBEI2fPkApMmdrhAXnQYQRBgXyTerjTjMDlee46OThnoSQaeD0evjC9LLfpB5g\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/z2ze_Dc-RPghez65L8UqWzJEcrd25xttCr5HQXn4HH-MEk3cc5-olEmqVaM2NT0pZNI\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WEybuALrlTNg33XK-IqkQOw1cPZGohiO5_04E-T0th4rBVoD_RqhQlEKDYQmNRD-KRE\"]]],\"Kick the Buddy－Fun Action Game\",[\"4.1\",4.122564],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgendary.kickthebuddy\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playgendary.kickthebuddy\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgendary.kickthebuddy\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIU0oTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPgoiChxjb20ucGxheWdlbmRhcnkua2lja3RoZWJ1ZGR5EAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAECgQIBhAB\"],[[[null,null,\"cLqIm1na13c\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:cLqIm1na13c?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:cLqIm1na13c\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlawihftTL66Vd-EUVfIPpShDvlt6keexYQtppSipwaMrnd0ghPn5x8TSCG0Fewy-b8mevJPTqz12AYmIawXvBne-djWi9GdseBb0mw4SkIATHVbBr-qZnXsxS_niedxu3wRRN96CYsCv3rECB2M5erXHk2tSCzhbSVpmzx_HmMgEUgIvEBGOeKK_EVba_itEWr7JUw2LLkuUvbQbyZmWDE6S7chWncDOnaahYdlTFl-KZ3lfPRTPSil-gCUHwRiTtR0NNsopcC08r_cXmrOnBj8rNTcLdXKXeEhYWIY9nAZIkIv62vqqVPTj70Rio\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cLqIm1na13c/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Looking for a way to relax and unwind after a long day? Or maybe you’re just looking for a fun game to play when bored? Kick The Buddy is the perfect anti stress game for you! This cool game lets you take a break, have fun, and release some energy in a light-hearted way. Whether it’s kicking, punching, or tossing Buddy around, this is all about having fun without any real harm—after all, Buddy is just a ragdoll dummy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy you’ll love Kick The Buddy:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e– Fun \\u0026amp; Relaxing: Release stress with funny and simple gameplay. Punch, toss, or stretch Buddy in this anti-stress relaxing toy game.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Awesome Weapons: From heavy guns to imaginative gadgets, choose from a huge range of items to create your own fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Customize Buddy: Make your Buddy stand out! Add cool accessories and give him a whole new look.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Offline Fun: Enjoy the game anywhere! It’s one of the best anti stress games offline, so no need for Wi-Fi.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Non-stop Action: Whether you’re looking for a fun game or want to experiment with ragdoll game physics.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Great for Everyone: Fans of boy games for free, ragdoll simulators, and stickman dismounting will love this game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo need to worry about stress anymore—just kick, punch, and stretch Buddy in this funny game. Buddy never gets hurt—he’s just a test dummy ready for action! The gameplay is light-hearted, so it’s all about having fun without the stress of strategy or tough challenges. It’s not a killing game, Buddy is here to make you smile, not to be destroyed. You can experiment with toss the buddy, try some cool games weapons, or just have fun with dummy games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis one of the best destress relaxing games is perfect for:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e– People who want a fun game that’s easy to pick up and play.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Those looking for stress relief games after a busy day.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Players who enjoy fun no wifi games to pass the time.\\u003cbr\\u003e– Anyone looking for fun games with no wifi for travel or just to chill\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re a fan of destruction games, weird games to play, or simply want to kick back and relax with really fun games, Kick The Buddy has got you covered. It’s one of the fun awesome games that’ll make you laugh and relax at the same time!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSo, what are you waiting for? It’s time to beat the buddy and enjoy some stress relief in this humorous game. No pressure, no rush—just pure fun! Download now and see why it’s one of the funnest games out there.\"],\"Playgendary Limited\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X9POXAC-ScO9YZ3hPiRD0XsYXSnXLJK3oNuNv9YjBpOxFh1d0xahUnvD6ekYCEt1-UKm\"],null,[143,56,32,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Simulated Gambling\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xM