th exciting activities and endless entertainment in the Talking Tom \\u0026amp; Friends universe!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stylish Hair, Makeup, and Fashion Choices: Transform Angela with various hairstyles, makeup options, and fashionable outfits. Dress her up for fashion shows and personalize her look to make her shine like a star.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Exciting Activities: Engage in a variety of fun activities, including dancing, baking, martial arts, trampoline jumping, jewelry making, and planting flowers on the balcony.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Delicious Food and Snacks: Bake and cook delicious treats for Angela. From cakes to cookies, satisfy her sweet tooth with your culinary skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Travel Adventures: Take Angela on jet-setting travel adventures to explore new destinations and cultures. And to shop until she drops!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini-Games and Puzzles: Challenge your skills with fun mini-games and puzzles that test your reflexes and strategic thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Sticker Collections: Collect and complete sticker albums to unlock special rewards and new content. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExpress Your Creativity: Angela inspires you to be creative, bold, and expressive. Design her outfits, experiment with makeup, and decorate her home to reflect your unique style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of the hit games My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Tom Friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions, which are auto-renewable, unless cancelled before the end of the current subscription period. You can manage and cancel a subscription in your Google Play Account settings after purchase.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Some features may be subject to different pricing and availability.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qaNYCFA4SlRAp8zDl6bHe1w0fPV6QZOLZkdsuLO7GqOV3eqKoTeYcemK6MFsVUCmWvUhJL-BDFAXJ3N3Uh0r\"],null,[248,178,236,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Pet\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"in.playsimple.wordsearch\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k7RcltpIXoXb8EeDUxZxgDnPoKsRVp6t5YCegGIFAL91fk1PHX65W62uAfqwcg5drWpW\"],null,[253,254,254,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2778,1284],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OXRO1oD_jAqJEYg6rvDf42uBEosHxBeUk7ObIvUmm1r1Pd5-P0R_ZG-rv25ZDyTcuG8\"]],[null,2,[2778,1284],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0n9mMWAqB_K9uZBEkynjJp5oSCXMt-P_6l4eQX_8qJpZaUTkgAHUTtwAtYRBTxYtzQ\"]],[null,2,[2778,1284],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NLLNKabLCJX5BIrCLRZyYiIrUoEb6ugGU-2l_7p7_VZrcebZ6Yh0mlcnwhQF8NkT\"]],[null,2,[2778,1284],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/idtAE7__BwhtrN-dGyX1LZNy8mua6WTaZGNXVpkctgvyqie9D9qjpmmMRr1tYL9yePU\"]]],\"Word Search Explorer\",[\"4.9\",4.9061685],\"Word\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003din.playsimple.wordsearch\\u0026rdid\\u003din.playsimple.wordsearch\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003din.playsimple.wordsearch\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIWUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhpbi5wbGF5c2ltcGxlLndvcmRzZWFyY2gQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"With Word Search Explorer embark on a wondrous quest of adventure and wisdom, where the fun never stops!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis FREE TO PLAY word game makes learning new words so easy and much more fun. Flex your brain, connect the letters and swipe your way through hundreds of word puzzles, while steadily growing your vocabulary and confidence for the challenges ahead!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSuccessfully completing each puzzle will bring you closer to your next destination!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuckle-up and get ready to go on an endeavour that takes you through breathtaking landscapes while training your brain to become a TRUE champion of the mind!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBelieve the hype, join thousands of word game enthusiasts and download Word Search Explorer today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs easy as taking a walk in the park, find words that are hidden in the letter grid related to a common theme. Swipe your fingers to form the words that are hidden in plain sight. The puzzles get trickier as you progress while gaining more wisdom!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- FREE TO PLAY: Get this game for FREE and put your word game skills to the test\\u003cbr\\u003e- GUIDING HINTS: The game offers multiple hints which will guide and help you on your journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e- PLAY ANYTIME, ANYWHERE: Take a break and play offline wherever you want!\\u003cbr\\u003e- CHALLENGING PUZZLES: Easy to play, hard to master! A new challenge awaits for you after every puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e- BOOSTS YOUR VOCABULARY: Improve your vocabulary as the game exposes you to a wide variety of words that will help you in your daily life\\u003cbr\\u003e- SYNC YOUR GAME PROGRESS: Login through facebook and sync your game progress across multiple devices\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePack your bags and get ready to Explore, Wander \\u0026amp; Discover. No need to wait, start playing Word Search Explorer and begin your voyage today!\"],\"PlaySimple Games\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QKSBXslhbgWB9gyf2BHsGDxQ9o-d