side your Buddy Pokémon to help make your Pokémon stronger and earn rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete in epic Gym battles and...Team up with other Trainers to catch powerful Pokémon during Raid Battles!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s time to get moving—your real-life adventures await! Let’s GO!\\u003cbr\\u003e_______________\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNotes: \\u003cbr\\u003e- This app is free-to-play and offers in-game purchases. It is optimized for smartphones, not tablets.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compatible with Android devices that have 2GB RAM or more and have Android Version 6.0–10.0+ installed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compatibility is not guaranteed for devices without GPS capabilities or devices that are connected only to Wi-Fi networks.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Application may not run on certain devices even if they have compatible OS versions installed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- It is recommended to play while connected to a network in order to obtain accurate location information.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compatibility information may be changed at any time.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Please visit PokemonGO.com for additional compatibility information. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Information current as of October 20, 2020.\"],\"Niantic, Inc.\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4Xc_uBDUHxojVOJsTTWhA_fGlTZuB6GQKwr48a-PMrxYFwuFutAhmXOsNmluh8saq0w\"],null,[248,223,199,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,nu