oogleusercontent.com/dDYeiB-2DjtA9yRYCQUEd7Vi_D0d2-7lraH5iue9Wu6NCxfoDo4aYV50sycf6T4N6vUl\"]],[null,2,[1800,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PyPb63Zh6dNmnVJuid_dMGZ7MZfcpyL_i85y26IIjMS4LWQfjNlNuIzB_--HPc4o5BM\"]],[null,2,[1800,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ttoIEzePSqvmj52lvtbXsLLKzlz2era6_g_nErktJY9h1tyWfqc8wtF0QwknvFoTMw\"]],[null,2,[1800,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/va7RPx2SzRaj_KzRqnUkOwUADKYxp0AA3NFL2yn5mc_2THG7qzFIprUyOn9McWUOgSsB\"]],[null,2,[1800,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yU6fYvn-JCbh1ciTOe4C6XFKfakumVzu7LCXvVRm_ZtImdaq24-QM6YnO1RsCZDpSZKC\"]],[null,2,[1800,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JbH2lBAwOTVN9rrClxJq-2TuIrnUP2qOJUFjrix1gbkH114FBD735n-LyKhapgkeZog\"]]],\"8 Ball Pool\",[\"4.8\",4.795786],\"Sports\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miniclip.eightballpool\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.miniclip.eightballpool\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miniclip.eightballpool\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIX0oTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCPH2n9HInauNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI2CiAKGmNvbS5taW5pY2xpcC5laWdodGJhbGxwb29sEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"MkKWx0uVyRw\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:MkKWx0uVyRw?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:MkKWx0uVyRw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznln8u1Gm0MkfyuL74jMcQDR4h-IIyRCqv9B9sLUL64WP4YoE5LU11c7pJCWYJE20nvFF9MWeXzu6GbY5P6ARB6AjojqtxxwgM-uuJ8yNNByt8L_SRIiI8SuR2H2tDPr96o-E8DBPFbIEzh8_cXhktnPoowfMVBK6ieZbt9LAqJBZm8O1UVd9SO0fEh0K7rZCNmldoqN9yyUF1wQ4HsNfAG1RlPxrTqbrC6cSU2qgPm7Naz3QWPJA6BnT9arYDNl7AQCpKX3Q6AkPdHcMMqQnrTTJQPlTtgOy14oaskmH3D1TnoSmnRLQUkbB8577Q\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MkKWx0uVyRw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Do you want to play in the world of pool games? 8 Ball Pool is an addictive challenging game based on real 3D pool games, where you will challenge your friends online. Become a master of the pool!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe balls game is easy to win. You just have to select the table and get ready. Join us and challenge your friends to this ball game in PvP mode. Use your pool strategy with the cue wisely in this online multiplayer ball game as every round will be more difficult after each level. You can play in multiplayer or PvP mode in different pool tables. Become the best player and challenge your friends in this pool game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can play pool in multiplayer or PvP mode using different balls and table types. 8 Ball Pool is designed to help your intelligence. You will improve the aim when shooting balls with the cue. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS\\u003cbr\\u003ePlaying pool in multiplayer tournaments with friends is easy: Sign in for free with your Miniclip or Facebook account and you’ll be able to challenge your friends straight from this multiplayer 8 ball game. Challenge friends to a PvP pool match on the go. Aim and shoot your best balls with a customized cue in our online 3D PvP tournament!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY FOR COINS AND WIN EXCLUSIVE ITEMS\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your cue and pool table! In every competitive PvP match you play in our league, there’ll be Coins at stake – win the match and the Coins are yours. You can also buy new items in the Pool Shop. Compete in our 3D multiplayer league and become a master of 8 balls in 3D!\\u003cbr\\u003eThe 8 Ball level system means you’re always facing challenging players in the 8 ball league. Play multiplayer 8 Ball Pool to increase your ranking in our pool league and get access to more exclusive 8 Ball Pool match locations, where you play and compete against the best online pool players. 8 Ball Pool has different match levels: It doesn\\u0026#39;t matter if you\\u0026#39;re an amateur or a pro player, take your chance in our PvP competitions with your friends and other players and win the pool challenge: Aim with the cue and prove your skills in this free 8 ball online tournament.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*This 8 Ball Pool game requires internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game includes optional in-game purchases (includes random items).\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay on the Web at miniclip.com/pool\\u003cbr\\u003eTERMS AND CONDITIONS: http://www.miniclip.com/terms-and-conditions\\u003cbr\\u003ePRIVACY POLICY: http://www.miniclip.com/privacy\\u003cbr\\u003e------------------------------------\\u003cbr\\u003eMiniclip: http://www.miniclip.com\\u003cbr\\u003eLike 8 Ball Pool: http://on.fb.me/Wx4f23\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: http://facebook.com/miniclip\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter: http://twitter.com/miniclip\"],\"Miniclip.com\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8xQandAjjrWWqYCvblg6s5-DhsnCnVP2RdSgRfXx3gdBOOCbypR0gCNGhiLIvh0DspQ\"],null,[0,116,192,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miniclip.eightballpool\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.miniclip.eightballpool\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.10 - $299.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Sports\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Billiards\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"wool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7mblp4y5nLCDobmHGKKHcWSlpJuqsRs5VDu-9sA8KV_FI77ZcxOU6KoPBJcAWvt5aXuffTC4KkwTy20VZtVUow\"],null,[21,153,236,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Tmqdr5sY2fyzTjM75qPETOvfbLk5lvjQhzbtHTzvzlb5aIbaXLwa-Fj-SuXEQ9oGEBhx428Q6VB7WNxVShPGXfQ\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bympe-jc6VsnK3Uxw9j9Kj2AoGCUOUO3X--oElglOqobjV25r7dCNpHKGFmsZH-wUsfyeyHgvTh8vFKgbnK39A\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zCe5uPDPmhnjCXNOjruiqlT2Cd4E5cvVWJa-YGOjoKAiH9D-mKa6ftbdcyCS4ixHeKuz7o1Hy2oYvrkCh8oa\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D6qxLRs7wqds8pVcdw0JSGJRLl6tigmbiwhuFZQQKCfHGMKj4yjnWbhDhOCP5SNU1g1yjSbylcWVSJcCuPZNvA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YTVp5pYnH-0bs28QXj9O8ClmKzwSLAH9UXRY-Ppq2uHI08tqgjTCvgU6aYniFlvlAqNHaG616_0hbrdmqGqk\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yLf1hTCsNSNAj1mzsh05Gr8lWu2og24HFE24sZqcYqfWmJVKjjyNLsB36Dw0qYYJNjjnx4GgvU23wcbya6hikg\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Mj7akYUbx_prVgnAfoFNehk3h53EkFRWx5GHFTVRMjwrZeALa0-b5H_x3EB-pRvgtuD1esc0VtbkCpvXL5pJbw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sXl_0WvsZM3qBvhv9l8yQsoUbIcHAUE6VmHJ8B07saKZ9q1B8d9XyW7FyzNLnxo9aHDRWJimJWhsOKnV5xdjFq4\"]]],\"Wool Crush™\",[\"4.7\",4.6924925],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJyGnAIYEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCOmRmL6pgbuPQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI8CiYKIHdvb2wubWF0Y2guY29sb3Iuc29ydC5qYW0ucHV6emxlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"Wool Crush – Logic Color Sort Puzzle Master\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter a puzzle-focused world where every challenge in wool sort, yarn sort, and color sort requires careful deduction and step-by-step reasoning. Wool Crush – built on 3D wool sort structure and enhanced by wool knitting interactions – delivers a pure puzzle solving journey shaped by sequence planning, grid analysis, and logical clarity. Every level is a handcrafted wool sort color puzzle that guides you to analyze, deduce, arrange, and match patterns with precision.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Solve Logic-Driven Wool Sort Challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e • Each stage in this wool sort game is designed as a deterministic color sort logic puzzle where you must evaluate positions, predict sequences, and execute exact steps.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Levels blend yarn sort and car jam game ordering rules with controlled challenge escalation.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Car jam game mechanics add strategic blocking patterns, creating layered puzzle constraints without reducing clarity.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Progress through hundreds of puzzles in a complete logic progression, mastering patterns across car jam, yarn sort, and color sort structures.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Every puzzle rewards analytical thinking—ideal for players seeking puzzle-first gameplay rather than action or reaction-driven mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Play – Puzzle Analysis First\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Identify the correct cannon color and follow deterministic 3D wool sort logic to weaken the wool knitting dragon.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Apply car jam and car jam game style sequencing to remove obstacles in perfect puzzle order.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Use controlled yarn sort decisions to protect the cats and solve each stage’s specific logic pattern.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Puzzle-Focused Features – Designed for Brainteaser Enthusiasts\\u003cbr\\u003e 🧠 Pure Puzzle Framework:\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery car jam interaction reinforces logic rules in wool sort games. Each yarn sort step is deliberate and solvable without randomness.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Easy Rules, Deep Challenge:\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple controls make color sort puzzles accessible, while advanced car jam layouts require thoughtful sequencing and logical planning.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Color Ordering Logic:\\u003cbr\\u003eCombines yarn sort, 3D wool sort, and structured color sort reasoning to form coherent, progressively complex wool craze puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Clear Puzzle Objectives:\\u003cbr\\u003eSort correctly, resolve block patterns, analyze grids, unlock pathways, and complete each wool sort color puzzle through pure logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Structured Puzzle Progression:\\u003cbr\\u003eNew mechanics, car jam constraints, and sequence-based rules continually refine your reasoning across the puzzle journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Relaxing but Fully Logical:\\u003cbr\\u003eNo timers, no pressure—just clean puzzle solving built around car jam, yarn sort, and color sort mastery.\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into Wool Crush and embrace puzzle clarity: thoughtful yarn sort moves, precise  color sort matching, and structured car jam logic.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy true wool sort puzzle challenges, Wool Crush delivers the perfect 