IonVnujk7ePqn2ByitErxJHdrKkKAjhiQV1kMvBxHsmG6jRseykJGfkycILpq51bK7g\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wbjqCvUaNk-6r0JQF9iZWbfNvz90eLpdWterSIWmumsaOtextbcyWZ0el158QQgvT04Y\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sDDTYaqr5X5_tVd0EUrjjLPLA9Eq8GhCx-QvoT7yIqFgZIidNKuDaTrT9YYyDBDJOfrp\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S6bgSfEXg4rR9gW1MS9Fjo6XBwVdkodvQpoUxnSj8QFSrcwYvLHTxxzE3eai-LTZOQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rkQO7Uzyl58T-SiuLA6JaioBSQC5SKKrFMQ13KBEnJk97M9ykkNzkDAl-YeF4uOflw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hIsPYR5kSnAyKKaIMBHzvPRbJnPuOMbotVR-w_sQbk9mdn82SE8SHPfZEC7HugbnGg\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vsz4_g6Db7j0jAzhw2hZGeNhaRvR-8G6OwVWfTacF6ag3IAbXAeKsWJGCbcdrY14fuk\"]]],\"Whiteout Survival\",[\"4.1\",4.11821],\"Strategy\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gof.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gof.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gof.global\"]],[\"qgJYGlYIYkoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCKgoUCg5jb20uZ29mLmdsb2JhbBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"The world\\u0026#39;s original winter-themed mobile game! Over 300M players!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe blizzard has reset the world, and now, a new story awaits your touch!\\u003cbr\\u003eAs a rising survivor, gather your crew and team up with the free SSR hero Molly.\\u003cbr\\u003eTogether, you\\u0026#39;ll set out on a joyful adventure, spark the fire of hope, and rebuild a cozy home on the frozen frontier!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Game Features]\\u003cbr\\u003e◆Rebuild \\u0026amp; Restore: Easy Progress\\u003cbr\\u003eWarmth begins with a single spark. Fire up the furnace to melt the snow and reclaim the land! Manage your people and resources to build a bustling, welcoming town!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e◆Idle \\u0026amp; Earn: Constant Rewards\\u003cbr\\u003eSend your heroes out with one tap, then come back to a pile of resources ready for your next big upgrade, all stress-free.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e◆Tap \\u0026amp; Play: Instant Fun\\u003cbr\\u003eGo ice fishing for rare catches or uncover hidden treasures beneath the snow. Perfect for quick, fun sessions anytime!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e◆Plan \\u0026amp; Pair: Heroic Combos\\u003cbr\\u003eAll heroes share the same level, so you can upgrade and swap without the grind. Mix and match their skills for ultimate combos!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e◆Unite \\u0026amp; Triumph: Shared Success\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin an alliance to heal faster, grow stronger, and explore further. Together, we share the chill and the cheer!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to thrive in the frost? Download Whiteout Survival now — a perfect survival experience blending teamwork, idle fun, and smart strategy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Follow Us]\\u003cbr\\u003eOfficial Website: https://whiteoutsurvival.centurygames.com\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/WhiteoutSurvival\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/whiteoutsurvival\\u003cbr\\u003eYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@WhiteoutSurvivalOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003eTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@whiteoutsurvivalofficial\\u003cbr\\u003eX: https://x.com/WOS_Global\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/whiteoutsurvival\\u003cbr\\u003eThreads: https://www.threads.com/@whiteoutsurvival\"],\"Century Games PTE. LTD.\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/chQeDwjSRP0EdG12UVvSgztwyvpJq5TwYsSmUHuIKXq5CU5RKOSlJ