yJzA485NPabqeCaPX6Gk\"]]],\"Tetris® Block Party\",[\"4.8\",4.808422],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playstudios.tetrisblockparty\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playstudios.tetrisblockparty\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playstudios.tetrisblockparty\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIaEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPAomCiBjb20ucGxheXN0dWRpb3MudGV0cmlzYmxvY2twYXJ0eRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"d1Vu_GPgwJg\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:d1Vu_GPgwJg?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:d1Vu_GPgwJg\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlHuGwzFVgJ6b_tzzpy9SYD_dEm-Mcl9UBrrJ08hiJrQs3-w3DkyFsy9JS7YWvudGmHKMM6-MTUCdyd83rGLqwQKm6OPFPmu9ExHhOuDC5CtZtazvgbOfTt74pOR9x5xYvUAwtA_UBprvjeK5iLCKrq05jHGfT5K_rmszBKGQO3QQ7ci6qDMMkiPD6rQXnTOF56FHNu9r3SuFzfnTH6IBYrGfumPdsRF2hkaGQYkZBihcvjNfN8SPtWjVAcfwOEQFLIDGFs6oKpuNfQZywgmDxmm05FfivDf26kgNiW5ZmdKxSI3A3YaVbCq4ZQOpc\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/d1Vu_GPgwJg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Tetris® Block Party — Build, Attack \\u0026amp; Steal with Friends in This Block Puzzle Game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe block puzzle game where your friends are the competition.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your party scene, attack friends to slow their progress, and steal their coins and resources — all driven by classic Tetris-style block puzzle gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👥 WHO IT\\u0026#39;S FOR\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers who want more than just a solo puzzle game. If you enjoy games with social rivalry, raiding mechanics, and ongoing progression — Tetris Block Party is built around that loop. Works beautifully for casual players and competitive puzzle fans alike, across all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕹️ HOW IT PLAYS\\u003cbr\\u003eClear blocks to earn resources. Use those resources to build and upgrade your custom party scene. Then, launch attacks against friends or global players to steal their coins and set back their progress — or defend against attacks heading your way. The puzzle is the engine. The social rivalry is the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 SOCIAL CORE: BUILD, ATTACK, STEAL\\u003cbr\\u003e🔨 Build: Construct and decorate your party scene using rewards earned from active puzzle gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Attack: Launch dedicated attacks against friends or random global players to sabotage their builds and steal resources.\\u003cbr\\u003e💰 Steal: Raid currency directly from other players\\u0026#39; active stashes to fund your next upgrade.\\u003cbr\\u003e🛡️ Defend: Protect your party scene and hard-earned resources from incoming enemy attacks.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔄 24/7 Social Loop: The rivalry never sleeps — attacks and steals can happen even when you’re offline!\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 WHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT FROM OTHER BLOCK PUZZLES?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Social Raiding Loop: Attack and steal from real friends and global players — not just anonymous leaderboard avatars.\\u003cbr\\u003eA Persistent World: Your custom party scene grows, gets targeted, and requires active protection over time.\\u003cbr\\u003eMonthly Card Albums: Collect beautiful themed cards through natural gameplay and complete entire albums for massive rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003eAuthentic Tetris Brand: Experience true Tetris DNA — this is not a clone. Enjoy fully licensed, precision-tuned mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003eTrue Offline Mode: Play the core block puzzle levels anywhere, anytime, with zero internet connection required.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 KEY FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003eTetris-Style Mechanics: Addictive block puzzle gameplay powers your social progression.\\u003cbr\\u003eDedicated Atacking Actions: Target specific players to halt their progress and loot their vaults.\\u003cbr\\u003eActive Progression Goals: Customize your party scene as your central home base.\\u003cbr\\u003eReal-Time PvP Duels: Take a break from raiding to face off in head-to-head puzzle matches.\\u003cbr\\u003eMonthly Seasonal Albums: Earn cards by completing daily challenges, winning PvP duels, and passing levels. Finish the album to unlock exclusive boosters and currency!\\u003cbr\\u003eCurrent Theme — Time Travel: Collect era cards from Ancient Egypt all the way to the Far Future.\\u003cbr\\u003eDaily Challenges: Tackle unique puzzle layouts every day with targeted reward tracks.\\u003cbr\\u003e100% Free to Play!\\u003cbr\\u003e📅 SEASONAL ALBUM: TIME TRAVEL\\u003cbr\\u003eA brand-new themed card album launches every single month.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis month: Time Travel!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect detailed era cards (from Ancient Egypt to the Far Future) by playing puzzle levels, completing daily challenges, and winning intense PvP duels. Fill your collectors\\u0026#39; album before the month expires to unlock powerful exclusive boosters and high-value in-game currency. Every single card is earnable through normal gameplay — absolutely no purchase required.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 PERFECT FOR FANS OF:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Games like Coin Master\\u0026quot; — A block puzzle variation of the classic build, attack, and steal system.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Games like Tetris\\u0026quot; — Authentic, precision-engineered block-clearing DNA.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Puzzle games with social features\\u0026quot; — High-stakes raiding and interaction with real friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Games with raiding mechanics\\u0026quot; — Dedicated attack actions with real stakes and progression.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Offline puzzle games\\u0026quot; — Core gameplay is fully functional without internet or Wi-Fi.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Family puzzle games\\u0026quot; — High-energy gameplay appropriate and fun for all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Tetris® Block Party and start building — before your friends steal it all!\"],\"PLAYSTUDIOS US, LLC\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PfL1Q6RB9B302kopSic0NM9MBOpRTvhjTTE41cq5g91Io3ZcPbwH_CTQwUHD1BaFckM\"],null,[142,192,249,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playstudios.tetrisblockparty\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playstudios.tetrisblockparty\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $299.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Block\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Modern\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.brain.logic.joygame\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q19v_2ZYEOdWOt6ABAVCl10zHrft5qkChjAwxtByGKxJxE3gNULQGf3BwsCYVJk4Jbhf\"],null,[255,243,222,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fEVKw6EGXf47pPeI5Hc9kyfBMdPuquO_99vRTSzj01vSfYkx6UhFse3R-j_YPSvHTXxt\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k8vTIwiP11U50A6wgqbW04K_2kECMhw58Rqp5aFeYi57eR4RU8mf5b_FNK4nxSnyJbWF\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e5e-vbYAx0h2SWCsRXWK-LiticN0wsDBoTKRkTHQYG4cm5eP2EnSsBA3gIodGKS3Eg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/osxz8CGxFbj4z7nuehy24bjhF4GX6EhorFUnJcME_bIZk6_LXPFtp7RS__vA9LP67A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7nlbRVM1mPR4I4wEHzBI2WgaIl1wlDHZ1CUA-xpBb1OKneUI2PZyGV6UBk7KH7hKkzM\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1Oh3ByGQaaBcK0YdyZbsEP1EAw4v4i4poyBrfu-ZqgM2Vpe2yk83uPZ8CazlspQikV4\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hYpa0x2wAvAmhDl0n3cL0bYRZWt-xWL51SajyyHmqQ06yPaZa3WcZySlaXon_mt1Bh8\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mzLpqnfDROFn6o-Nu0rGs5bRh8sZ9ImMFnEcJpYPKDaDI97DGw8CCgZ01bDqTNNFhkM\"]]],\"Brain Puzzle 2: Logic Twist\",[\"4.7\",4.7322035],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.brain.logic.joygame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.brain.logic.joygame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.brain.logic.joygame\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IaUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwodChdjb20uYnJhaW4ubG9naWMuam95Z2FtZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"This time, we’re continuing the humorous storytelling and brain-teasing design of the first game, bringing you an even richer and more surprising puzzle-solving experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this brand-new sequel, you\\u0026#39;ll follow quirky plot lines and make clever use of clues and interactive elements to crack a series of bizarre yet cleverly constructed levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach scene is packed with carefully designed puzzles, unconventional logic, and unexpected twists—making you think outside the box and enjoy a perfect mix of reasoning and creativity.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo complex systems needed—just tap, swipe, and explore! It\\u0026#39;s a fun and accessible brain challenge that anyone can enjoy. And if you get stuck, don’t worry—our trusty “Brain Buddy” will give you playful hints to spark new ideas and help you move forward.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌻Game Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBigger, Weirder Stories – Absurd scenarios mixed with trending jokes and clever twists, sparking laughs and wild creativity!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink Differently – These puzzles aren’t what they seem... flip your logic and find the unexpected solution.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, Fun Controls – Tap, drag, and solve. No learning curve—just dive in and play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlimited Hints – Stuck? Get as many helpful hints as you need\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin us now and challenge the limits of your imagination! Use your creativity and wit to conquer this absurd and delightful puzzle adventure, and feel the thrill of every solution.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 This is just the beginning! More levels and crazy stories are on the way—stay tuned!\"],\"JoyGame Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oI8y9M9xHjqYVadtqYLYm_DXUT_UL2XoTMqJF46lhKKW7QTUMkTOfgSAsn_hl8-2sOs\"],null,[247,227,190,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\