gPc2PyqhuuyixENJACQOu9ycJCG06A1gEpu1AX8bcof5Wj4BM-AGzzWt4WEBvJZZEIIjSKpn4Mub-yLo5qw\"]]],\"Brainy Escape Quest\",[\"4.3\",4.2815533],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.metagame.annoying.trick.brainypuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.metagame.annoying.trick.brainypuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.metagame.annoying.trick.brainypuzzle\"]],[\"qgJyGnAIakoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAboCRAouCihjb20ubWV0YWdhbWUuYW5ub3lpbmcudHJpY2suYnJhaW55cHV6emxlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,\"HG0Dx9bpjns\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:HG0Dx9bpjns?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:HG0Dx9bpjns\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkVPwCuwaBfw0_mBFoi4mYORhzzH4wr6cWe1GF1nuYvfdhiai85jiReyZ8gRN8MTmFYGpQGKrK0e15JBaw7e8sEb9_0dT3eNNUnJU2cnAsWKuArx8WOjEk16D6aenG6YvZIvnMWIV-pwGHpdwE-m6bF13HPEUFxaaFH-tEKnkCc5lV1BgPwEIvWQ7oStJ8yDGVJDpjmbyrcyuAePLTKvL7JqrGulUY9TLKi4PTXVHXdJVfZctIsM7Ce5eUquvDHXf5ABHJzU1SfA-DmHzQg5TxxkIrPPHjR756bOsdXSqVUsWONBMUktCgc0yZLzMA\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HG0Dx9bpjns/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Each level is carefully designed to annoy and trick you in the most unexpected ways. With brainy puzzles that defy logic and trick-filled challenges that flip your expectations, this game keeps you on your toes from start to finish.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love It:\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Brainy \\u0026amp; Trick-Filled Challenges – Expect the unexpected and prepare to rethink everything you know about logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Unpredictable Puzzle Variety – Each puzzle throws in a new twist. Expect silly logic tests, sneaky mechanics, and surprisingly annoying traps.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎭 Mini Stories in Every Level – Dive into bite-sized puzzles with quirky storylines, absurd characters, and laugh-out-loud moments.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Perfect Mix of Fun and Learning – Ideal for puzzle lovers seeking an entertaining yet educational experience that keeps the brain active and engaged.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to challenge your mind and enjoy hours of addictive gameplay!\"],\"Metagame.Ltd\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WtslYIlsD1Gk_LQa5Lf8S17BFIjkny9_LOBSGO0aUWSB16Jye4lYsRsX4OwynrukY9XWmhSR21Txs-foIQyk\"],null,[250,191,166,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.metagame.annoying.trick.brainypuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.metagame.annoying.trick.brainypuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $6.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]]]],null,null,nu