om.advant.streamer\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.advant.streamer\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIbkoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLwoZChNjb20uYWR2YW50LnN0cmVhbWVyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"Join Lamar’s Hilarious Rise in \\u0026quot;Lamar - Idle Vlogger\\u0026quot;!\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into the laugh-out-loud world of Lamar, a vlogger determined to turn life\\u0026#39;s challenges into viral opportunities. In this engaging idle clicker and life simulator, watch Lamar transform from zero to hero, making his way to the top as a rich tycoon in the influencer industry.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Cheated to Champion\\u003cbr\\u003eLamar’s journey kicks off with a shocking revelation: he was cheated. But instead of giving up, he decides to start his vlogging career. His mission? To go from an unknown, struggling individual to a viral vlogger and rich tycoon, proving that with grit and creativity, anyone can achieve greatness.\\u003cbr\\u003eVlogger Go Viral\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate content that captures the hearts of millions. Experiment with hilarious pranks, engaging challenges, and viral trends to build a massive fanbase. Your goal is simple: make Lamar the most famous vlogger on the internet. As an idle streamer, even when you\\u0026#39;re not actively playing, Lamar\\u0026#39;s channel continues to grow, attracting more fans and generating more revenue.\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild Your Empire\\u003cbr\\u003eAs Lamar\\u0026#39;s popularity soars, so does his wealth. Use your earnings to invest in better equipment, stylish outfits, and a top-notch studio. Transform your humble beginnings into a luxurious lifestyle and become a true rich tycoon in the influencer world. Manage Lamar’s career wisely, balancing content creation, fan engagement, and personal life to ensure continuous growth.\\u003cbr\\u003eLife Simulator and Beyond\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Lamar - Idle Vlogger\\u0026quot; isn\\u0026#39;t just about making videos; it\\u0026#39;s a comprehensive life simulator that lets you experience the full spectrum of the tuber life. From planning content to dealing with haters, every decision you make impacts Lamar’s journey. Collaborate with other influencers, participate in trending challenges, and unlock exciting new opportunities as you climb the ladder of fame.\\u003cbr\\u003eInteractive Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy an immersive idle clicker experience where your strategic choices determine Lamar\\u0026#39;s success. Engage in the dynamic world of content creation, and watch as Lamar evolves from a novice to a streaming sensation. With a bit of strategy and a lot of fun, guide Lamar through the challenges of being an influencer and streamer tycoon.\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eVlogger Go Viral: Create and share hilarious and engaging content to build a massive fanbase.\\u003cbr\\u003eIdle Clicker: Grow your channel and income even when you\\u0026#39;re offline.\\u003cbr\\u003eRich Tycoon: Invest in equipment and lifestyle upgrades to become a wealthy influencer.\\u003cbr\\u003eLife Simulator: Experience the highs and lows of vlogging life with realistic challenges and decisions.\\u003cbr\\u003eZero to Hero: Witness Lamar’s journey from an unknown vlogger to an internet sensation.\\u003cbr\\u003eRich Inc: Build your brand and expand your empire in the influencer industry.\\u003cbr\\u003eTuber Life: Dive into the world of online content creation and enjoy the thrill of becoming a star.\\u003cbr\\u003eStreamer Tycoon: Manage Lamar’s career and rise to the top of the streaming world.\\u003cbr\\u003eIdle Streamer: Enjoy the idle gameplay where your progress continues even when you\\u0026#39;re away.\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin Lamar on his quest to turn betrayal into triumph. Download \\u0026quot;Lamar - Idle Vlogger\\u0026quot; now and start your adventure in the exciting world of vlogging and streaming. With your help, Lamar can transform from a cheated nobody into a rich, influential superstar. Let the journey begin!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app\"],\"CrazyLabs LTD\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4TKanIP4levQUyLDiX0kDLPwe_wu-t6OUbgcVxHcWCLPz_rRrDkeF9QZL4GqVX6TcLcb\"],null,[3,212,230,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Sexual Themes, Drug Reference, Language, Use of Tobacco\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.advant.streamer\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.advant.streamer\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Idle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null