/play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w13AB6Vl2VIPM-cs_VB1FH63-MS2gk0YTxLAiXBehU_IQOFl8KWnXZzhv9xCUYZ0Zy_s4ZYXEeMwPRMjoetlYQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sIj8Kr4jSxMkjkEkjWUz2d2eN-ssSV2CoYnCql9EQ7OTf3iRi-vdlUK2SKh85MHmlB5CNHczfHIRMUF6ao5q0eo\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sw5ZKvYeczVcCNa_REHl3OvqefvPAURfiEgQAVsEusEAZiviFCIuPStFkkd8OMPjAlpYCLSga2T1Ia4brEzgtXo\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MWLXkMBspbdmyXW9ZqL0374nZGP1w1KjFlZK9g95Wg1-1LO1X9ERHNnQzxPPvTBvyoPYdAHUEupe1LGiXWxyIA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yp4bMdOpB0w6UeWyg2XZibtRDHSgYRMrGnu033Ox2bmldg9ZEUY-XBxRAPB1yARlTWmOKP7roCl78lpHW4IFEA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xecmJkxB8_tMzWvvNBFfXHbW2us29hvXBNvjmJNZfiCubBRlkKfnbt2_BQ8EJGEoah6xOUPC5FwWAvp2HbNjPA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1gyiCYs1iosvz7UH9LM9d10wSZwpEVoSariiVgObtyAb0-rzboi56rutpQHIV5y_nw9vjiafwUCQyrA1J7IVPA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7WxAaDon7kfx_tfEWhrJo09MVTOi2fG1ACRXpxAkvppRCRku44YgYfmWZiCSEvGGmt9Aym2qV4awuwGOG-h2pQ\"]]],\"Idle Dot Shooter!\",[\"4.3\",4.2683487],\"Arcade\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.infinitygames.dotcollect\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.infinitygames.dotcollect\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.infinitygames.dotcollect\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIcEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAoiChxjb20uaW5maW5pdHlnYW1lcy5kb3Rjb2xsZWN0EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Blast dots. Stack upgrades. Trigger chaos.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIdle Dot Shooter is a minimalist idle shooter built for incremental idle progress. Your turret auto-fires into drifting targets while you build an upgrade engine that turns tiny pops into massive gains. Add a drone, boost suction, and unleash bullet hell abilities when you want chaos. Pure idle dot shooter gameplay - a true idle bullet hell experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat you do:\\u003cbr\\u003eShoot dots to earn cash. Spend it on Defence, Drone, and Economy upgrades. Travel to new galaxies with tougher targets. Push your personal best as the top dot shooter on the global leaderboard. This is bullet hell reimagined as an idle shooter - a single turret holding the line against an endless tide of dots.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Idle Dot Shooter is satisfying:\\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;re always one upgrade away from a new rhythm. Faster fire rate, bigger damage, denser spawns, stronger suction, higher value... then you watch the screen erupt into chaos as your earnings climb. That\\u0026#39;s the incremental idle loop every idle shooter fan craves.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Idle auto-shooting turret\\u003cbr\\u003eClean, minimalist visuals over true idle shooter gameplay. Tap in, upgrade, tap out, come back richer. Tower defense distilled to its purest form: one turret, infinite dots, endless upgrades.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛡️ Defence upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003ePush fire rate and damage to bullet hell levels. Watch your dot shooter scale from a popgun into a wall of auto-fire destruction. Real depth without the map clutter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤖 Drone upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003eBoost speed, suction, agility, and size. Your drone vacuums up earnings while your turret shoots - the perfect idle shooter companion for hands-off incremental idle play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💰 Economy upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003eStack capacity, value, spawn rate, and luck. Every upgrade multiplies into the next, fueling the incremental idle engine that makes Idle Dot Shooter so addictive. The loop every idle shooter fan comes back for.\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Bullet hell abilities\\u003cbr\\u003eFrenzy, Dot Rain, and Black Hole. Trigger them to break the idle rhythm and unleash full idle bullet hell chaos. Pure bullet hell energy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📊 Command Centre stats\\u003cbr\\u003eTrack dots destroyed, shots fired, crits, time active, damage distribution, and more. Optimise your build like a true dot shooter strategist. Every great run starts with reading the numbers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Global leaderboard\\u003cbr\\u003eClimb the ranks for most dots destroyed. Prove you\\u0026#39;re the best idle shooter player out there. Compete with bullet hell and tower defense fans worldwide.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌌 Galaxy progression\\u003cbr\\u003eMove beyond the void toward new destinations. Each galaxy brings new modifiers and new ways to scale your incremental idle empire. The further you push, the harder the screen gets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Rewarded boosts\\u003cbr\\u003eOptional rewarded ads for extra cash and ability charges. Your idle dot shooter run, your call. Pure incremental idle freedom.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat makes Idle Dot Shooter different:\\u003cbr\\u003eMost idle shooter games drown you in menus. Most tower defense games chain you to a fixed map. Idle Dot Shooter borrows tower defense pacing without the lane-following clutter. It strips everything down: one screen, one turret, one beautiful idle bullet hell waiting to unfold. The incremental idle progression hits harder because nothing distracts from it. Every upgrade shows up immediately on screen - more bullets, more dots, more chaos, more cash.\\u003cbr\\u003eIt\\u0026#39;s the crossover the idle shooter genre has been missing - a true incremental idle game where your build is your tactic and your screen is your battlefield. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink tower defense pacing with bullet hell intensity.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuilt for fans of:\\u003cbr\\u003eIdle shooter and idle dot shooter mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003eBullet hell action and arcade scaling\\u003cbr\\u003eTower defense strategy and incremental progression\\u003cbr\\u003eIncremental idle games with deep upgrade systems\\u003cbr\\u003eMinimalist arcade games and auto-shooter loops\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJump in, start popping, and see how far your dot shooter can scale. Idle Dot Shooter is the idle bullet hell incremental game built for anyone who loves clean visuals, deep upgrades, and progress that never stops. Trigger the chaos.\"],\"Infinity Games, Lda\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ahA4ao78JyVpWzkyFGHrb--BDC9XAK4DIdYN2saTduzpjTZAHRfp1qM9spm69wEdG9E6UyyoaB_JN4b3sNTj\"],null,[240,239,244,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.infinitygames.dotcollect\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.infinitygames.dotcollect\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,nu