m/vi/N1wdxxH7HfY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Hungry for a Challenge? Hungry Balls! 🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into Hungry Balls, the devouringly fun puzzle game where you erase sand to guide your character and eat all the green creatures! A perfect mix of physics puzzles and logic brain teasers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures That Will Hook You:\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 FEED YOUR BRAIN: Solve clever physics-based puzzles that test your logic, strategy, and IQ. It\\u0026#39;s the ultimate brain training exercise!\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ SMART ERASING ACTION: Strategically remove sand to control the flow of the level. One smart erase can cause a delicious chain reaction!\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 HUNDREDS OF TASTY LEVELS: A huge variety of challenging stages + bonus levels to unlock. New levels are added regularly to keep you entertained!\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 EASY TO LEARN, FUN TO MASTER: Simple one-touch controls make it easy to play, but the clever puzzles will keep you hooked for hours.\\u003cbr\\u003e😋 FUN \\u0026amp; SATISFYING GAMEPLAY: Experience the satisfying feeling of planning the perfect move and watching your character eat them all! A perfect game to relax and unwind.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to Erase, Solve, and Eat?\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Hungry Balls: Brain Teasers for FREE and start your puzzle adventure today!\"],\"HYPERCELL\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/r80GaiCqn6-SI0d73tCIIknZANp6nt5T_amMPdDZkBHPM9OB6OdfetvuAp3BlIbLdHZ_zWXnTTvpra1noKUCZA\"],null,[233,202,97,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuserc