,null,\"AXH1ezl6CdtfaWWRrP29faJi6bAwAoUQ9t_hAMmRU5L0Lp4ZOSQScoCqukanmeGO3cya5C2JtIYgweHaE_zc0x1GoMxgz4fzlo8RJKXY5Xbpqt0EIM9sf3Eos8Mu2CBPQ3xvA80K8p_91jgOMn854jTqZOTvIdVXeIvohzqGlIz0vAjvpYfqs7kg4WInYHDC2TQP3t5pxyP3TpVqdjejEzvi0rb05wKXBlEjdzJPgVoytxSRJGm8UAMxZSjlsxyhXKQYMKJdfFwku7wdMFC62aMi8fYgi_LCVS12t4M6FRPELWDIzgngcuMJMEoVK517NVs\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9CQSmn5WRJ8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Connect all the balls so that the lines do not cross!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSharpen your mind with a \\u0026quot;Connect Balls - Line Puzzle -\\u0026quot; brain training ball link puzzle game.\\u003cbr\\u003e“Connect balls\\u0026quot; is a simple but addictive connect line puzzle game.\\u003cbr\\u003eDuring your commute, before you sleep… enjoy downtime with brain training.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this ultra fun and relaxing puzzle game, you connect the same balls with lines so that the lines do not cross.\\u003cbr\\u003eYou are successful when you can connect all the balls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt\\u0026#39;s as simple as drawing a line from ball to ball.\\u003cbr\\u003eBut be careful.\\u003cbr\\u003eYou will realize the depth of the game, which looks so easy, but you cannot succeed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake the challenge and train your brain NOW!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRules:\\u003cbr\\u003e* Connect the same ball with a line\\u003cbr\\u003e* Lines should not intersect\\u003cbr\\u003e* Be careful, you will lose track of time!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge yourself and enjoy hours of fun with connect ball puzzle!\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re sure to get hooked on these puzzles!\\u003cbr\\u003eHow many levels can you beat?\"],\"BAF, Ltd.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/U5J0WMpA3skzMwLaOJJI7HlIjSDLUVTKlvyfuGgUwgvQEfspXilpMxxFtjMMHBtIc_4\"],null,[254,254,255,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512]