FZW4tVVMQALoCKwoVCg9qcC5rb25hbWkucGVzYW0QARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAM\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"aWit5o_PCCE\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:aWit5o_PCCE?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:aWit5o_PCCE\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezknqIMyI7ek1UGxTYHyDfxHa-ldeFfKjv6p3amP5DX6XlrsL0VI24XcsnJn-NmFAAWncV2EjL-581_KPWoQeOC7sARqAHe75ZOwErymL2MlMQ2vol3ArF-FL0TF4AAliq8huwZfcbJIQQFzEIcD0tM7bZNGjYkWdm_hkDEjpbON4YvvuXELrUAQD_Qu79aFtPkcTgmbK2ppZlC67dNqk9jP4hMFc7V7d5N6opgk1Mh2ec2JCdgCJbgJj3qW49aGuM1BgS6R8PNgQxh8M4jpHcCjgq2kfkh4fH8No1hDa7GUiB2cfQesOmUI9wKM7Og\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aWit5o_PCCE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"■ \\u0026quot;eFootball™\\u0026quot; - An Evolution from \\u0026quot;PES\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003eIt\\u0026#39;s an all-new era of digital soccer: \\u0026quot;PES\\u0026quot; has now evolved into \\u0026quot;eFootball™\\u0026quot;! And now you can experience the next generation of soccer gaming with \\u0026quot;eFootball™\\u0026quot;!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Welcoming Newcomers\\u003cbr\\u003eAfter downloading, you can learn the basic controls of the game via a step-by-step tutorial that includes practical demonstrations! Complete them all, and receive Lionel Messi!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe have also added the Smart Assist setting to help users enjoy the fun and excitement of playing matches.\\u003cbr\\u003eWithout entering complex commands, get past the opposing defense with a brilliant dribble or pass, then score a goal with a powerful shot.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Ways of Playing]\\u003cbr\\u003e■Start Off With Your Favorite Team\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether it\\u0026#39;s a club or national side from Europe, the Americas, Asia, or elsewhere around the world, begin a new game with the team you support!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Sign Players\\u003cbr\\u003eAfter creating your team, it\\u0026#39;s time to get some signings in! From current superstars to soccer legends, sign players and take your team to new heights!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Playing Matches\\u003cbr\\u003eOnce you have built a team with your favorite players, it\\u0026#39;s time to take them to the field.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom testing your skills against the AI, to competing for ranking in Online Matches, enjoy eFootball™ the way you like!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Player Development\\u003cbr\\u003eDepending on Player Types, signed players can be further developed.\\u003cbr\\u003eLevel up players by putting them in matches or using in-game items, then spend the Progression Points acquired to increase Player Stats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn case you prefer to customize a player to fit your personal preferences, you have the option to allocate the Progression Points manually.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen in doubt about how to develop the player, you can use the [Recommended] function to automatically allocate his Points.\\u003cbr\\u003eDevelop your players to your exact liking!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[For More Fun]\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Weekly Live Updates\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Live Update is the feature that reflects player transfers and match achievements from soccer in real life.\\u003cbr\\u003eTake note of the Live Updates released each week, adjust your squad, and make your mark out on the field.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Customize a Stadium\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose your favorite Stadium Elements, such as Tifos and Giant Props, and watch them appear at your stadium during the matches you play.\\u003cbr\\u003eAdd color to the game by arranging your stadium however you like!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*Users with one of the following nations as their Country/Region of Residence will not have access to loot boxes that require eFootball™ Coins as payment.\\u003cbr\\u003eBelgium, Brazil (users under 18 years of age)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[For the Latest News]\\u003cbr\\u003eNew features, modes, events, and gameplay improvements will be continuously implemented.\\u003cbr\\u003eFor more information, see the official eFootball™ website.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Downloading the Game]\\u003cbr\\u003eApproximately 2.9 GB of free storage space is required to download and install eFootball™.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease make sure you have enough free space before beginning the download.\\u003cbr\\u003eWe also recommend that you use a Wi-Fi connection to download the base game and any of its updates.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Online Connectivity]\\u003cbr\\u003eAn internet connection is required to play eFootball™. We also strongly recommend playing with a stable connection to ensure you get the most out of the game.\"],\"KONAMI\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IZtpXMX-aAqvO90nYMb_96UFK_gWHJop1SIRjzvZqANf4rFv5W40bpY7ze7t4dAbzRjGTVjU360qTc0C1E6-3_4\"],null,[242,241,243,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003djp.konami.pesam\\u0026rdid\\u003djp.konami.pesam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.29 - $99.99 per