u003dcom.soccer.score.star\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.soccer.score.star\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.soccer.score.star\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIeEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCN6itbLGuZSJQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIxChsKFWNvbS5zb2NjZXIuc2NvcmUuc3RhchABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"6GwS90gwLig\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:6GwS90gwLig?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:6GwS90gwLig\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznkm0ZsbkCHwBfv1UGJA0toNozFcKOmcXuVR-CnjXcRTfScLOm8xltyc1S3qyyaeCSONhjlIaCqFceHHd3-FtoTEttJrftCeg21kz1GNpdLSYq2B0ly9KUylO794DbD17OT-aFUSkaTP7osnd3Ry-7NZB4WypXyjQFmyYtfSLP7g0aOp5xcHz7MetGt1kUxs8vHP_Sf2nzyEMnIliMZU_nVp7gqMtDIPf71jF-Olz2tGmTXFafXJNOKatXH3mQyvnEnPdZCSXpFv-CY_yTgV3t4y2SYU23cdvgDhPLfis8dcCAHyj8kfd8JgVDd0DQ\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6GwS90gwLig/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Step onto the pitch and become the hero of every moment in Soccer Super Star!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSwipe, curve, and score through 5000+ levels of fast, skill-based soccer action. This is your road to 2026 glory on the world stage as you chase the ultimate cup. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo energy limits. No waiting. No pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003eJust pure soccer, played your way anytime and anywhere, even offline. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to pick up and challenging to master, every goal is in your hands.\\u003cbr\\u003eWith simple flick controls and realistic ball physics, you can draw passes, bend shots, and curve the ball exactly where you want. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSounds easy? As you progress, you’ll need precision and creativity to unlock defenses and find the perfect path to goal. \\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level is a smart, rewarding challenge where placement and control make the difference. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience dynamic gameplay across beautifully designed pitches and evolving match conditions. \\u003cbr\\u003eFrom clean finishes to complex attacking plays, every scenario feels fresh and satisfying. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on thousands of handcrafted levels and rise through your journey toward football glory. \\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your path, chase the moment, and make every shot count to get one step closer to lifting the cup on the world arena. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover new ways to play with special modes and unique challenges that put you in key moments. \\u003cbr\\u003eTake decisive shots, complete crucial plays, and step into goalkeeping situations when it matters most. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy smooth, responsive gameplay powered by improved AI and fluid match flow. \\u003cbr\\u003eEvery pass, every curve, and every goal feels natural and satisfying. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay anytime and anywhere, even offline. \\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you have a quick break or time for a longer session, the pitch is always ready. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and start your journey. \\u003cbr\\u003eThe next unforgettable goal is just one swipe away. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURES: \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eINTUITIVE FLICK CONTROLS \\u003cbr\\u003eSwipe to pass, shoot, and curve the ball with precision. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e5000+ LEVELS \\u003cbr\\u003eMassive, handcrafted challenges with increasing difficulty. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNO ENERGY LIMITS\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay as much as you want with no waiting and no interruptions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOFFLINE PLAY \\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the full game anytime and anywhere. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eREALISTIC BALL PHYSICS \\u003cbr\\u003eFeel every pass and shot with responsive, satisfying control. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDYNAMIC MATCH ENVIRONMENTS \\u003cbr\\u003eVaried pitches and evolving conditions keep gameplay fresh. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSMOOTH \\u0026amp; SMART GAMEPLAY \\u003cbr\\u003eEnhanced AI and fluid match flow for a better experience. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe love to hear from you! Please email us with your thoughts to soccersuperstarteam@gmail.com \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFOLLOW US:\\u003cbr\\u003efacebook.com/playsoccersuperstar/ instagram.com/soccersuperstarofficial/ \\u003cbr\\u003etiktok.com/@soccersuperstar\"],\"Real Freestyle Soccer\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1Ha4SW2Cd_B9_51SKH-E_4VaN7fTAFlyD6QQa1aXSA_e31NJNAdVHdmfydBuvpVXYxKT\"],null,[102,139,44,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.soccer.score.star\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.soccer.score.star\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $24.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Sports\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Soccer\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]