t.color.puzzle.offline.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dwater.sort.color.puzzle.offline.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwater.sort.color.puzzle.offline.games\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IfEoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQorCiV3YXRlci5zb3J0LmNvbG9yLnB1enpsZS5vZmZsaW5lLmdhbWVzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"-eiBroMZ3WY\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:-eiBroMZ3WY?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:-eiBroMZ3WY\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmU9-HfIj4bDly5o3s9VMmb4kk0MYBgs4ky4AhR2amGCwoWycsK-Im2DkaZzfgFSkvr0a6AAD94UsvXkOPvh3W9BTvWAgVROxeFDH33OAL1X5B_GLNUMAsgzACgdid2vDNmSkEJP6xyfJule9DtzVXlVODlAuIfvbIsxrIGGtHwmFAOmLaVhusNIccngRhCnlFpLXIS5GlY6IsD5jUzmlh2GTGTKuQ0odWLcIykBJDX1bTB7ZsZyJSXsrO2WsS9HZ_l09gSuf2bhmXUXZwwxQgRr1IJqrGtWKhP-B89oEjeSRZMlHOgBW3O3rAgB9c\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-eiBroMZ3WY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Water Sort! Color Logic Puzzle – Addictive Water Sorting, Relaxing Color Logic \\u0026amp; Brain Fun.🌈🌱\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to the calming world of water, sort, and color logic. Water Sort! Color Logic Puzzle is an addictive water sort puzzle designed to help you relax, focus, and train your brain through smooth and satisfying bottle-sorting gameplay. Every time you pour water and match the right color, you feel the perfect rhythm of logic and comfort. This is the kind of puzzle you can play anytime—during a break, before bed, on the bus, or whenever you need a moment to unwind.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat makes this game special is its unique Grow Your Plant system. Every color sort level you complete gives energy to your plant, helping it sprout new leaves, bloom flowers, and evolve into something beautiful. Instead of just finishing puzzles, you’re growing a tiny world of your own—something peaceful, motivating, and delightfully different from other water sort puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 A Colorful, Relaxing Flow of Water\\u003cbr\\u003eImagine sitting somewhere comfortable with bottles filled with layered color gradients—calm blues, sunset reds, pastel greens, bright yellows. Your goal is simple: sort every color into its own bottle by pouring water from one tube to another. The motion is smooth, the sound is soft, and every correct color sort creates a satisfying moment that helps your mind stay fresh.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re looking for a quiet mental break, a relaxing evening activity, or a gentle brain challenge, this experience delivers a calming blend of water, color, and logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧪 How to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e  1. Tap a bottle to pour water into another bottle.\\u003cbr\\u003e  2. You can sort only if:\\u003cbr\\u003e   ⭐The top color matches\\u003cbr\\u003e   ⭐There is enough space in the receiving bottle\\u003cbr\\u003e  3. Use Undo to correct moves anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e  4. No punishment, no rush — just relax and enjoy the flow.\\u003cbr\\u003e  5. Complete the puzzle by finishing every color sort bottle.\\u003cbr\\u003e  6. After each puzzle, your plant grows a little more.\\u003cbr\\u003e  7. Easy to learn, deeply addictive, and endlessly satisfying.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Features🔥\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈Classic Water Sort \\u0026amp; Color Puzzle Gameplay🌈\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy water sorting, color logic, and bottle puzzle challenges, this is the perfect match. Each level brings new combinations of shades, bottle shapes, and arranging strategy. You’ll feel the joy of watching water fall into place and each color settle into the right tube.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌱 Unique Plant-Growth System 🌱\\u003cbr\\u003e  Complete water sort puzzles → your plant grows.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Unlock new stages of growth.\\u003cbr\\u003e  A relaxing and personal reward system.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Makes the gameplay more meaningful and addictive.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Your plant becomes a visual diary of your puzzle progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠Designed for Relaxation \\u0026amp; Brain Benefits🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e  Developed for stress relief.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Helps ease the mind and relax.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Engages your brain with simple logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Light IQ-style challenges through every sort sequence.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Ideal for killing time in a peaceful, positive way.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e🤝Player-Friendly Controls🤝\\u003cbr\\u003e  No time limit — take your time.\\u003cbr\\u003e  No penalty — experiment freely.\\u003cbr\\u003e  Offline mode — play anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e  One-finger control — smooth and simple.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e💪Thousands of Addictive Water Sort Levels💪\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you prefer easy color sorting or complex multi-bottle challenges, there are endless stages to explore. With increasing bottle counts, tricky layouts, and mixed color patterns, your brain always has something new to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Why Players Love It?\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers enjoy the clean design, flowing water, satisfying color sorting, and the calming energy the game creates. The smooth animations, gentle difficulty curve, and the adorable plant-growth journey make the experience truly unique. It’s the perfect water sort puzzle for relaxing at the end of the day or keeping your mind gently active.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSettle into a peaceful moment, tap the bottles, let the water flow, watch the color align, and let your plant grow with you.\\u003cbr\\u003e Download Water Sort! Color Logic Puzzle today — and enjoy endless water, sort, color, brain, and puzzle satisfaction. 🌈🌱\"],\"Bobodoo Game\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9satadfjUovSz4OXhEotcQUihKeZ49QZcG9L_Or53ofsLrxUxVY