ulGe2x23XRIlZKTj6ZnHJKBXh1IAXbxfzV8mYgWbjc8PWmxBRnxQO8-5JzCDUyaqmUhupv0c2Go\"]]],\"Last Asylum: Plague\",[\"4.7\",4.7059107],\"Strategy\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.phs.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.phs.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.phs.global\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IfUoTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBFwoVCLyr+LDVoKCLQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIqChQKDmNvbS5waHMuZ2xvYmFsEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dM9BVonbfSCk\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M9BVonbfSCk/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"One sanctuary. One doctor. One last chance.\\u003cbr\\u003eA mysterious plague has swept across the world, leaving chaos in its wake. As a plague doctor, you become the town\\u0026#39;s final beacon of hope. Build and manage a sanctuary, heal those you can, and guide your people through the darkest days of the pandemic. Your strategy will shape their future.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[The Sanctuary of Hope]\\u003cbr\\u003eRun your sanctuary as the last refuge against the plague.\\u003cbr\\u003eTreat patients, craft herbal remedies, and expand your wards to shelter the growing tide of the sick and desperate.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Counter the Rat Swarm]\\u003cbr\\u003eHold the last line against the Rat Swarm.\\u003cbr\\u003eRecruit and upgrade your heroes. Build as many defensive towers as you can. Slay the Rat King to repel the swarm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Gather Resources, Rebuild the Town]\\u003cbr\\u003eDispatch survivors to gather resources and secure outposts in the wild.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect timber, herbs, food, and other essential supplies. Construct production facilities, expand warehouses, and upgrade residential buildings to house more survivors.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Seize Abandoned Ruins]\\u003cbr\\u003eForm elite squads of heroes to reclaim plague-ridden towns.\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate the best lineup of different types of heroes. Outsmart contenders on the battlefield. Gain control of crucial cities. Expand your territory in this world.\"],\"37GAMES GLOBAL\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O7oXgrWjMJlxZztgAX1pxnYV9PzLPYtKbMhJJylRVARRNvEppM8CIVXp8XnPYR7CIQWUdzY6GRv3C3oqhTnWtA\"],null,[34,50,75,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.phs.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.phs.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Strategy\"]],[null,null,null,[\"4X\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Immersive\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.europosit.p