zGZCSPR\"]],[null,2,[450,800],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aLK293wTm9WWEwCYN2Wj3WBWOYuEl5ccc8joWlFrRbn-_W0TCbVLLUeb2SHcq8SZNec\"]]],\"Solitaire\",[\"4.5\",4.5329437],\"Card\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.smilerlee.klondike\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.smilerlee.klondike\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.smilerlee.klondike\"]],[\"qgJgGl4If0oTCMrn6+an/ZQDFaMJswYdIssGi/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20uc21pbGVybGVlLmtsb25kaWtlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"Ro0vwbKzbzI\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:Ro0vwbKzbzI?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:Ro0vwbKzbzI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlKbBDeU9Ea2uBIDKHfFDSXK-gATfgsGqBXYPkupJ7AK--1-hTgAsH21nFA7eAk0jHW3c7wf19Q6W-2PTg-SdVz9zPipQZPgm_sahHnhXUydpdetfk63GmzSe8b3hbhy5tPXHhmCzdmeZK31wKpCyL3xZXlkv3c8TcSndpq1jMr0PzjQQ64HLJXMwGB0jBwk9Y3t_m3_CyVvYmfuMERnrrlIcDdl56UWZib-u8h7C69_m1lOGN4IGE96CYke8gFwPFsyPqYUyjNGDURD4OH0gOVIP9OSB3f0DxouBqrn0Yvg6PKXSNma-v01-O9E6w\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ro0vwbKzbzI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Solitaire, also known as Card Solitaire or Patience, is the most popular single player card game in the world. If you like classic Solitaire, you\\u0026#39;re going to love this crisp and clear solitaire game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Beautiful graphics\\u003cbr\\u003e- Solitaire Draw 1 card\\u003cbr\\u003e- Solitaire Draw 3 cards\\u003cbr\\u003e- Option for all winning deals\\u003cbr\\u003e- Auto complete\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlimited free undos\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlimited free hints\\u003cbr\\u003e- Intelligent hints and auto hints\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily Challenge\\u003cbr\\u003e- Timed mode and Untimed mode\\u003cbr\\u003e- Vegas scoring and Vegas cumulative scoring\\u003cbr\\u003e- Customizable card faces, card backs and backgrounds\\u003cbr\\u003e- High scores and personal statistics\\u003cbr\\u003e- Sound that can be turned on/off\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tablet and phone support\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multiple windows and tasks support\\u003cbr\\u003e- No network required\\u003cbr\\u003e- And so much more!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay the #1 Free Solitaire card game on Android now and see for yourself why so many others love this game!\"],\"Mouse Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5kx5YoZiIK9E94W7OXaPob8Q3DWya4-NWSLZj7_JnPV8HGlpZwslqIKLyGJSmzhwAg4\"],null,[24,95,49,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.smilerlee.klondike\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.smilerlee.klondike\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Card\"]],[null