rP81liyaScl5g\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fW50nAOuUd6fe4YVAiavs0i0IQugAOX9HKUFtTU4VQluCXcJnctjNjyY_PINc2KuJoEiEFc8gTu6WFJvYk7g\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PIlWiLvPr0QsYseC3kxRonWfMiK6LUUDtzU1s5Q5zyvTAeD0c0lsxt1S-DwvaAUkIvqauFMZKEV59m2XU-1_Dg\"]]],\"My Talking Tom Friends\",[\"4.3\",4.3032494],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\"]],[\"qgJyGnAIgAFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6ARcKFQiM9ePf5rT8jkMSCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOwolCh9jb20ub3V0Zml0Ny5teXRhbGtpbmd0b21mcmllbmRzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"Join Talking Tom, Angela, Hank, Ginger, Ben, and Becca in the most exciting virtual pet adventure! Dive into a world of cool animals and endless fun! Visit their house and see why they are the ultimate pet friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHere\\u0026#39;s why you\\u0026#39;ll love playing with them:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Take Care of All Six Friends: Interact with your favorite characters in one house! Feed, bathe, dress, and put them to sleep. Talk, play, and engage with Tom, Angela, Hank, Ginger, Ben, and Becca. Each character has their unique personality and needs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Design and Create Stories: Bring all your characters together to create and share fun stories. Your imagination is the limit!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Creative and Sporty Activities: From gardening to chilling in the pool and playing musical instruments, there\\u0026#39;s always something fun to do.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Closet Full of Fun Fashions: Dress up your friends in the latest styles. Unlock new outfits daily and show off your fashion sense!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- House Customization: Decorate and upgrade their house to make it the coolest home in town. Collect tokens and rewards to enhance your living space.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini Games: Enjoy a variety of mini-games, from puzzles to action-packed challenges. There\\u0026#39;s something for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect Stickers and Rewards: Complete your sticker album to earn special rewards and unlock whacky food items. Feed your virtual friends and watch their hilarious reactions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily Trips to Town: Travel to different locations to shop for exciting new items and bring back surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Angela 2.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- YouTube integration to allow users to watch videos of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s animated characters;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions which automatically renew at the end of a subscription period unless cancelled. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time via Settings in your Google Play account;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lno1-AvKmhMbYT1t-mmo0zUs_rVAC79YEQRQrptWdSiabjzRb0BD8vPZmPzMn-XfKQ89shlz1SrOcV8Ff87f\"],null,[55,161,252,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Comic Mischief\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Pet\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.chess\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JO7Z75U1oypXpNTAklroO5emKWePni0sK9zn1E_nRgqmbAHoMxz1oQHDfSTpcycdht92dTBejkpEDXttGeCWN74\"],null,[54,51,48,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ilmg9Q0mrYaxEq71833BZt31BUi79fUK509k6mSuENRKzVRoJiL68WE4W2QvhH8G_Jta7abqNJs-AypLGAnf\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vN6kRkAVtZo20Lhzd8v6FtB2lwcDtCVQ9ZoSGPxWXTX5pprzC4XaAJXBykDnv89FW7riLrRk7WDpPXIEUA6I5Q\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4BVZD6fHHaZktMkvOitQ6Boa9VMgqFvJ7vO72sXYJnSup9zNstPxSv50i9ove9CQ6nKFXe2eSwWfdI4Uab9nUA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zgQSkk11PzAmmdt0b7vg1T7icg17WFtYokcxgrwcJRvA51HlJT532DcsVC9unp5pQ2zb3TbsHkqKVhw25txx8O0\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pWeEbqZZ3xYwOnPjisHCFyDoXvhq5_SkeEAi7p7k7YDEfPAbsnIkuNPzhosVln8ZEVFcjeZ_QTQxI0D3JH5k_A\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o_xaPrWUq_RSDe4DG4_RCPd7LeiodNWePiOgEBh4duySdwcYEyv3Gwvxef3ENzQZVhJpbRzh5AvAUZrPQvx_hg\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NIjQOTvz6ng5aAFggxD9rb-5cd9FOTzPztzQGH3rrqPYRmTJD4vzr3wlVOKEuGSBjyn3xe5D17M0Ds7_N8M_Pw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Hee0btLGbrYgsieJScOakoP5UXYXCd3IC2bPW3tooTYsj3fZxsQ0T4eJo2QpzhluTA3Tx9qIuSSJ-dl_4pheRw\"]]],\"Chess - Play and Learn Online\",[\"4.7\",4.696945],\"Board\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.chess\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.chess\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.chess\"]],[\"qgJUGlIIgQFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AiUKDwoJY29tLmNoZXNzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#69933F\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003ePlay chess lessons online with over 250M players from around the world!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChess is known as the best strategy board game in the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy unlimited 3D offline pocket chess games and improve your chess rating with 500,000+ puzzles, more than 20 million chess games a day, lessons, and over 100 powerful bot opponents. Unlock your inner chess master today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e♟ PLAY CHESS ONLINE:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 2 Player online chess mode is entirely free to enjoy with your friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join tournaments with players online or friends and become a master.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play games in real-time from one minute per game to 30 minutes or longer with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Review your strategy and game lessons and lay out daily correspondence in online chess.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play exciting chess variants in our app: chess960 (Fischer-Random), blitz chess, puzzle rush, bullet chess, puzzle battle, or blindfold.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🧩 CHESS PUZZLES:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy 500,000 + unique puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rated mode automatically adjusts to your skill level to help you improve.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Race the clock with a timer to beat your high score in Puzzle Rush.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Practice puzzles with specific themes in this strategy board game (checkmate in 1, in 2, in 3, blindfold, endgames, fork, skewer, sacrifice, timer, etc.)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📚 CHESS LESSONS:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of quality chess lessons and online videos made by masters (Learn and practice your skills with chess problems)\\u003cbr\\u003e- Interactive puzzles tutorials with tips and game recommendations.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Learn all the chess rules and strategies in a step-by-step lesson plan (opening, endgame...)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎓 CHESS COACHING:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Learn from helpful and immersive visual chess coach lessons.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Review your games with the coach and learn the strategy of the board game for every move.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play games with the coach, who will guide you through the fundamentals move by move and provide helpful hints as you play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📟 PLAY CHESS ONLINE AGAINST THE COMPUTER:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose the level of computer opponent you want to play and set a timer.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Analyze your chess games offline and learn to see where you went wrong and how you can improve.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🏰 CHESS COMMUNITY:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join a community of more than 200M online chess players. Find friends! \\u003cbr\\u003e- More than 20M games played each day.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete to get your own rating and try to join the best player online chess leaderboards against other players.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Watch the most popular superstars: Hikaru, GothamChess, or Magnus!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e✅ ... and MUCH MORE:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play chess games offline against the computer and the clock with a timer.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Articles by the best coaches and masters.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore openings like Queen´s Gambit or Sicilian Defense.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenge and play with your friends in an online chess game.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose from 20+ board themes and 3D pieces.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Get in-depth performance stats about your games, puzzles, and lessons.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎖 Playing pocket chess online has never been so easy!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChess.com is the place to play chess games online with your friends and other players!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShare your suggestions and comments. Our support team is happy to help you 24 hours a day, 365 days a year!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e ABOUT CHESS.COM: \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChess.com was created by chess players and people who love ❤️ chess! \\u003cbr\\u003eTeam: http://www.chess.com/about\"],\"Chess.com\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xVVWPbrMIiKQVJKD8Rt1GI1V6ERwpxwcwpSuCXFbPbSholzahjlRzz7EGMHqeeb8vE436DmGTxiIRXXWRT7igQ\"],null,[49,46,43,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.chess\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.chess\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.00 - $119.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Board\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Chess\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.easybrain.brainy.joygame\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zRHoAo47TnYClSpceXjhwkZX1D6eLK_WHrC-IxvpykO8H80bYrzAdps7X4sDrNGDedOiKCc__s-dV1YvKanIxA\"],null,[245,184,137,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/s4OO1fN2EAjd3rZNTjPxpAFFy4RGWlQa0qcnI9uViRVI7eKMQYgfLZf6JhrW9MGEgiY1wjE7h6R1lO_TUg2jVA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NoJovQnmDRsIPf0XZtnodyhZ6UciFM4AdJSQhCFqaEBH4wMUbFMcZkf_sQMH5knSXXWfpGl5Jvp_ytdBFDmc\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G6Pr39SJT59hVGoNVE3PtEMZJGjEuYsYI2DqLeuq4sMPF6rSm3sTnjATRp8AVmVmA52-L1s7FDjGE8R6dN_tOLc\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wx3rQkzG9gvR1I9dHKubnEeIWq2YhVK8VNSgMNrfZrXY9R1e8GwJRqSZp2dUNYcChhRrSMISCJnPsOclMBEe\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KVgsCfunK-2Z297FA6aYCIgy0mfi9zlP4b3CephS1t-1POSPsws77RTxwkLCHu2-ZuK1U9J5OWY3suKZyidNRw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LpQur51JcW6DpR5lwBpqu6QEIJfrlgiXh08UZ2HVJ3viXMrZHMekH_tF5jTBzn8zfu7PmMROkjIwjWYUYW0x8Fc\"]]],\"Puzzle Time: Brainy Challenge\",[\"4.3\",4.28],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.easybrain.brainy.joygame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.easybrain.brainy.joygame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.easybrain.brainy.joygame\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIggFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjgKIgocY29tLmVhc3licmFpbi5icmFpbnkuam95Z2FtZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"“Relax, Play, Refresh—Your Daily Brain Break!”. Congratulations on discovering this wonderfully amusing brain game! Puzzle Time: Brainy Challenge is a journey of playful surprises and “aha!” moments. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this game, you’ll follow lighthearted scenarios, using various items and a dash of quick wit to reach your goal. These cleverly designed levels might playfully bend the rules—that’s where the fun begins! Unwind, think sideways, and use your creativity and humor to find the most delightful solutions. Every level holds a little surprise. Friendly hint: the timing and order of using items can be the punchline!\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re looking for a quick mental snack or a series of amusing mini-stories, this game delivers steady fun and that sweet “I did it!” feeling.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 What We Offer:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Playful Mini-Stories: Unique and humorous setups filled with lighthearted “what if” moments\\u003cbr\\u003e• Surprise Puzzles: Carefully crafted challenges that test your out-of-the-box thinking—solutions are often simple and unexpected\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy \\u0026amp; Instant Fun: Clean, intuitive design perfect for all ages. Pick up and play anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin us now! Dive into these whimsical tales, unleash your boundless creativity, craft your own puzzle punchlines, and enjoy the thrill of solving with a smile!\"],\"JoyGame Studio\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QSirHbQkOCJ9ALOouz-ofCliyD95XSKkDIX4kLtZ5Wux1JyNMCBWeEiucBzFtnWtP1hfgSt9-jExQgcfEOcOdg\"],null,[253,230,206,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom