//play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1p7rQgD2UAdEyFFU_JO8V4FsYgzYJGpVynT8gaGm0AJPp8rkx7AXUQuGLiWxvL--okuc-cALZAaMXg5_NoN97A\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hou7BefI4csWPT7rcUfoVW1s3L-2EYyrZ-s8YtXyIfOeflYm-ZW2jNpyeWr5MiYh8yTRM9-4l1RJDgteatVHvQ\"]]],\"Vita Mahjong Wood\",[\"4.9\",4.8850417],\"Board\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjongwood\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjongwood\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjongwood\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIhAFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjwKIAoaY29tLnZpdGFzdHVkaW8ubWFoam9uZ3dvb2QQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgFEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Vita Mahjong Wood: Classic Wooden Tile Matching, Your Exclusive Relaxing Puzzle Game!\\u003cbr\\u003eVita Mahjong Wood is an exclusive classic wooden tile matching puzzle game. We are thrilled to present this mahjong game that combines innovation with classic gameplay. It features warm, wooden large tiles and a user-friendly interface compatible with pads and phones. Our goal is to provide a relaxing yet mentally engaging gaming experience, particularly focused on older adults.\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play Vita Mahjong Wood:\\u003cbr\\u003ePlaying the free Vita Mahjong Wood game is simple. Just aim to clear all the tiles on the board by matching tiles with identical images. Tap or slide two matching wooden tiles, and they will vanish from the board. Your objective is to match tiles that are not concealed or blocked. Once all tiles are eliminated, it signifies successful completion of a mahjong game!\\u003cbr\\u003eExclusive Vita Mahjong Wood Game Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Classic Wooden Mahjong Experience: Staying true to the original gameplay, it presents traditional wood-grained tile sets and hundreds of boards, offering you the purest classic feel.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Special Innovations: Besides the classic, our game introduces special tiles that add a fresh twist to traditional mahjong.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Large-Scale Design: Our mahjong games feature large, easily readable text sizes on comfortable wooden tile surfaces to alleviate the strain caused by small fonts.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Active Mind Levels: A special mode designed to sharpen your mind and improve memory abilities in the mahjong games.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Customizable Scoring: You can enjoy free classic mahjong games without a timer and any score pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Super Combo: When you consecutively match mahjong tiles during the game, you will unlock special experiences.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Helpful Hints: Our game provides free useful props, such as hints, undo, and shuffle, to help players overcome challenging puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily Challenge: Take on daily practice to collect trophies and improve your classic mahjong solitaire game skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Offline Mode: Full offline support lets you enjoy Vita Mahjong Wood anytime, anywhere, without needing internet.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multi-device: Optimized for pad and phone, ensuring everyone can enjoy this classic mahjong game.\\u003cbr\\u003eVita Mahjong Wood is a versatile game made for those who love tile matching games. Download Vita Mahjong Wood and immerse yourself in the serenity and joy of classic wooden mahjong, starting your mahjong dynasty now!\\u003cbr\\u003eNote: This is a puzzle game in the style of Mahjong Solitaire. It does not contain the rules of traditional Mahjong or other types of solitaire or card games. The term “Mahjong” here refers solely to the visual style of the tiles.\"],\"Vita Studio.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-KJ2ndvKV_MlzfadLocYDFX-fm2rjRBlOgjW-mKe-WiCkA_khRKEExLmMn