of humor and relaxation. Our Kick \\u0026amp; Break The Ragdoll Game is a fun-filled minigame experience where every kick brings laughter and satisfaction!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍀 Key Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤘 A Relaxing \\u0026amp; Fun Mini Game!\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for venting out frustration or just having a laugh.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Endless Entertainment\\u003cbr\\u003eHundreds of unique levels to explore and enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤠 Easy to Play\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, satisfying gameplay for every mood.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 Immersive Sound Effects\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel every kick and break! Enjoy playful sounds that bring each impact and ragdoll reaction to life, adding extra fun and satisfaction to your gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍡 Dynamic Graphics\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy smooth, immersive visuals as you kick, punch, and break!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re taking a quick break, winding down at the end of the day, or just need to calm \\u0026amp; relax, Kick \\u0026amp; Break The Ragdoll Game is here for your daily dose of ragdoll chaos. 🎉💥🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax and unwind, one ragdoll kick at a time!\"],\"Game District LLC\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0nW-XkKmbbE5_Gz803Tzt3zrxX43tUNhvWz1wXmmBn0edhD1-cPlyFRsOrkaBlkR2wvq\"],null,[118,190,230,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null