 as long as you can! Challenge your friends and try to be the biggest snake in Snake.io!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClassic arcade Snake.io gets an upgrade for unique online live events play. Slither to the top of the leaderboard in this popular mobile version of the beloved arcade game! Snake.io combines new trendy art with the oldest classic snake game mechanics. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart Snake.io as a small snake or worm and try to get bigger by eating your way through each level. Rush your way through fields of food and try to beat other players’ scores - how long can you survive?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Classic arcade games meet online leaderboard competition in this new, addicting free game! Join millions of players and play Snake.io now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSnake.io is designed for a smooth, fast performance, with controls designed for every mobile device. Snake has never been this fun or competitive before! Play without wifi for free or newest online mode with live events.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBest Snake.io Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSnake Classic Games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Slither through a field of food and eat to make your snake grow\\u003cbr\\u003e- A fun io game version of Snake\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play old school Snakeio and try to beat your high score\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiplayer Games for Free\\u003cbr\\u003e- Online leaderboard – see if your snake can beat the rest!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenge your friends to beat your high score\\u003cbr\\u003e- Double player mode – sit next to your friend and compete\\u003cbr\\u003e- Watch Snake Games from our fans and join the online community\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFree Addictive Game\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play games with fast performance on any device\\u003cbr\\u003e- .io game with smooth gameplay and mobile joystick controls 🕹️\\u003cbr\\u003e- Snake.io is free, or you can remove ads!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Watch online games on YouTube and learn moves from top streamers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLive Ops Events\\u003cbr\\u003e- Battle against other snakes, worms and the boss snake ayo\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete high scores with friends on the leaderboard\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fun new events every month with unique skins\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo Wifi Games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Offline io games require no internet connection. Play Snake.io whether you’re offline or online! Offline is no wifi needed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Snake games with a new io twist! Download Snake today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour reviews are important for the Snake io team!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRead/write storage permissions is used for Snake.io screenshots and cache user save files. Record audio permission is used for recording YouTube video for sharing.\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy: https://kooapps.com/privacypolicy.php\"],\"Kooapps Games | Fun Arcade and Casual Action Games\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H4SOO_zhRSN7kduE66X0lN3d4sLIRqVhbD84rMVXOr-ZnArEy3RNNTfFCctVkUUi90px3Xu4yyZxLrmXLnyG\"],null,[67,84,117,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.amelosinteractive.snake\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.amelosinteract