4tmpencWGX4pQBvxsnby6bhQKe2vM\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jUFJgo9MkDU4t_bE3gTkpiKXvNZQkEMqptcT0mixD84iQtuwyco9hjiiHWZsMhxB92w\"]],[null,2,[1800,3200],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Xg8lgDVLUkdkN_fOWubRSBRY_uJe-Zst4HyNLLiAWilUy2jmcL1Kfihi-3cardZsL64\"]]],\"2 Player games : the Challenge\",[\"4.7\",4.695232],\"Arcade\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.JindoBlu.TwoPlayerGamesChallenge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.JindoBlu.TwoPlayerGamesChallenge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.JindoBlu.TwoPlayerGamesChallenge\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IigFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AkAKKgokY29tLkppbmRvQmx1LlR3b1BsYXllckdhbWVzQ2hhbGxlbmdlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"1J5rQZ5QFTc\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:1J5rQZ5QFTc?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:1J5rQZ5QFTc\",null,[1920,1080],null,null,\"AXH1ezn4AElStQIy76hOek0h09RYQNTL-8V622UWiQi1T5amZq1ecHF4_Z9LRxG0okQ6kIBb9Kj_p25rVoQPY5wpVMKKZ9ubHcfq2HvB8gJJp0hGC01vbiMBWDV7WejQGh7F1avTHH9WchjNo3u_bz04Haf3tmlBAi_CnLAt6GTEMIU5sytGbM13vtxM72JpqxT0Fc8W3Wkvz6Fl6WawVq-xeu9srWrZVDPGEvA_rt40-Rft7JCVTmRas843fKbvp7T0hpTKSXR8j6vlAWONgAZHxst7ky_DRnCYcHSoF8Rf0-lJ9iG2pHn5Ir16OazdbWg\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1J5rQZ5QFTc/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"If you want to play with your friend on the same device, this is the right game!\\u003cbr\\u003eBut also if you have no friends to have fun in multiplayer on one device, just play alone against the AI!\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge your friend with this collection of 2 player games and enjoy the beautiful graphics of the minigames!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose between one of the 2 player games ( and remember that you can also play alone against the AI if you have no possibility to multiplayer):\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePing Pong :\\u003cbr\\u003eMove the racket with your finger and challenge your friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpinner war :\\u003cbr\\u003ePush your opponent outside the stage! Two players on a small area are too much!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAir hockey :\\u003cbr\\u003eUse your finger to move the paddle and score letting the puck entering in your friend\\u0026#39;s goal!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSnakes :\\u003cbr\\u003eDon\\u0026#39;t touch your opponent\\u0026#39;s body and stay alive!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePool :\\u003cbr\\u003eThe classic pool game for 2 player on one device!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eTic tac toe :\\u003cbr\\u003eInstead of using pen and paper just open the app and challenge your friend on the same device! A two player classic!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePenalty kicks :\\u003cbr\\u003eLet the goalkeeper dive and kick the soccer ball to make goal! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSumo :\\u003cbr\\u003eThe multiplayer version of a famous Japanese sport!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnd much more! (Like minigolf, racing cars, sword duels, chess...)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis collection of 2 player games features beautiful minimal graphics to keep your focused on the duel with your opponent and it saves scores between matches, this way you can dispute a 2 player cup and let the challenge go on between minigames!\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash the power of local multiplayer on one device / one phone / one tablet, and bring the fun to the party!\\u003cbr\\u003eDisclaimer: this multiplayer game can ruin friendships!\"],\"JindoBlu\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/60fgsUGac1ZN1Ben0gC0ekz18xltsYhSGdaDZDEQdlfD4nvu7jrFtYEGNLqdJEmIK9PH\"],null,[246,244,245,255]],