eANZaEtqsbkjygO-86_zir12x_4kKVTP4eMZ26xkRfkmumLx4rGOVF\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VkvAxS7mygwWQ-gAhcEvNZTxVCRNqJMkcUxvb-2aXPsgxPrW4xQvNlBUwbiSMq-Q6A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dJsJQ2Gke0vS41V-BX76MmX-dN55rW-UFPylH-RQk4k5EJHYmplzSJG39uh9As-2rhU\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k44BZ8w3CV2VbxLgMFJIeAOaCM_eBRUw7q3fdqfbnDpMF3Sqs3QGJUoatqIGJ7kNy2YJ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3pHUG7UDQ8lStGu7tTRjRgZ8RsMHnyscst60hz_yANOhnh9cajqlDttqpJq-74jqJQ\"]]],\"Word Search - Word Puzzle Game\",[\"4.8\",4.801982],\"Word\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playvalve.wsjourney\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playvalve.wsjourney\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playvalve.wsjourney\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIkwFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjMKHQoXY29tLnBsYXl2YWx2ZS53c2pvdXJuZXkQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Take your mind on an exotic journey with the most exciting, destination-themed free word search! 🌎\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTravel the world with Word Search Journey, a beautiful word puzzle game with all the challenging yet entertaining word hunt features you love! Train \\u0026amp; exercise your brain in a fun, relaxing way and stretch your critical thinking skills and IQ to a new level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ \\u003cb\\u003eSPECIAL FEATURES\\u003c/b\\u003e ⭐\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ CHALLENGE YOUR MIND: These word find games are easy at first, but they get challenging fast. Is your mind ready to get pushed to the next level with word puzzles?\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ INCREASING DIFFICULTY: Work your way up 4 levels: Easy, Medium, Hard, and Pro!\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ NO WIFI REQUIRED: This offline word puzzle doesn’t require wifi, which means you can play with anyone anywhere!\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ CREATED FOR ALL AGES: The perfect crossword game for kids, adults, and even your grandma!\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ REDUCE STRESS: Word puzzles combined with breathtaking landscapes create a relaxing wordscapes search\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ 100% FREE: Download and play this word search free!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e☀️ \\u003cb\\u003eHOW TO PLAY\\u003c/b\\u003e ☀️\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ IT’S EASY: Search for words by swiping up, down, left, right, or diagonally in infinite word search games\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ EXPLORE UNIQUE LEVELS: Choose from a variety of themes featuring new destinations from around the globe, in addition to classic categories from your favorite word search games\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ DESTRESS: Unwind after a long day at work with calming, zen crosswords. Word Search Journey is an amazing mental getaway if you’re up for the challenge!\\u003cbr\\u003e♦ EXPAND YOUR VOCABULARY: With each level, your vocabulary will level up and prepare you for the next exotic word puzzle!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe promise you’ll leave each game feeling accomplished, smarter, and more at peace! Word Search Journey is satisfying, challenging, and the perfect new twist of a classic word search game and a world exploration you won’t want to put down!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGot your passport ready? 🎫 Download Word Search Journey, the best free word puzzle game and start your crossword exploration of the world!\"],\"Bluetile\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/j56s-MzOM_iGw2xyrb5RKgmMyldeQ8GwVUT1S9-T5P3lqU1weMmo7Ws1EoKY8_bfsiD_\"],null,[240,243,243,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],nu