dcom.triple.food.sort.puzzle.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.triple.food.sort.puzzle.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.triple.food.sort.puzzle.game\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIlgFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjwKJgogY29tLnRyaXBsZS5mb29kLnNvcnQucHV6emxlLmdhbWUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"apofY2bIiUY\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:apofY2bIiUY?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:apofY2bIiUY\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznXCAH5Ob67mFGSdd_EakudaZ41FOP6Hw9ZlowL8bKYHaUPsU3Lm7PlKrsY8_Zsd4grq0NdtSYxlUBnt4TvqNl-QTsDbCz0HUHBKR52-f6Rryt5zpozIdybGNQOdrP2QWPCvLBFcY-C-2LJ1kG3hrzCgLVStpaskuaKDFI7CLog5aS1kzwTbuJ0olzudW4CNfTTogkI_DO6h6cfb_hpUpQnUozEQQES2D8w8PTU9hO6ASU5v2xoiRWRJ72G0_mUWibtciR-i41-wG0J-qDb2RJinc8sZzqwd3Q8xCavUM7ftQFlqJDcB0lzhIi3bhw\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/apofY2bIiUY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"👩\\u200d🍳👨\\u200d🍳 Become an excellent owner of a cozy restaurant and serve tasty dishes to hungry customers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to the delicious foodie challenge in \\u003cb\\u003eFood Sort: Puzzle Game\\u003c/b\\u003e! Take orders from a variety of customers, sort and match ingredients, and complete food orders in time to stand out among sorting games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love the mechanics of color sort or grill sort games, this relaxing and mouth-watering food puzzle will be a real treat. Get ready to enjoy satisfying sorting moments in one of the most addictive food games available. 🤤🤤\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHow to Play\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e 🕶️ Simple and Relaxing: Match 3 identical food items with a swipe to clear trays and complete levels. Perfect for short breaks or casual play.\\u003cbr\\u003e ⚡ Dynamic Challenges: Efficiently sort delicious foods in relaxing sorting games. As more trays appear, challenges increase, pushing you to sharpen your skills while enjoying easygoing fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e 🎁 Special Level-ups: Feeling stuck in food games? Unlock powerful boosters to progress faster and overcome tricky stages in sorting games.\\u003cbr\\u003e 🤘 Tricky Treat: Food Sort is more than a simple color sort and matching. As you advance, unexpected obstacles appear to keep every level fresh and engaging.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGame Highlights\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e 🍧 Cartoon Visuals: Bright colors and cute designs perfectly match the casual puzzle experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e 🍽️ Diverse Food Variety: Discover hundreds of food ingredients and explore flavors from different cuisines across 1000+ sorting games.\\u003cbr\\u003e 🚀 Engaging Levels: Regularly updated levels deliver continuous challenges and long-lasting enjoyment.\\u003cbr\\u003e 🔥 Serve It Sizzling: Complete food games just before time runs out with the help of boosters and powerful upgrades.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhy Choose Food Sort: Puzzle Game?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e This game skillfully combines sorting mechanics, puzzle-solving, and food arrangement into a relaxing yet rewarding experience. Whether you are a fan of grill sort, color sort, or casual food games, Food Sort offers satisfying gameplay you can enjoy anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 Download \\u003cb\\u003eFood Sort: Puzzle Game\\u003c/b\\u003e now and discover your new favorite casual sorting game.\"],\"Playdayy\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SL8ZuCVGbZTp3ZDCQ8PlmFAwBhFMEqMKZZh4YLDLQtsulYj2mNmCkMdu9cJ8mBhA61VWQsFUf94Hmp2R1Qgpdg\"],null,[192,141,120,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8O