,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fty.thejudge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fty.thejudge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fty.thejudge\"]],[\"qgJbGlkIlwFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AiwKFgoQY29tLmZ0eS50aGVqdWRnZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"oDjYKW5ycOg\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:oDjYKW5ycOg?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:oDjYKW5ycOg\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk_i0Ucm7z00qnlQL_jKndDpp-iGYx68NXxIkzirb-eEko4MjnAZsu2jSp477go2Cu_l0MoOgTO84FIm734RK_qGOXuTwS3uIcexs27h2B6LvG2JyXUI_5yHNLVLnGniLKhRD8fG25pDw9jB9mFCinT7gAQBtmfJEpEQmxsQ9C_gXU3X0pl9HZyYNBtcpByT6VWd5o-wuIPWkyfeNkTN0yj77ZrNHLLthEyCKTwXM23_LpyUs0tgY1AkSPFrfSEUAjNG_CMPeYDzXEe-eGrhmmErZs1w_bt2U2pE8u2AGwMyQ9RWdqdjEv0Od_MZ2E\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oDjYKW5ycOg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Spot suspicious tenants. You are the landlord of an apartment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this apartment,\\u003cbr\\u003enot only good people but also criminals and even monsters are mixed in.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eInvestigate each applicant’s background\\u003cbr\\u003eand decide whether to let them move in.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFill your building with good tenants\\u003cbr\\u003eand create the best apartment possible.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ How to Play\\u003cbr\\u003eCheck each applicant’s criteria\\u003cbr\\u003eand determine whether they are good or bad.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMore “Yes” → Higher chance they are a good person\\u003cbr\\u003eMore “No” → Possible criminal or monster\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you accidentally let in a dangerous tenant,\\u003cbr\\u003etrouble may occur in your apartment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Apartment Reviews\\u003cbr\\u003eLet good tenants move in to\\u003cbr\\u003eincrease your apartment’s rating.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe higher the rating,\\u003cbr\\u003ethe more rent income you earn.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Monster Attacks\\u003cbr\\u003eOccasionally, monsters may\\u003cbr\\u003einvade your apartment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen that happens, fight them off with a gun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can restock ammo and upgrade your weapons\\u003cbr\\u003eat the gun shop.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Game Features\\u003cbr\\u003e・A deduction game where you identify suspicious tenants\\u003cbr\\u003e・Story-driven interactions with visitors\\u003cbr\\u003e・Test your judgment in spotting good vs. bad people\\u003cbr\\u003e・Increase ratings to boost rental income\\u003cbr\\u003e・Action elements where you fight off monsters\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome the ultimate landlord and take over every apartment in the city!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e　\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEU / California users can opt-out under GDPR / CCPA.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease respond from the pop-up displayed when starting in the app or within the settings in the app.\"],\"FTY LLC.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rz4HcosK_fzy8HSpp6uDKYwuIQhCDQvIiMmEHuy_SPfbwfKpwtBAFXK--oPylSewnDk5dwj9hV4uZspSnM79lw\"],null,[52,52,48,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Use of Drugs and Alcohol\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null