leusercontent.com/Y0jPjcYxq0uFKMOfh30cUn6IU_pdMkXk-2PYMWQlKmL4qWoKMq68mCOyWbQnZCALpd1nbDGBbVec30vwB9Km6j8\"]]],\"Water Sort Puzzle - Sort Color\",[\"4.8\",4.8488784],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwater.sort.puzzle.game.color.sorting.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dwater.sort.puzzle.game.color.sorting.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwater.sort.puzzle.game.color.sorting.free\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIImAFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AkUKLwopd2F0ZXIuc29ydC5wdXp6bGUuZ2FtZS5jb2xvci5zb3J0aW5nLmZyZWUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"8yAxYHDOPMM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:8yAxYHDOPMM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:8yAxYHDOPMM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkrFIgjZLI2zXCIbxG6zs-ChzgytaqF1Ofttw3BrAXUUlULrY4d4KlwbfBvxx33je5m7-2E6g8x5OAFy-aLMBgwJHnjxCCsn6GAnFdboZd0vaTeKJa5WBIOlyE-WU6VLQAuALH7Hxi5nA40S3a9A42ZA12IG9mcwS8dKqNInENBAFfdk4ovGj1HvT9GvWsRuRwmTkn4Z4LNvct71Oh0uiA8Uno9d33ktwx6GdI-2DvT_yR4PgigaOnQp7NI7X1UWPMcXbGASpGWfqAMh-SRB1wVlF6vMDbFEueBJknVpDgBxlMYLxmwI6eIoYVwlHA\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8yAxYHDOPMM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eThe #1 simple but addictive, fun, and challenging water sort puzzle game for you!\\u003c/b\\u003e It is the best free water sorting puzzle game for you to train your brain, kill free time and relax! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you’d like to train your combinational logic, this water sort puzzle game is just for you! It’s the most relaxing and challenging puzzle game, and it’s not timed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💦 Now try to pour the water in different colors and sort the water in the same color into the same bottles. 🧪\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis water sort puzzle game is quite simple, but it’s very addictive and challenging. The difficulties of levels are increasing. The higher level you play, the more difficult it would be, and the more careful you would be for each move. This is the best way to train your critical thinking. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 \\u003cb\\u003eHow to Play\\u003c/b\\u003e 💡\\u003cbr\\u003e💧 Tap a bottle first, then tap another bottle, and pour water from the first bottle to the second one.\\u003cbr\\u003e💧 You can pour when two bottles have the same water color on the top, and there’s enough space for the second bottle to be poured. \\u003cbr\\u003e💧 Each bottle could only hold a certain amount of water. If it’s full, no more could be poured.\\u003cbr\\u003e💧 No timer, and you can always restart when you get stuck at any time.\\u003cbr\\u003e💧 No penalties. Take it easy and just relax!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFeatures\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- IT’S FREE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Just Tap and Play, one finger to control\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy and Hard Levels, all kinds for you\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play OFFLINE/without Internet. Feel free to play with no Internet connection\\u003cbr\\u003e- No time limit and penalties. You can always enjoy playing this water sort puzzle game at any time and place!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith this free and relaxing water sort puzzle game, you will never feel bored. While killing your free time, it’s the best way to train your brain! Download and Play NOW!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://watersort.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://watersort.gurugame.ai/policy.html\"],\"Guru Puzzle Game\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jfljqBaGXXAPn9Yua7iNXQ9kvIwswSPrndFNFlzjk-Tat_T2frGisXdJkFkh8gMaV7ichZHctkY2shG9fnsQ\"],null,[39,77,154,255]],null,[\"Everyone\