play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GEiFL0btbaFbt6XNpMFZU4E1aWNqq6KLvCq9sliuyyCjv_mvWMx4x9EzMVWz3qXXpAjYYj4ZN9VeEQpufUjvOw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TD7k0Uige468M22kH_h6WUwvXVg_CIRSu5MqBjNntIgXaQZejSIOeK8V6AItddPzwZ2QJc_oLJwbMLQhYzvPg78\"]]],\"Animal Hunter: Wild Shooting\",[\"4.8\",4.796652],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.animal.hunter.sniper\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.animal.hunter.sniper\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.animal.hunter.sniper\"]],[\"qgJpGmcImQFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjoKHgoYY29tLmFuaW1hbC5odW50ZXIuc25pcGVyEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAECgQIBhAB\"],null,[null,\"Prepare yourself for an exhilarating journey into the heart of the wilderness with Animal Hunter: Wild Shooting. In this action-packed FPS game, you\\u0026#39;ll step into the boots of a skilled marksman, ready to engage in intense battles against the most cunning and elusive prey – deer. Get ready to embark on the ultimate deer hunting adventure where your combat skills will be put to the test.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDeer Hunting Challenge: Immerse yourself in the thrill of the hunt as you track down majestic deer species. Sharpen your aim, steady your trigger finger, and become the ultimate deer hunter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWilderness Warfare: Navigate through diverse and realistic natural environments, from dense forests to open plains. Engage in epic battles amidst the stunning backdrop of untamed wilderness.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrecision Shooting: Hone your sniper skills to perfection as you aim for critical shots. Each trigger pull is an opportunity to demonstrate your marksmanship prowess.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eModern Firearms Arsenal: Choose from a wide array of modern firearms and pistols, each equipped to help you achieve precision and power in your deer hunting quests.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStealthy Assassin: Adopt the tactics of an elite assassin as you silently stalk your prey. Approach with caution and strike with precision to ensure a successful hunt.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEpic Battles: Engage in intense combat scenarios as you face off against cunning deer, testing your reflexes and tactical abilities in a dynamic FPS experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAction-Packed Gameplay: Dive into fast-paced, heart-pounding action that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Every moment in \\u0026quot;Animal Hunter: Wild Shooting\\u0026quot; is an adrenaline rush.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAchieve Hunter Greatness: Earn accolades and rewards for your exceptional hunting skills. Rise through the ranks and become a legendary deer hunter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the ranks of elite hunters in Animal Hunter: Wild Shooting and prove your mettle in the wilderness. Are you ready to track, target, and triumph as the ultimate deer hunter? Lace up your boots, load your firearm, and embark on the adventure of a lifetime in the world of precision hunting!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy Animal Hunter: Wild Shooting committed to the action!\"],\"Fun Fun Studio\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nPsnpDQ7mlnAw2g8d9lNGW9dL3QURxkVM194D3MDF6lSWp1lncbhRkwppwaHgoBjJTbC\"],null,[163,158,129,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false