mN2-5FaWzeWt1sT8V08wNuw7bZb1J19LRecQYabaDfBOyLqNx_UvUjO4d9ogZfv6mFzATysFxtRNxSdStar4DkSciW3ku6OWwAWjW3oJOdiVk9VUcKZkfy-Mvg_xrqJqsDefItvR7y4zf0zpJdzghKQVSbMm6SA-Q9WqXLZT1WFcnKSJbCegF8JYY_CuHKlU89GUkHOqcJ8dorfYNmy1OrOhcWschboTIzyjMPhdKv5IWBks2Bg9VBbi5QrhQrt9P84T_d_lo\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YK6oI5vOj5M/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Tricky Prank: Brain Quest, where you’ll put your mind to the tricky quest and test your mind with the most hilarious and brain teasing challenges! Think outside the box, use smart strategies to find clever clues and outsmart the pranksters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHOW TO PLAY:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Think Fast: Observe each scene carefully and use your logic to discover the context.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔍 Spot the Clue: Think outside the box and use creativity to overcome each challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e 🎭 Find Out The Prank: Tap, swipe, drag, or combine objects in the right order to execute your prank.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Beat All Levels: Solve every brain teasing puzzle and become the prank master.\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e✨Creative Puzzle: Imaginative and unpredictable storylines with an endless stream of trending memes. \\u003cbr\\u003e✨Unique Game Mechanics: Every level introduces surprising twists and humorous turns that test your smart thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨Humorous and Entertaining: Get ready to laugh as you solve tricky problems in the most unexpected ways.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love whimsical storylines, humorous contexts and surprise challenge puzzles, let’s try Tricky Prank: Brain Quest.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and find out all the clues to track down the pranksters!\"],\"HIGAME Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qq7QyhIDo4sdBMKQV5WrwMZ3LDvUXmHOJTGJh5DS_-5qqimjLkrj8MdhVIieTWbPSNomfc3lfuXXv0W19WSBaII\"],null,[118,115,114,255]],null,[\"Every