ll,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VLIMRVypMGA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Kick off the action!\\u003cbr\\u003eA football frenzy has taken over Bermuda in the new Fire Kickoff event. Jump into the special football field, turn into a football, and advance from the qualifiers to the championship stage for exclusive rewards and glory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Football Pitch]\\u003cbr\\u003eFactory in Bermuda has transformed into a football pitch, bringing faster-paced combat to the battlefield. If you are eliminated early in a match, you may get a chance to enter a 1v1 revival duel. Win and return straight to the fight.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Play as a Football]\\u003cbr\\u003eInteractive devices are now available in both Battle Royale and Clash Squad. Turn into a football for a limited time to move and jump around, and let teammates kick you in a chosen direction. Use it to rush in, escape danger, or create chaos on the field!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Football-Themed Combat]\\u003cbr\\u003eThe new Football Blast is here, along with a red card finishing move and a football-themed animation when players are knocked down.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Event Page]\\u003cbr\\u003eGo from rookie to world champion. Complete tasks and play matches to earn tokens, unlock football skills, take on the shooting QTE mini-game, and claim exclusive rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFree Fire is a world-famous survival shooter game available on mobile. Each 10-minute game places you on a remote island where you are pit against 49 other players, all seeking survival. Players freely choose their starting point with their parachute, and aim to stay in the safe zone for as long as possible. Drive vehicles to explore the vast map, hide in the wild, or become invisible by proning under grass or rifts. Ambush, snipe, survive, there is only one goal: to survive and answer the call of duty.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFree Fire, Battle In Style!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Survival shooter in its original form]\\u003cbr\\u003eSearch for weapons, stay in the play zone, loot your enemies and become the last man standing. Along the way, go for legendary airdrops while avoiding airstrikes to gain that little edge against other players.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[10 minutes, 50 players, epic survival goodness awaits]\\u003cbr\\u003eFast and Lite gameplay - Within 10 minutes, a new survivor will emerge. Will you go beyond the call of duty and be the one under the shining lite?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[4-man squad, with in-game voice chat]\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate squads of up to 4 players and establish communication with your squad at the very first moment. Answer the call of duty and lead your friends to victory and be the last team standing at the apex.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Clash Squad]\\u003cbr\\u003eA fast paced 4v4 game mode! Manage your economy, purchase weapons, and defeat the enemy squad!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Realistic and smooth graphics]\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to use controls and smooth graphics promises the optimum survival experience you will find on mobile to help you immortalize your name among the legends. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Contact us]\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer Service: https://ffsupport.garena.com/hc/en-us\"],\"GARENA INTERNATIONAL I\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gCqKm2I9J_UYBHsDOr1JdlBoG4kmBexI6FaY60s_E6j-m5ktRM645ybBcSuhFSdgNF6U_t8g_cYH7Em_i4rzMA\"],null,[136,164,195,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,