 puzzle game that will challenge your mind and entertain you with a fun story. Each level presents a tricky situation that will test your problem-solving skills and keep you hooked. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis brain puzzle game is designed to provide stress relief while keeping your brain sharp. Whether you\\u0026#39;re looking for a brain game to pass the time or a puzzle story to immerse yourself in, this game has it all. Get ready for endless fun and brain-teasing challenges in this ultimate puzzle game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Engaging brain puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e- Captivating fun story\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenging tricky situations\\u003cbr\\u003e- Addictive puzzle gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Perfect for stress relief\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and start your brain-boosting adventure!\"],\"Brames\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wgweu4vuGcwQYDoNdEKYMekJDEKkM2T0btW7LhcKxblOV4KQ2NbtVRuE2A_1e_eON7rPyjXbETZ6wWL6HaXzmok\"],null,[251,252,252,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fp.helpmeplease.trickystories\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fp.helpmeplease.trickystories\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u00