k more addictive AMAZE maze paint puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch out! AMAZE gets harder as you play, color and paint the maze, and fill in crossy road puzzles!\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level is a canvas - paint with going balls!\\u003cbr\\u003ePainting the maze puzzles sounds easy, but you have to be super strategic to color maze runner and fill every square. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake sure you fill in puzzles as a maze runner COMPLETELY! If you don’t fill it with going balls , even one square, you’re stuck in the paint maze FOREVER!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLet\\u0026#39;s pop this maze with color crossy road!\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003eMesmerizing Maze Runner Puzzles: Dive into a world of challenging puzzles that will test your strategic crossy road skills. Paint your way to victory by swiping the ball through the maze, filling each square with vibrant colors.\\u003cbr\\u003eArtistic Challenge: Become a true maze artist! To conquer each level with going balls, you must think ahead and plan your moves carefully. The puzzles start easy, but watch out—each new maze brings a greater challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003eAddictive Gameplay: The thrill intensifies as you progress! Can you handle the escalating difficulty? Every completed maze unlocks new addictive challenges that will keep you hooked.\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless Exploration: With countless levels to conquer, AMAZE!!! offers endless entertainment. Explore new dimensions of painting puzzles, and discover the satisfaction of conquering even the trickiest mazes.\\u003cbr\\u003eCAUTION:\\u003cbr\\u003eMind the Gaps: Precision is key! Fill in each square strategically. Leave no gap unpainted, or risk being trapped in the paint maze forever.\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready for an amazing journey of color, strategy, and endless fun. Can you paint your way to victory and conquer the maze? Play AMAZE!!! now and challenge yourself on the go!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our Privacy Policy: https://crazylabs.com/privacy-policy/\"],\"CrazyLabs LTD\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/__eqwIVBy6Nj1mz-yD592X7bJCatKlaz0a3J_9haKD2pa6cAEQws60Himv5xzGFfRlNE9ZmEEd38TTgZhxV6\"],null,[225,177,125,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.crazylabs.amaze.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.crazylabs.amaze.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $14.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"sniper.war.target.soldier.shooter.aldagames.com\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/75K0gIcTq9VlnOHwKB5Iz5tCVVxMmL2bXWlPT_FbytKAeOLmgvcQTH1UV0y-3bN4S3J5y_KX3v-NI8TzBp