niper: War FPS Shooter\",[\"4.5\",4.488778],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsniper.war.target.soldier.shooter.aldagames.com\\u0026rdid\\u003dsniper.war.target.soldier.shooter.aldagames.com\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsniper.war.target.soldier.shooter.aldagames.com\"]],[\"qgKAARp+CKUBShMIyufr5qf9lAMVowmzBh0iywaL+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugJRCjUKL3NuaXBlci53YXIudGFyZ2V0LnNvbGRpZXIuc2hvb3Rlci5hbGRhZ2FtZXMuY29tEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBACCgQIBRAB\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eBecome the ultimate invisible predator in the most realistic sniper game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to \\u003cb\\u003eGhost Sniper: War FPS Shooter\\u003c/b\\u003e, the premier \\u003cb\\u003emilitary offline\\u003c/b\\u003e experience where precision is the only thing between victory and defeat. As an elite \\u003cb\\u003eghost sniper\\u003c/b\\u003e, you are deployed into high-stakes missions across the globe. Experience intense \\u003cb\\u003e3D gun shooter\\u003c/b\\u003e action that demands tactical mastery and a steady hand in the heat of a total \\u003cb\\u003ewar strike\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🌍 Global Battlefields \\u0026amp; Tactical Missions\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is not just another shooting gallery. Our \\u003cb\\u003eaction war\\u003c/b\\u003e game takes you to the world’s deadliest conflict zones:\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eThe Middle East (Iraq \\u0026amp; Afghanistan):\\u003c/b\\u003e Engage targets in dusty urban labyrinths and guard strategic outposts in vast desert landscapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eEastern Europe:\\u003c/b\\u003e Navigate the chilling atmosphere of abandoned cities and desolate industrial ruins.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eAfrica:\\u003c/b\\u003e Neutralize threats across wide-open savannas and volatile border crossings.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eSouth \\u0026amp; Central American Jungles:\\u003c/b\\u003e Hunt down \\u003cb\\u003eguerilla\\u003c/b\\u003e insurgents in dense tropical foliage where every shadow hides a secret.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎯 Advanced Physics \\u0026amp; Realistic 3D Graphics\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience a true \\u003cb\\u003e3D sniper\\u003c/b\\u003e simulation powered by a cutting-edge physics engine:\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eTrue Ballistics:\\u003c/b\\u003e Master the art of the long shot. Calculate for wind speed, bullet drop (gravity), and target movement.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eRealistic Combat:\\u003c/b\\u003e High-fidelity animations and destructible environments make every \\u003cb\\u003ewar strike\\u003c/b\\u003e feel impactful.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eAAA Visuals:\\u003c/b\\u003e Console-quality textures and dynamic lighting bring the battlefield to life on your mobile device.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🔫 Deadly Arsenal \\u0026amp; Customization\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose your weapon from a massive collection of military-grade gear:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Legendary bolt-action rifles, semi-auto snipers, and suppressed firearms for \\u003cb\\u003estealth\\u003c/b\\u003e operations.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eDeep Customization:\\u003c/b\\u003e Upgrade your scopes, magazines, barrels, and stocks to build the perfect tool for \\u003cb\\u003emilitary shooting\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🛠 Key Game Features:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eOffline Shooter:\\u003c/b\\u003e No internet? No problem. Enjoy the full campaign anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eFPS Action:\\u003c/b\\u003e Immersive first-person perspective designed for maximum combat flow.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eTactical Ops:\\u003c/b\\u003e Plan your approach, utilize cover, and remain a ghost until the mission is complete.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eModern Warfare:\\u003c/b\\u003e Face a variety of enemies, from elite units to hidden guerilla cells.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eFree to Play:\\u003c/b\\u003e Experience the complete \\u003cb\\u003ewar game\\u003c/b\\u003e experience for free.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the ranks of the world\\u0026#39;s most elite marksmen. Download \\u003cb\\u003eGhost Sniper: War FPS Shooter\\u003c/b\\u003e now and prove you are the best shot in the business.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOne shot, one kill. Leave no trace.\"],\"Alda Games\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BL0sMsACQSVCImraWXLDGFOOU6Z5nrLQG2dpo_RPhda5i_MzYG_aDp6bYbzaAxt75IWtlgrE03xbnlfr6B-hdw\"],null,[219,195,163,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsniper.war.target.soldier.shooter.aldagames.com\\u0026rdid\\u003dsniper.war.target.soldier.shooter.aldagames.com\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $199.