cCvykKBDtSpTuZeg8zpYXp2i5YOYtOg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pOyp0q3rbGf0y8YOARD3VffsJQkVo-GtMD7VAESNVv7Mqc-JcNPE2t5QEvgcMNqJpy0s\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fXyHFFE9r8u3fNjhscqgg7XZFpf1SgtNg1PN61HjbTXZlmR4tCpyxKoKJjUSXNsZZ--9\"]]],\"Travel Town - Merge Adventure\",[\"4.6\",4.578939],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dio.randomco.travel\\u0026rdid\\u003dio.randomco.travel\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dio.randomco.travel\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIqAFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6Ai4KGAoSaW8ucmFuZG9tY28udHJhdmVsEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"JuSBvIKDuoE\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:JuSBvIKDuoE?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:JuSBvIKDuoE\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezn_JK80f6qjMMXu7GikJN1gnnuHeXia5HZsG8d4QuPTJvJJsZ1ulmI07NpQfR4660cyM8MeNW2Ilp4ymedCxlzEiLsVrvCJfnz9c8XQPr0zoJSvfhVZlOfG2Gf51MS63dLVOt1uyHT1G9IDxGdvES_60tCzz9ap85WKDMeGxP1pcH6bzoq0tvV66I0vQFex2Omsz-ka33LA4lCY6MIu-Eg7htIqw5i3ZCOS23wcKhxW0gFhkAjrBWvrDk0k4ywd4JQKMrFM0fUVhx3kFIJsLoiM6kwNL6Yvp1kmWiQI58Dhg2oE1h3X7JRW5pAVBkc\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JuSBvIKDuoE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Explore Travel Town, where you can combine everything into better and more useful items while you travel the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReveal secrets as you discover yourself and help the friendly people of Travel Town!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTRAVEL TOWN FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003d\\u003d Merge Objects \\u003d\\u003d\\u003cbr\\u003e• Discover over 500 fantastic objects through hundreds of levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Freely drag objects around the beautiful world and merge 2 of a kind evolve them into more superior items!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fulfill missions for the townsfolk to unlock more amazing items!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003d\\u003d Meet New Villagers \\u003d\\u003d\\u003cbr\\u003e• Discover 55 villagers who live in Travel Town, and help them restore their seaside town!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match objects to upgrade them and unlock more and more items to support you on your journey!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003d\\u003d Rebuild the Town \\u003d\\u003d\\u003cbr\\u003e• A storm has ravaged Travel Town - Collect coins and bring the town back to its former beauty!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Discover and upgrade dozens of buildings and improve the town beyond your wildest dreams!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Travel Town on Facebook and Instagram for exclusive offers and bonuses!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: facebook.com/TravelTownGame/\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: instagram.com/traveltowngame/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/terms.html\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/privacy.html\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Contact us in the game by clicking on Settings \\u0026gt; Contact Us\\u003cbr\\u003eOur support is also ready and waiting at:  https://support.traveltowngame.com/\"],\"Magmatic Games LTD\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bRZw0LpvlDRc98oERTVGnZIayTP_4ZwCBOfJYvCPnrmxOa_9TZIY2yG3VwCVktLUOanCIiwcrGQl1MLNVOYhiw\"],null,[91,206,253,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u00