ohY29tLnN5dWJlc3RnYW1lcy50ZWFjaGVyc2ltdWxhdG9yEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"Ready to step into the classroom and rule your school? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this exciting teacher game, YOU are the star of the show! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to catch sneaky cheaters, break up fights, handle the pop quiz, and get your students through each tricky test, all while you try to keep your cool under pressure. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s time to see if you’ve got what it takes to be a teacher, or the one evil teacher that everyone dreads!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake charge of your class, from marking papers to crafting lessons that actually make learning fun. You’ll have to manage behaviour and discipline rowdy students, stop the bullies, and be a mentor who inspires, all while you take control of the chaos of school life. Every decision you make has a ripple effect, will you be the school teacher everyone loves, or the one they try to avoid at all costs?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Catch cheaters red-handed and send them to the principal (nobody’s getting away with it!).\\u003cbr\\u003e- Handle pop quizzes and tricky exams, your students will either shine or… not.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Grade papers with care and precision, and watch your students’ results unfold.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Break up fights, stop the bullies, and manage your classroom like a pro.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Build your teaching style - make choices; Will you be the kind educator or the mean teacher who rules with an iron fist?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily rewards keep you motivated as you master the art of teaching (or perhaps, surviving school chaos!).\\u003cbr\\u003eNavigate school life in all its glory, there’s never a dull moment! Marking papers to disciplining students every day in the classroom is a new adventure. \\u003cbr\\u003eWill you achieve the “Best Teacher” award, or the one everyone whispers about in the corridors?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe choice is yours: conquer the classroom or tackle the chaos. Test your brain, sharpen your pencils, and prepare for a wild ride!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSUBSCRIBE TO TEACHER SIMULATOR\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eSubscribe to Teacher Simulator for all of the following benefits:\\u003cbr\\u003e* New \\u0026#39;Arts \\u0026amp; Crafts’’ Mini Game\\u003cbr\\u003e* VIP Outfit\\u003cbr\\u003e* No Ads\\u003cbr\\u003e* x2 Earnings\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eSUBSCRIPTIONS INFORMATION:\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eTeacher Simulator VIP Membership access offers two membership options:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1) A weekly subscription costing $5.49 per week after a 3 day FREE trial period.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e2) A monthly subscription costing $14.49 per month.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAfter buying this subscription, you will unlock an exclusive ‘Arts \\u0026amp; Crafts’ Mini Game to play, a VIP outfit to wear, remove non-optional ads, and x2 earning from your clients. This is an auto-renewable subscription. The payment is charged to your account after confirmation. The subscription is renewed unless you unsubscribe 24 hours before the period ends. Your account will also be charged for renewal\\u003cbr\\u003eThe prices notes are for United States customers. Pricing in other countries may change and actual charges may be converted to local currency.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnd of trial and subscription renewal:\\u003cbr\\u003e- The payment is charged to your iTunes account after a confirmation of purchase\\u003cbr\\u003e- The subscription is renewed unless you unsubscribe 24 hours before the end of the current period\\u003cbr\\u003e- The account will be charged for renewal 24 hours before the end of the current period at the standard cost of the weekly subscription\\u003cbr\\u003e- The user may manage the subscription and auto-renewal by accessing the user\\u0026#39;s account settings after purchase in the store\\u003cbr\\u003e- No cancellation of the current subscription is permitted during the active subscription period\\u003cbr\\u003e- Any unused portion of the free trial period will be forfeited when the subscription is purchased\\u003cbr\\u003eCancelling a trial or subscription:\\u003cbr\\u003e- In order to cancel a subscription during the free trial period you need to cancel it through your account in the Store. This must be done at least 24 hours before the end of the free trial period to avoid being charged.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ehttp://privacy.servers.kwalee.com/privacy/TeacherSimulatorEULA.html\"],\"Kwalee Ltd\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xeaX_dnHsUmv3dZVcNhYDpOC1w-uSGhOGnETF_hTY2pPAlO2DL2Fcw2PnFvbiH0kxA\"],null,[200,136,89,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.syubestgames.teachersimulator\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.syubestgames.teachersimulator\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $14.49 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\