-friendly interface that ensures a distraction-free gaming experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiverse Challenges: From easy levels to challenging puzzles, there’s something for everyone. New levels are added regularly to keep the game fresh and exciting.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEffortless Interface: Our clean and simple design lets you focus entirely on the game and the fun of finding hidden objects.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to Play?\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your adventure with \\u0026#39;Find Hidden Objects - Spot It!\\u0026#39; now. Relax, improve your skills, and immerse yourself in the joy of discovery. Dive right in and start your search today!\"],\"Yolo Game Studios\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4nCl3RQi11lKdEecDeq_yoahDyC8zmb1V47U0BaNHPNn9HMid-DF32Uatmz2mS8oE2M\"],null,[75,196,243,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yolo.hiddenobjects\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.yolo.hiddenobjects\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,