gQIBRAB\"],null,[null,\"Get ready for the FIFA World Cup 2026™ with the official FIFA Panini Collection by Coca‑Cola — the ultimate digital sticker album for football fans!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect, swap, and complete all 48 national teams in the most exciting Panini experience ever made.\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the nostalgia of opening sticker packs, the thrill of discovering new players, and the fun of completing your album — all from your smartphone.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart collecting today and complete your album before September 30, 2026!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the full FIFA Panini Collection experience on your device: \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Open digital sticker packs - Collect all player and special stickers - Glue them into your interactive album - Swap duplicates with collectors worldwide - Track progress and unlock milestones - Join a team of friends - Build your own Dream Team lineup - Complete challenges and earn badges  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEverything Panini fans love — now supercharged for mobile.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSCAN COCA‑COLA PRODUCTS TO UNLOCK EXTRA PACKS\\u003cbr\\u003eIn participating countries, scan:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Coca‑Cola labels\\u003cbr\\u003e- Coca‑Cola stickers\\u003cbr\\u003e- Panini packets and album covers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e…to earn free sticker packs every day.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect Coca‑Cola #AllTheFeels Team players and unlock Fan Stickers as you trade.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLOOK FOR CODES TO EARN MORE STICKERS\\u003cbr\\u003eBoost your collection by redeeming:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unique codes from physical Panini packs\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multi-use promotional codes from Panini, FIFA \\u0026amp; Coca‑Cola\\u003cbr\\u003e- McDonald’s codes for special stickers (where available)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eScan codes easily on mobile or enter them on desktop.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUNLOCK EXTRA STICKER PACKS WITH COCA-COLA PRODUCTS\\u003cbr\\u003eLook for Coca-Cola products in participating countries and scan them to earn additional sticker packs!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDELUXE PACKS\\u003cbr\\u003eWant to progress faster?\\u003cbr\\u003eDeluxe Packs give you:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 20 stickers per pack\\u003cbr\\u003e- No opening limits\\u003cbr\\u003e- Access to Deluxe-only (EFFECT) stickers\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unique Poster stickers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCOLLECT. SWAP. COMPLETE. SHARE.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re a long-time Panini fan or joining the tradition for the first time, the FIFA Panini Collection by Coca‑Cola delivers the most complete football collecting experience:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 48 national teams\\u003cbr\\u003e- 528 player stickers\\u003cbr\\u003e- Logos, mascots, trophies \\u0026amp; more\\u003cbr\\u003e- Coca‑Cola exclusive collections\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily rewards for returning players\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAccessibility Statement: the Accessibility Statement is available from the «More» menu inside the game.\"],\"Panini S.p.A.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Mvl9giZTbtEiv4voAaib8G9AO1TIYT0wp-UwOvUjzfzjduWKtx2ChnwnTKgKL6pDLa7boLJqP0xEimAJHlUq\"],null,[141,15,80,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\