e way you like it!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe know, this is the DIY coloring game you were looking for!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your phone case, earbuds, headphones with the tons of coloring features we have!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose your favorite happy color, draw, mix and paint, pop it and spray paint all over the phone case!\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome a colorfy master at drawing phone cases, create stickers, spray paint all over them and enjoy designing with this coloring game. All kinds of unique combinations to draw in your coloring game of choice. \\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to unlock a happy color world of dye, mix and paint, and slime art design.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePAINTING PHONE CASES - Craft eye-catching, personalized phone cases with endless colors and patterns to showcase your style!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePAINTING HEADPHONES - Unleash your creativity by designing stylish, colorful headphones to match your phone case.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePAINTING EARBUDS - Customize your earbuds with vibrant colors and unique patterns for a perfectly coordinated look!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLEADERBOARD - Climb the ranks and show off your phone case design skills to the world on the global leaderboard!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePROFILE CUSTOMIZATION - Express yourself by personalizing your profile and let everyone see your unique style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eREPAIRING PHONE CASES: Become a pro at fixing and restoring damaged phone cases, bringing them back to life with your creativity!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eACRYLIC ART - Acrylic color and tie dye art on your Phone Case!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSTICKERS - Choose many cool stickers for a fancy look\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCLEAN IT - Clean your phone from dust and mud before you draw and decorate it\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSo how about you make it super pretty with some serious customization work? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your creative mind and splash some color on this phone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake it glow! Make it bling! Make it glitter! Make it yours!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app\"],\"CrazyLabs LTD\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iQSAWM1PAixuS51AXXJHfQGBKgyL62mCGCgSf1fPzslNdGnlcUZ92n_YefkUfcqZp1G7SGZ3X0uQgcIU7p1i\"],null,[110,194,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.newnormalgames.phonecasediy\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.newnormalgames.phonecasediy\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $12.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.moto.wheelie.balance\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iTIqCu6PT6ZGN7qyLzsxxYVzwwwTrXx9b80nLzYMVGqW-V8qtip6AyVH5gjtR1_q4f71-mxoUQCa5-uAAw6-\"],null,[91,88,78,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XwYawgCZ4ZsUs0wsMFEad6w2f_FCsCJqGcK7SQ4kHD8754kM-nqXCqUyW2zQHpoL3uw9Zw8DtEwjbRaf1omxHQ\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8qcjbJknpkawX7FeNwKd860XecwT6qjC3x1CJ0kOR1xfZMtnE6Js0RuCVXkpM_b9yx1SdxtjV2ss69Ou3AlodA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DTG6lw5o3lo69Oi7qha1vMCnoW-jot8PAy5yAhabfxLBbTksftLke1FbD9neHBlx1bjbt0RlwntxIeHUnbvmiw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W5JQYqIIvipPFN__9ykh09BOJ1RvUcr_0bPov9iWHdhPXa2LRP25wAqRvRJRXKlm1NdcZDk1FJw3pBSB7eYCMg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bKdUIAbvLXUoJFpeADyVpdGDRATkhZGi5dcBQvBjLFYUKARDFaypJ9pJSbV4v45ypNc1qrSEbQIK_plFhHwgEw\"]]],\"Wheelie Life: Moto Stunt\",[\"3.9\",3.9375],\"Racing\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.moto.wheelie.balance\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.moto.wheelie.balance\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.moto.wheelie.balance\"]],[\"qgJxGm8IsgFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6ARcKFQjW1syMvZKQjEMSCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgoeChhjb20ubW90by53aGVlbGllLmJhbGFuY2UQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgFEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Master the art of the wheelie in 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗲𝗹𝗶𝗲 𝗟𝗶𝗳𝗲: 𝗠𝗼𝘁𝗼 𝗦𝘁𝘂𝗻𝘁! 🏍️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome an elite rider and show off your moto skills in the most satisfying bike balance game. Your wheelie goal is simple: keep the front bike wheel in the air as long as possible. This moto challenge requires elite precision to navigate through every bike track in your Wheelie Life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the elite thrill as you tilt and accelerate your moto at the right moment to maintain the perfect wheelie. From moto city streets to mountain bike paths, every elite track is a new test for a moto stunt master.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📦 𝗛𝗶𝗴𝗵𝗹𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝘀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePull epic wheelie stunts and break bike distance records.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock a variety of elite motorcycles and professional moto dirt bikes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster realistic physics-based moto and bike control in Wheelie Life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore different elite maps from moto urban to nature bike trails.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your elite rider and unique moto bike style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ 𝗠𝗼𝘁𝗼 𝗚𝗮𝗺𝗲 𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝘀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple and intuitive wheelie tilt or touch controls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless bike gameplay with increasing elite difficulty.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHigh-quality moto graphics and smooth bike animations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAddictive ASMR-style moto engine sounds for an elite experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGlobal wheelie leaderboards to compete with moto friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you hold the bike balance and become the elite king of the road? Run, flip, and dominate the moto world in 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗲𝗹𝗶𝗲 𝗟𝗶𝗳𝗲: 𝗠𝗼𝘁𝗼 𝗦𝘁𝘂𝗻𝘁! 🚀\"],\"iJ Sound\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oCCro4370J0-KfjLoRupik6-JUVoUXUcr6z9wbBc3-N8a8_Wuc0wsKfLDH3J_Kth98vT41Kyx69p7MYCNFEbpA\"],null,[77,45,32,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,