FLD_SZPE-SMDn3Ulq84TDXzylrvPYs_CDgeGhMkMtI34Kus7AmDxZQIo4ayHq3CNzM3fA66UZuPDwbDNMICxfpzQhGlpQcKf1QatIfqVLXQyjycko5ThQ-_9GjV9DKqR4KupwCP5BzKoRpqHu7EvzrpdfZmq1TB6UiA-gj3aNfsSf0nYNG2L5FrJtSttc_GxxFCan34D8GRrl4\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7L0riMWzEKg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Best Racing Game ever with approximately 250 Million downloads! Try to build your own Bridge by competing with others for collectible blocks! You should look out for potential looters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the adventure with more than 1000 levels that contain mechanisms such as sliders, trampolines, zip-lines, ladders, and elevators! Collect blocks of your own color and build bridges with them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe main features of the game include:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Customize the Color of the Character and Blocks: You can play with more than 80 different types of characters, choose more than 30 blocks, and more than 30 colors! Customize your character skins but also the color of the character!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Bundles: You can also get bundles containing exciting characters, blocks, and unique character animations!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Road Map: You can see your road map and get back to the same level in order to get better results maybe even perfection! You can play all around the world in different cities!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Leaderboard: Be faster and collect more and get more stars in order to climb up in the leaderboard!\\u2028\"],\"Supersonic Studios LTD\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/asv8-slFqeClGXBmtoWgjrr9npGArM5du7q3-N5VR1y_KBpkAgpn-5eypm9MT8nkbig\"],null,[41,213,255,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/goog