\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:OGI71LYBmk0\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkoRKi-8k67DmD0hVg-3mzn4HLUFcY5UmiDezaZ5hM6dWhcQhw9lKBpMnFH9SIjYuT4jUpFNOD6K9wNJcKaHPVXbDzt-0kEi3zRmkUjVNcQIy06mSESvkVHXFe4YL0aZTTC1hd3gIdhXUyH_LZ58GUZFUeNBvkEQAJS4zrIA7uBFzVGVFNbWYHsubu5QnM1lnmBLhi_tCQY2R9Y4fc_7gBu3-fUd-IwlJ6Nw5GA3PHv71LGS3p8oizgLa5uod_Hz7npfY0IykY7q5aJ8B7Kz67avsjkbBJTOw2-4EuAZln9ITmi7Iq4Ob1mFfrgl3A\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OGI71LYBmk0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"🏡 \\u003cb\\u003eA FUN-GI TO BE AROUND\\u003c/b\\u003e 👩\\u200d🌾\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCalling all entrepreneurial farmers: come dive into a fantastic arcade-style simulator game where you can build and customize your own farm! Unlock an exciting array of plants, tools, and lands that you can cultivate to your heart’s content as you progress through the story, all while improving your business skills. Download Little Farm Story today and let your fantasies and garden blossom!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLike every good business story you start off from a humble background and a tiny, simple farm. Expand your business by catering to your customer’s wishes as you clear land to plant more crops and open more workshops to keep that money flowing. Farming has never been this fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFRUITFUL FEATURES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVariety is the spice of life – From a vast array of plants to diverse workshops and buildings, the possibilities are endless as you build your dream farm. Construct houses and tractors, then reap your fields of bountiful harvest to craft delicious products, delighting your customers in the process. There’s always something new to discover and add to your offerings, keeping you entertained for hours on end.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eZen gardening – Sure there’s a time and place for games that involve timers and clocks and deadlines… but this ain’t one of ‘em! Kick back and relax as you build your family farm, never once worrying about deadlines that might kill the mood. Whether you have just a few minutes or a half hour to kill, you’ll always feel relaxed and cool as a cucumber after dipping your toes in the game, ready to take on the world after your farming reprieve.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMix business with pleasure – Here you’ll get to cultivate both crops and your entrepreneurial spirit! As a farmer you’ll have to learn to strategize, manage resources, and make crucial decisions so that you can make the most of your land while also getting top dollar from your customers. This fantastic game of plants and produce allows you to hone your business skills while growing crops and building your agricultural empire from the ground up, all without breaking a sweat.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBEHOLD THE FRUITS OF YOUR LABOR\\u003c/b\\u003e🍇\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLeave your stressful real-world life behind and hop on into this enchanting farm game where you can immerse yourself in a relaxing game of agricultural bliss. Whether you’re tending to your rancho, customizing every aspect of your farm, or discovering new varieties of plants that you can grow and sell, there’s always something fun waiting for you – plus, as you cultivate your farm, you’ll also be honing valuable business skills. So max your relaxing and try out Little Farm Story today!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_Ao51dlRfB41KF7np6QY_Def_KugNns8f3QRZSu28_ORy2Dm7iAqmMhPdTVdysz6PghHfQvu27ECViTPSRRmtQ\"],null,[192,164,17,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null