re/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgames.sorting\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playgames.sorting\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgames.sorting\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IugFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjEKGwoVY29tLnBsYXlnYW1lcy5zb3J0aW5nEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"9LvD3WlKsWg\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:9LvD3WlKsWg?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:9LvD3WlKsWg\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznxeZNvdg6PLhvfSxlR90hitUh8iMiAt01tz0jgFYKZZKNtn7kvhEBRMIZf55YqXyfJZ2U4T0CYze8Z13J3S9Kzwop8eXgkNertrwnxJ85y5q35KWbSiDVZq_O82QhWAZO85ptIjk1XZlZi_L9U6zBFLU3eh0A99hAu5Fak5Cn07u3Q-BIJJjIjZaae9dnfLHyD8kG5qBpjnYtW-XxzhN9sAnjoCpcPNyc5PLVzfz5W4mAe5AWfsPj1iYAPKvQYfVBWxXo_m4aGBQMmnqK3ENrPUXs4gte1Y1iID62l5tQQskp_3f2gBtYXXWsKPVg\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9LvD3WlKsWg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Embark on the ultimate sorting adventure around the world! Sort Journey combines relaxing match-3 puzzle gameplay with exciting travel exploration. Match and organize items from exotic destinations while journeying through stunning global locations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePack your bags and sort your way across the globe! From the bustling markets of Marrakech to the serene temples of Kyoto, match 3 identical travel items to clear your luggage and unlock new destinations. Strategic sorting meets world discovery in this fresh take on puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJOURNEY FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 1000+ Challenging Levels - Explore dozens of countries and continents\\u003cbr\\u003e✈️ Stunning Travel Graphics - Visit beautifully designed world landmarks\\u003cbr\\u003e🎒 Hundreds of Unique Items - Sort souvenirs, snacks, and travel essentials\\u003cbr\\u003e📍 Global Destinations - Journey from Paris to Tokyo, Rio to Cairo\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Relaxing Yet Strategic - Easy to learn, challenging to master\\u003cbr\\u003e💎 Helpful Travel Boosters - Power-ups to overcome tricky challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 Play Offline Anywhere - No WiFi required for your puzzle journey\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Regular Updates - New destinations and seasonal events added\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch 3 identical items to clear them from your travel pack. Sort strategically to organize all items before moves run out. Use special boosters when you\\u0026#39;re stuck. Complete levels to unlock new countries and collect cultural items from each destination. Progress through your world journey and become a global sorting master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSORT \\u0026amp; EXPLORE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach destination brings new items to discover - French pastries in Paris, Japanese tea sets in Tokyo, Egyptian artifacts in Cairo, and tropical fruits in Brazil. Your sorting adventure takes you to markets, airports, hotels, and iconic landmarks around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Sort Journey now and start your worldwide puzzle adventure! Whether you\\u0026#39;re looking for a relaxing brain teaser or a challenging match-3 experience, your global sorting journey awaits.\"],\"Bluetile\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jxaXldr4VT0gHZPjCnpbh5ISDxQyTUaIlShZc4Gb7ECioljynxqaoEbpaNFtYUeSBi1l4GiPdITPBPCME6j_2Q\"],null,[239,181,135,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent