QMVD6aEZaG3dZntr_3u8QYcutNukhpgNcL3GyFl139CK3M_pHNwh-zjq_QY19VK1k81932wQny85FRuW1zbnExFyx6W8M7SHUrgc9H4eVsqk9Z_2OQKBmiOs4yhjpcUUmQaH2J4Bp6VsC_UJOTleeSnHsUAwHdICAaZFbXENsf3RtXBGXqR8l1vqAOvuvdO6T8kCTt9pdRcA4n3WdMM\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r93gpU_YlZk/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"A brand new version of the world-famous multiplayer game with bowmen! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you like exciting shooting games, gun games, especially archery games, join the fun and unique battles in the action game Bowmasters! Here you will find various types of arrows, hone your archery skills in unusual duels, and you will be able to compete for first place in a multiplayer games for skilled archers. Shoot from your favorite bow and become a legendary shooter!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures of the shooting game Bowmasters:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 60+ INSANE CHARACTERS from all dimensions absolutely for free! Try everyone and choose the archer you want to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 60+ DIFFERENT WEAPONS for total mayhem, also awesome fatalities with rag-doll physics! We assure you, not all gun games have such a choice. Take a gun and make an accurate shot!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- MULTIPLE GAME MODES. Shoоt birds or fruits down, defeat the enemies in duels and get money for that! Aim and hit the bull\\u0026#39;s eye!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- ENDLESS REWARDS FOR YOUR SKILLS! Do you like not only to play action games, but also to get rewards? Welcome! Take everything if you can!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- UNIVERSAL SEASON PASS: 5 season passes for archery so you can shoot without limits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShooter, don’t miss out on the fun! Be the first archer in action battles in multiplayer shooting games. Get your bow, grab an arrow, and dive into archery and gun shooting in Bowmasters! You\\u0026#39;ll see, shooter games have never been so exciting!\"],\"Playgendary Limited\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qvcVPuIUWAsJeeOpMPbCspUaBK625V_7nMDZWHNtVe2_u15THD_ERPOnM6Yc3vNdNC7QZ7Mgr8DkK89AHvTg\"],null,[71,44,81,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood and Gore, Suggestive Themes\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgendary.bowmasters\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playgendary.bowmasters\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]],null,null,null,[[[[\"playpass_family\",39]]],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/pass\"]]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Artillery shooter\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.playrix.gardenscapes\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DyprR0O5Osx9CUYp0rG59kj3cGi69rZ5LJXbrp8gKkxKOoGehVzK_YRi6ODYG6-hV9EEZiWVAtubqbvqMvPr\"],null,[6,189,0,255],nu