iFpyjcdUN7E85qAcapJuqnF4Q0KGOQCjVl\"]],[null,2,[2459,1843],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-prEACXpAUQ7YGT71TKoDBKtjyt0VWOtMnBSpDBoYJ-TvqcRca-mE4g_AM1i17gpwDXP9BtXBn97znqBJOjI\"]]],\"Backspin Games: Earn Money\",[\"4.6\",4.593985],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.backspingames.backspin\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.backspingames.backspin\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.backspingames.backspin\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIwgFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjYKIAoaY29tLmJhY2tzcGluZ2FtZXMuYmFja3NwaW4QARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🎮 Play Games, Compete \\u0026amp; Earn Real Rewards\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn money by playing the games you love. BackSpin Games lets you compete against \\u003cb\\u003ereal players at your skill level\\u003c/b\\u003e and earn real rewards ...all from your phone. Cash out via \\u003cb\\u003eAmazon Gift Cards\\u003c/b\\u003e or \\u003cb\\u003eBank Transfer\\u003c/b\\u003e whenever you\\u0026#39;re ready.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo subscriptions. No paywalls. No pay-to-win. Just fair games and real rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e⚔️ COMPETE AGAINST REAL PLAYERS\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery match in BackSpin is a real contest between two people. You both get the \\u003cb\\u003eexact same game setup\\u003c/b\\u003e — same starting layout, same pieces, same power-ups. The only difference is how you play.\\u003cbr\\u003eWe match you with players at your level, so every game feels fair and fun — whether you\\u0026#39;re just getting started or you\\u0026#39;ve been playing for months.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎮 10+ GAMES TO CHOOSE FROM\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePick the games you enjoy most:\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 \\u003cb\\u003ePuzzle \\u0026amp; match\\u003c/b\\u003e — test your speed and focus\\u003cbr\\u003e🃏 \\u003cb\\u003eCard \\u0026amp; strategy\\u003c/b\\u003e — outsmart your opponent\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 \\u003cb\\u003eArcade \\u0026amp; casual\\u003c/b\\u003e — quick rounds, fast results\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 \\u003cb\\u003eTrivia \\u0026amp; word\\u003c/b\\u003e — show what you know\\u003cbr\\u003eNew games and events are added regularly. Play one favourite or try them all — it\\u0026#39;s up to you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e💰 EARN REWARDS, CASH OUT YOUR WAY\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay games, earn gems, and cash out. Simple.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAmazon Gift Cards\\u003c/b\\u003e — delivered instantly in the app\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBank Transfer\\u003c/b\\u003e — withdraw straight to your account\\u003cbr\\u003eNo hidden fees. You earn by playing — and you keep what you earn.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🏆 DAILY TOURNAMENTS \\u0026amp; LEAGUES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBeyond 1v1 matches, BackSpin runs daily tournaments, weekly leagues, and seasonal events. Climb the rankings, build your streak, and compete for bigger rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003eThere\\u0026#39;s always something to play — whether you have 5 minutes or an hour.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🔒 FAIR PLAY, ALWAYS\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBackSpin is built on fairness. Both players in every match receive the \\u003cb\\u003eexact same game conditions\\u003c/b\\u003e — like two dart players throwing at the same board from the same distance. No randomness, no advantages you can buy. Just skill.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e✅ WHY PLAYERS CHOOSE BACKSPIN\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eReal competition\\u003c/b\\u003e — play against actual people, not bots\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSame game for both players\\u003c/b\\u003e — identical conditions, every match\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMatched to your level\\u003c/b\\u003e — fair opponents, fair results\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCash out your way\\u003c/b\\u003e — Amazon Gift Cards or Bank Transfer\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e10+ free games\\u003c/b\\u003e — puzzle, card, arcade, trivia and more\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNo deposits needed\\u003c/b\\u003e — play for free, earn for real\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDaily tournaments\\u003c/b\\u003e — fresh competitions every day\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNo hidden fees\\u003c/b\\u003e — ever\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📥 GET STARTED\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload BackSpin Games. Pick a game. Enter a match. Beat your opponent. Cash out. Simple as that.\\u003cbr\\u003e💌 Need help? support@backspingames.com\\u003cbr\\u003e🌐 backspingames.com\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 Follow us on Instagram and TikTok\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003eBackSpin Games is a skill-based gaming platform. All competitions are decided by how you play, not by chance. What you earn depends on your results and how much you play.\\u003c/i\\u003e\"],\"Backspin Games SL\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ChnxMd-oEtwuI7rfGjf8irZrqC06554FlrisaqtBVSxdpfQoGhBo8QLgmfe22pU7818\"],null,[52,30,153,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Cash Rewards\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,