alve.connect.dots\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIxQFKEwjK5+vmp/2UAxWjCbMGHSLLBov6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjYKIAoaY29tLnBsYXl2YWx2ZS5jb25uZWN0LmRvdHMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eDot Link\\u003c/b\\u003e is an addictive new dot-connect puzzle game! Match color dots to solve this brain puzzle with thousands of fun levels to play. This game challenges you to think out of the box and train your brain – it’s perfect for anyone trying to keep their mind young!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▶️\\u003cb\\u003eDot Link is an easy-to-play dot connect game:\\u003c/b\\u003e ▶️\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️  Your mission? Connect matching color dots\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️  Match all the color dots on the board and don’t let the pipes cross!\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️  Level up to enjoy new levels and keep your mind sharp 💪 🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💌\\u003cb\\u003eThis game is for you if you like:\\u003c/b\\u003e💌\\u003cbr\\u003e1️⃣ Match Puzzle \\u0026amp; Connect games\\u003cbr\\u003e2️⃣ Beautiful minimalistic aesthetics with colorful dots and lines\\u003cbr\\u003e3️⃣ Relaxing music and satisfying game pace\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ \\u003cb\\u003eSpecial features\\u003c/b\\u003e ✅\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ 5 difficulty levels: Beginner, Intermediate, Hard, Extreme, and Insane\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Fun \\u0026amp; relaxing music and sound effects\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Easy-to-see board with Day and Night Mode and Color Blind setting\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Never miss a beat with Undo and Restart features\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Stuck? Connect every dot with the Hint feature!\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Go the extra mile by completing the Daily Puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ More than 10,000 levels\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💟 \\u003cb\\u003eHighlights\\u003c/b\\u003e 💟\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Play on any device (phone \\u0026amp; tablet friendly)\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Suitable for all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Multiple languages supported\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Dot Link costs nothing to download and play!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now \\u003cb\\u003eDot Link\\u003c/b\\u003e free on Android, one of the best match color puzzle games! Do you have what it takes to solve all the puzzles and become a true dots-connect master? 👑\"],\"Bluetile\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q8zaRbCaWucoNx0eJPVfe-ynHx2Rp5CTJoYuvF2y7CVfkxrGWF1BOAWE6JBQLngL_XK2Kl49mQlXfJeG0TJF7w\"],null,[25,55,80,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playvalve.connect.dots\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playvalve.connect.dots\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $17.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.Earthkwak.Platformer\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e8EqoEJMdQpFVNmDSi5dSmf2EZx_93y66qayc3y5FxbiGOSp38Sww6wtvlI5oZyXD6hamJ9Vtw3pEb_SaWd8